&lt;p&gt;Principal Engineer - Contract&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;About this role&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The bar has moved. Five years ago a strong engineer was measured by what they could build and how well they could mentor others to build it. Today, with Claude Code and agents, we produce quality work at a speed that would have looked superhuman in 2022 (Podium, PayPoint, Zuto, RL, OAG Analyser and others).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;What separates exceptional from good is no longer typing speed or local craftsmanship. It is the complete package: architecture, deep engineering foundations, communication, system thinking, and the judgement to direct both your own intelligence and AI toward outcomes that matter. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Exceptional people at this level are not the best implementer in the room; they are the person whose specifications, decisions, and review judgement compound into systems that work in production and that others (and agents) can build on. They are a force multiplier, they hold a room at the highest levels, and clients treat them as the SME by default.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your mindset&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The mindset is the engine, and it is almost impossible to teach retrospectively. You are outcome obsessed, not output obsessed and you care whether the problem was actually solved - you resist the ego instinct to admire a clever solution and ask whether it was needed at all.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are intellectually honest about uncertainty, taking a trust-but-verify approach and assuming the surprising bug is the one that will burn. You are deeply pragmatic, which matters at CreateFuture where pace counts: you have outgrown the religious wars about platforms, languages and patterns, you hold opinions loosely, and you decide for the systems in front of you, not the ones you wish you had.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You have a bias toward delivery: the smallest thing that works, then iterate, treating documents and meetings as means to that end. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;And you are relentlessly curious beyond any immediate need, wanting to know how the database actually stores things or why a Claude Opus inference call costs what it does, which keeps you several layers ahead while the rest of the team is still reading the API docs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;AI as the accelerant&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;For a Principal to be truly exceptional, this is now already a first-class competency in your arsenal, not a side skill. An engineer who is brilliant by last year&#39;s standards but not fluent with AI is not exceptional in 2026. In practice that means:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Setting AI up to succeed. You treat context engineering as a craft (the right files, specs, examples and constraints), and you architect systems with clean interfaces, good naming, machine-readable specs and knowledge bases so the codebase is a quality baseline AI can work on later. No separate ivory-tower architect required.&lt;br&gt;Reviewing and choosing well. You read far more code than you write, and your value is in the quality of review: catching the silent assumption, the security flaw, the architectural drift, knowing where models fail and looking there first. You pick the right tool for the job (Claude Code for a deep refactor, an inline assistant when that is enough, a sub-agent for parallel work, the right model for analysis versus generation) and you know the constraints differ by client, an enterprise like PayPoint or Natwest versus a scale-up type business like Zuto or OAG.&lt;br&gt;Working with non-determinism. You see where AI moves the bottleneck and help people left and right of you unblock the value stream. You build with AI components but know success is no longer a binary, reaching for evals, golden datasets, structured outputs and fallback paths as naturally as you reach for unit tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical breadth across the full stack&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Exceptional means depth in at least one area but competence everywhere the system reaches.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backend: an instinct for distributed systems (what fails, what is eventually consistent, where queues back up), APIs that age well, thoughtful data modelling, and an understanding that languages are mostly syntax differences you can close with AI.&lt;br&gt;Cloud: cost-aware and security-aware by default, reaching for IaC, composing the primitives rather than stitching together managed services and hoping it works.&lt;br&gt;Data: modern pipelines, governance and lineage, increasingly vector stores and embeddings, with data quality treated as seriously as production code because garbage in, garbage out is far worse once AI features depend on it.&lt;br&gt;Web and mobile: past the framework arguments, with a clear view on what you would pick today, and able to build &quot;good enough&quot; front ends yourself with AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Full-stack here means seeing the platform as one system and knowing which levers matter most. It does not mean front-end work with a few Node.js servers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;System thinking, consulting and commercial judgement&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At CreateFuture we work in a consultancy context, where many otherwise excellent IC engineers can struggle. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You know technology is roughly 30% of the picture; the rest is design, argument and reasoning, commercial and political acumen, and the clarity to frame outcomes for a COO, CTO, CIO or CEO in their own language.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You know when gold-plating is wasteful, you can name when a project&#39;s real problem is not technical and say so even when it is awkward, and you have a strong sense of what is durable versus what is fashion. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are not the engineer who introduced the team to seven new technologies last year; you are the one who removed three and quietly made the remaining stack stronger.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Leadership mentality&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Technical work is necessary but no longer sufficient. By default you raise the level of everyone around you, regardless of discipline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly and frequently (documents, decisions, post-mortems, design notes); the written artefact is the machine-readable context we can feed to AI later.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make decisions and own them. You don&#39;t escalate everything or hoard control, and you are willing to be the benevolent dictator when it is your turn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor in AI fluency, not just code: tooling, prompting and review discipline, so your team is twice as productive a year from now.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Need little line management. You communicate upwards, raise by exception, self-resolve, and can be trusted with financial controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disagree well. You tell people they are wrong with evidence and no ego, and you change your own mind when you are shown to be wrong.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What we&#39;re not looking for&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The gifted engineer who sits in a silo. This is a team game.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The one who is fluent with AI but ships without the guardrails and quality gates enterprise clients expect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The one with strong technical opinions who cannot justify them commercially and gets defensive when challenged.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The pure manager who wants to orchestrate teams rather than get involved. This is about setting a new standard, not coordinating it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The engineer who will not immerse in a client environment. This role will mean on-site work and trusted relationships built in person. We are not going back to working away from the client and being bypassed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;What-we’ll-offer-you:&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8044&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we’ll offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust people to do their best work. That means flexibility over rigid rules, impact over activity, and real investment in your growth both professionally and personally. You’ll be part of a supportive, and friendly culture, surrounded by smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer flexible working, including hybrid and remote options. Our office hubs are located in Edinburgh, Leeds, Manchester, London and Bulgaria, with occasional travel to client sites or CreateFuture offices when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust you to manage your time balancing collaboration with client time and focused work. What matters is the impact you have, not how busy you look.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We try to keep our hiring process clear, fair and respectful of your time. We aim to get back to everyone who applies and we will be upfront about where you are in the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It usually looks like this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call with our Talent Acquisition Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Role specific capability interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, we might also ask you to do a short presentation, a practical or technical task or have a values focused conversation. We will explain what is involved before anything happens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at CreateFuture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe diverse teams build better workplaces and better products. We want CreateFuture to be a place where people feel able to be themselves and do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any adjustments or support during the application process, just. We will do what we can to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Telnyx&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Telnyx is an industry leader that&#39;s not just imagining the future of global connectivity—we&#39;re building it. From architecting and amplifying the reach of a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://telnyx.com/our-network&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;private, global, multi-cloud IP network&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;, to bringing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://telnyx.com/resources/about-edge-connectivity&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;hyperlocal edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; technology right to your fingertips through intuitive APIs, we&#39;re shaping a new era of seamless interconnection between people, devices, and applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re driven by a desire to transform and modernize what&#39;s antiquated, automate the manual, and solve real-world problems through innovative connectivity solutions. As a testament to our success, we&#39;re proud to stand as a financially stable and profitable company. Our robust profitability allows us not only to invest in pioneering technologies but also to foster an environment of continuous learning and growth for our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our collective vision is a world where borderless connectivity fuels limitless innovation. By joining us, you can be part of laying the foundations for this interconnected future. We&#39;re currently seeking passionate individuals who are excited about the opportunity to contribute to an industry-shaping company while growing their own skills and careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Telnyx infrastructure team is building a next-generation platform that spans across multiple cloud providers and multiple continents. We leverage the Telnyx private backbone network with cross-connects to major cloud providers like AWS, Azure, GCP, and IBM Cloud to build a cloud-agnostic, highly available platform. With our lean team, we&#39;re currently running infrastructure in 10 PoPs and 3 continents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In This Role You Will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and deploy scalable solutions for managing databases like PostgreSQL, MySQL, Cassandra, Kafka, RabbitMQ, Redis, and others, both in virtualized environments and Kubernetes clusters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering to identify and resolve pain points in managing large-scale, high-availability database infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the migration of existing database services from VMs to Kubernetes, ensuring minimal downtime and seamless transitions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support disaster recovery, backup strategies, and performance tuning for on-premise database systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and manage observability, logging, and alerting systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-Have Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of professional experience in infrastructure operations, especially in Linux-based systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in at least one deployment and orchestration technology (Kubernetes, Ansible, or Terraform), with a focus on deploying and managing stateful applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skills in scripting languages such as Bash, Python, or similar, to automate workflows and manage infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience managing at least one relational databases like PostgreSQL or MySQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’d Be A Good Fit If You Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with non-relational databases such as Cassandra, OpenSearch, or other distributed data stores.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with streaming and messaging platforms like Kafka or RabbitMQ, including scaling and monitoring in a distributed setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in observability tools like Prometheus, Grafana, ELK stack, or others to ensure system performance and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of service discovery tools like Consul, or similar technologies, would be a great advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Opportunities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a strength multiplier to product engineering efforts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn about every technology stack used at Telnyx.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work at the intersection of the social and the technical, with growth opportunities in both.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-RH1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Telnyx&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Telnyx is an industry leader that&#39;s not just imagining the future of global connectivity—we&#39;re building it. From architecting and amplifying the reach of a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://telnyx.com/our-network&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;private, global, multi-cloud IP network&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;, to bringing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://telnyx.com/resources/about-edge-connectivity&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;hyperlocal edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; technology right to your fingertips through intuitive APIs, we&#39;re shaping a new era of seamless interconnection between people, devices, and applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re driven by a desire to transform and modernize what&#39;s antiquated, automate the manual, and solve real-world problems through innovative connectivity solutions. As a testament to our success, we&#39;re proud to stand as a financially stable and profitable company. Our robust profitability allows us not only to invest in pioneering technologies but also to foster an environment of continuous learning and growth for our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our collective vision is a world where borderless connectivity fuels limitless innovation. By joining us, you can be part of laying the foundations for this interconnected future. We&#39;re currently seeking passionate individuals who are excited about the opportunity to contribute to an industry-shaping company while growing their own skills and careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most sales roles chase new logos. This one unlocks the revenue already inside Telnyx&#39;s customer base — and there&#39;s a lot of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Growth Account Executive (Expansion)&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll take commercial ownership of established Telnyx customers after their first 12 months, identifying and closing new revenue opportunities across our product portfolio, from Voice AI and programmable communications to messaging, connectivity, and AI infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own an assigned portfolio of existing customers, identify untapped opportunities, build relationships with new stakeholders, and drive expansion from prospecting through close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t traditional account management. You&#39;re not here to simply maintain relationships or renew contracts. You&#39;re here to grow accounts by introducing new products, expanding into new business units and geographies, and helping customers build more with Telnyx.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re not farming. You&#39;re hunting inside the base.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and grow your accounts.&lt;/strong&gt; Take commercial ownership of an assigned portfolio of established customers, developing strategies to drive incremental recurring revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find untapped opportunities.&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze customer usage, product adoption, business models, and growth plans to identify opportunities for cross-selling, upselling, and geographic expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hunt within existing accounts.&lt;/strong&gt; Run targeted, personalized outbound campaigns to engage new stakeholders, departments, and decision-makers within your customer portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the expansion sales cycle.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead discovery, qualify opportunities, develop commercial proposals, negotiate terms, and close expansion deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sell across the Telnyx product portfolio.&lt;/strong&gt; Identify opportunities spanning Voice AI, SIP trunking, programmable voice, messaging, WhatsApp Business, global numbers, wireless, and AI infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build strategic relationships.&lt;/strong&gt; Develop connections with technical buyers, business leaders, and economic decision-makers to uncover new use cases and accelerate adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive measurable revenue growth.&lt;/strong&gt; Own an incremental MRR target, focusing on commercially attributable, profitable expansion rather than organic usage growth alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across teams.&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with Hunter AEs during account transitions and partner with Solutions Engineering, Customer Success, and Product teams to execute expansion strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own your forecast.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain accurate opportunities, account plans, and forecasts in Salesforce, ensuring clear visibility into pipeline health and commercial progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring customer intelligence back to Telnyx.&lt;/strong&gt; Share market insights, product feedback, and emerging customer requirements to help shape our roadmap and go-to-market strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in B2B technology sales, ideally as an Account Executive, Growth AE, or in a commercially focused business development role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated ability to generate pipeline through proactive outbound prospecting rather than relying exclusively on inbound demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hunter mentality and the commercial curiosity to identify opportunities that aren&#39;t immediately obvious.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong discovery and consultative selling skills, with the ability to connect technical capabilities to measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating multiple stakeholders and building relationships with both technical and commercial decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to independently manage opportunities, develop business cases, and move deals through a structured sales process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong account research and strategic thinking skills, including identifying whitespace and opportunities for cross-selling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort discussing technical products with developers, engineering teams, operations leaders, and executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing pipeline and forecasts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, accountable mindset with a genuine desire to own and deliver revenue results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in CPaaS, UCaaS, telecom, cloud infrastructure, AI, or developer-focused technology platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Voice AI, SIP trunking, programmable communications, WhatsApp Business API, or messaging infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous success in an expansion, cross-sell, upsell, or account-growth role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling multiple products or solutions into the same organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with MEDDPICC or another structured qualification methodology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with international or multinational customers across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Telnyx customers are already building on our infrastructure, but many are only using a fraction of what our platform can offer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A customer using us for SIP trunking might be a strong fit for Voice AI. A business operating in one country might be ready to expand across Europe. These opportunities don&#39;t always arrive as inbound requests. Someone needs to uncover them, build the business case, and turn them into revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&#39;s where you come in. You&#39;ll work on a warm base with real relationships, real usage data, and real expansion potential. The upside is there. You just have to go and find it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be measured on the incremental revenue you create, not simply the accounts you inherit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Telnyx&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real technology, built in-house.&lt;/strong&gt; We own our global network and build our communications and AI infrastructure, giving you a differentiated platform to sell.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A broad portfolio with real cross-sell potential.&lt;/strong&gt; From global connectivity and programmable communications to Voice AI and AI infrastructure, there&#39;s always another customer challenge we can solve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profitable and independent.&lt;/strong&gt; Join a company focused on sustainable growth and long-term investment in its technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;#LI-RH1&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a hands-on Senior Data Platform Engineer to build and scale enterprise data services centered on SingleStore Helios and PostgreSQL. You will combine database architecture and production engineering with data pipeline development, data curation, platform migrations, self-service enablement and cost optimization. You will work with teams across regions to deliver reliable, well-governed data services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop and optimize SingleStore and PostgreSQL schemas, SQL queries, physical data models, indexing and workload performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain reliable batch, streaming and CDC ingestion pipelines from relational databases, object storage and other enterprise sources into SingleStore; implement validation, transformation, enrichment and data curation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical assessments and migrations of existing applications and data workloads to SingleStore, while onboarding new teams, applications and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable self-service onboarding capabilities, including APIs, configuration templates, automated provisioning, access requests, pipeline deployment and operational guardrails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize cloud database spend through workload right-sizing, consolidation, scheduling and performance tuning; develop transparent SingleStore cluster, application and team-level cost allocation and showback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own production readiness and database reliability: monitoring, incident triage, root-cause analysis, recoverability, deployment controls and collaboration with SingleStore Helios support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate data quality, lineage, ownership and access controls into delivery workflows; work with the enterprise data catalog and governance teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create engineering standards, CI/CD pipelines, automated tests, documentation and cross-region handoffs that reduce manual operational work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of hands-on experience in data platform engineering, database engineering or closely related production data roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced SQL and PostgreSQL expertise, including query plans, schema design, performance tuning and operational troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python and practical experience developing production-grade ingestion and transformation pipelines, with testing and observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with distributed or cloud-managed databases and modern data integration patterns, including batch and CDC; familiarity with cloud object storage as an ingestion and staging layer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to own end-to-end technical delivery, collaborate with application teams and solve complex production issues independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love if you had&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on SingleStore (MemSQL) or SingleStore Helios experience, including pipelines, performance tuning and workload design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kafka or similar streaming platforms, infrastructure as code, CI/CD and API-driven platform automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building self-service data platforms, data quality frameworks, metadata/catalog integrations and chargeback/showback reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud FinOps, database migrations or financial-services enterprise data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Schonfeld is a global multi-manager hedge fund that strives to deliver industry-leading risk-adjusted returns for our investors. We leverage both internal and external portfolio manager teams around the world, seeking to capitalize on inefficiencies and opportunities within the markets. We draw from decades of experience and a significant investment in proprietary technology, infrastructure and risk analytics to invest across four main strategies: Quant, Tactical, Fundamental Equity and Discretionary Macro &amp;amp; Fixed Income.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Culture &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Schonfeld, we’ll invest in you. Attracting and retaining top talent is at the heart of what we do, because we believe that exceptional outcomes begin with exceptional people. We foster a culture where talent is empowered to continually learn, innovate and pursue ambitious goals. We are teamwork-oriented, collaborative and encourage ideas—at all levels—to be shared. As an organization committed to investing in our people, we provide learning and educational offerings and opportunities to make an impact. We encourage community through internal networks, external partnerships and service initiatives that promote inclusion and purpose beyond the firm’s walls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-TJ1&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Artefact is an AI-native company fusing engineering-grade delivery with strategic consulting to drive high-impact results. We specialize in accelerating end-to-end data and AI transformation, helping enterprises turn marketing into a predictable engine for business growth across the value chain. From strategy to implementation, Artefact delivers bespoke, scalable AI solutions tailored to our clients&#39; core business challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Paris, Artefact operates across 27 countries with a global team of over 2,500 employees, partnering with leading international brands across luxury, retail, FMCG, industry, healthcare, and finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To support our rapid expansion, we are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Chief of Staff to the Group CMO (Intern)&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Global Marketing team starting in &lt;strong&gt;January 2027&lt;/strong&gt; for a minimum of 6 months.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you passionate about B2B marketing, tech innovation, and generative AI? Do you want to work in an environment where your contributions directly accelerate business growth?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;Chief of Staff to the Group CMO (Intern)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will play a central role in driving Artefact’s flagship initiative: &lt;strong&gt;&quot;AI-Augmented Marketing&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;. This global project reshapes how our international marketing teams operate by embedding analytical rigor, agentic AI workflows, and operational excellence into everyday execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working directly alongside the Group CMO, you will collaborate closely with regional marketing teams, data scientists, and business analysts worldwide. Fluency in English is essential, as you will lead international workshops, align stakeholders, and scale best practices across all Artefact entities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic orchestration:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the Group CMO in executing the global &lt;em&gt;AI-Augmented Marketing&lt;/em&gt; roadmap across three core pillars :&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics &amp;amp; strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Derive actionable insights from the marketing data platform to guide executive decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic content workflows:&lt;/strong&gt; Automate content operations by building and deploying an AI skill/agent library using tools such as Gemini Enterprise, Claude, and Lovable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Scale adoption across international hubs by designing learning modules, documenting playbooks, and running hands-on training sessions in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-to-market &amp;amp; revenue operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage AI tools and skills to optimize inbound and outbound funnels, drive pipeline velocity, and enhance Marketing-Sales alignment for sustained lead generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance measurement &amp;amp; reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Build, maintain, and optimize full-funnel B2B performance dashboards (awareness, activation, ABM) to measure campaign ROI and surface continuous improvement opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and update cross-functional tracking tools, operational dashboards, and meeting cadences to maintain project momentum and organizational alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-impact copywriting &amp;amp; editorial:&lt;/strong&gt; Produce high-converting editorial assets (internal/external newsletters, landing pages, case studies, and thought leadership articles) while safeguarding brand tone and positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Master’s student from a top-tier Business School (&lt;em&gt;Grande École de Commerce&lt;/em&gt;) or equivalent university program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong data-driven problem-solving abilities; comfortable working with analytics platforms, data modeling, and reporting frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Tech native:&lt;/strong&gt; A genuine passion for emerging technologies, generative &amp;amp; agentic AI tools, and B2B growth marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; copywriting:&lt;/strong&gt; Bilingual or fluent in English (both written and spoken) with exceptional writing skills across long-form, web, and newsletter formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project management:&lt;/strong&gt; High organizational agility, rigorous attention to detail, and the ability to prioritize competing deadlines in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactive, autonomous, results-oriented, and excited to collaborate with cross-functional, international teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start date:&lt;/strong&gt; January 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration:&lt;/strong&gt; 6 months minimum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Paris Headquarters (with hybrid flexibility)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary&lt;/strong&gt; : 1200€&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt; High potential for conversion into a permanent contract (CDI) based on mutual fit and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Artefact is an equal opportunity employer. We recruit solely based on merit and business needs, fostering an inclusive environment free from discrimination of any kind.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

