&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fondée en 2014, Artefact est une société française de services autour de la data, spécialisée dans le conseil en IA, transformation data et en data &amp;amp; digital marketing. L’approche unique d’Artefact, qui fait le pont entre la donnée et le business, permet à nos clients d’atteindre leurs objectifs business de façon dédiée et efficace. Nos 2500 collaborateurs répartis dans 27 bureaux à travers le monde allient leurs compétences pluridisciplinaires au profit de l’innovation business des entreprises.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La mission des Artefactors ?&lt;/strong&gt; Transformer la data de nos clients en impact business. Dans ce sens, nous collaborons avec plus de 1000 clients, leaders de leurs industries (Orange, Carrefour, Samsung, AccorHotels, L’Oréal, LVMH, Decathlon) et sommes partenaires privilégiés de Google (GMP/GCP), AWS ainsi que Microsoft Azure.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;En tant que stagiaire Data Scientist, tu seras responsable de :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La réalisation de projets de données (sécurisation de la livraison de vos projets)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La communication de ton travail et réalisations au sein de l’équipe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travailler en étroite collaboration avec ton homologue conseil pour établir et entretenir des relations solides avec vos clients et mieux comprendre leurs besoins&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;S’assurer que tes solutions apportent des valeurs à la problématique client&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rechercher et développer de nouvelles approches techniques pour résoudre efficacement les problèmes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partager les bonnes pratiques et contribuer aux connaissances institutionnelles d’Artefact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Tu es ?&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;310&quot;&gt;Tu es étudiant(e) en dernière année de cycle ingénieur, Master 2, ou équivalent, avec une spécialisation en &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;342&quot;&gt;Data Science, Intelligence Artificielle, Mathématiques appliquées, Statistiques ou Informatique.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;441&quot;&gt;Tu es à la recherche d&#39;un stage de fin d&#39;études de 6 mois à partir de janvier&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;523&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;2027&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;537&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu possèdes une bonne compréhension de l&#39;écosystème numérique et data et de ses technologies : web analytique, programmatique, DMP, Datalake, dataviz, data science, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as un fort intérêt pour les problématiques business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as un esprit pratique et analytique, et possèdes d’excellentes compétences en résolution de problèmes, y compris la capacité de désagréger les problèmes, d’identifier les causes profondes et de recommander des solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise du français (écrit/oral) obligatoire pour le bureau de Paris pour travailler en équipe et de l’anglais professionnel pour communiquer avec nos clients internationaux&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le petit +&lt;/strong&gt; : une première expérience (stage, projet scolaire, Junior Entreprise, etc.) en conseil et/ou écosystème de données est une valeur ajoutée !&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Pourquoi nous rejoindre ?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Développement professionnel&lt;/strong&gt; : CDI à la clé (85% de conversion) ; socle de formation (onboarding, retex, café tech, deep dive de use cases tech...) développement des compétences via des outils internes innovants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Développement personnel &lt;/strong&gt;: collaborez avec les experts dans leur domaine, tu apprendras des meilleurs ; feedbacks réguliers via counsellor, managers, équipes et RH.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Environnement de travail unique &lt;/strong&gt;: flexibilité télétravail; évènements d’équipe et d’entreprise ; localisation idéale dans le 9ème arrondissement !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Socle de formation&lt;/strong&gt; (training day, Retex, café tech) développement des compétences via des outils internes innovants&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous recrutons nos collaborateurs uniquement en fonction de nos besoins et des qualités propres de chaque candidat. Nous assurons le développement de leurs compétences professionnelles et de leurs responsabilités sans discrimination d’aucune sorte. Le groupe s&#39;engage à reconnaître et promouvoir tous les talents, quelles que soient leurs croyances, âge, handicap, parentalité, origine ethnique, nationalité, identité de genre, orientation sexuelle, appartenance à une organisation politique, religieuse, syndicale ou à une minorité, ou toute autre caractéristique qui pourrait faire l&#39;objet d&#39;une discrimination.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rejoignez-nous !&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ogilvy &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ogilvy has been creating impact for brands through iconic, culture-changing, value-driving ideas since the company was founded by David Ogilvy more than 75 years ago. It builds on that rich legacy through Borderless Creativity—innovating at the intersection of intelligence, imagination and influence, with experts across advertising, sports &amp;amp; entertainment, PR &amp;amp; social, consulting, and health collaborating seamlessly across more than 120 offices spanning 90 countries. Ogilvy was named &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-brings-home-network-year-2026-cannes-lions-international-festival-creativity&quot;&gt;Network of the Year&lt;/a&gt; at the 2026 Cannes Lions International Festival of Creativity and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-tops-warc-effective-100-creative-100-4th-straight-year&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;e2c78315-ff05-4544-925f-9288319dea2c&quot;&gt;ranks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;as the #1 global agency network for creative excellence and effectiveness by WARC for the fourth consecutive year, signifying its ability to deliver creative solutions that drive unreasonable impact for clients and communities. Ogilvy is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.ogilvy.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;39833259-880d-4fd8-930f-0d84b1c14850&quot;&gt;Ogilvy.com&lt;/a&gt;, and follow us on&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;735e393e-6e8a-4ca8-804a-74f1bd8166b6&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ogilvy&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d10960ce-761b-48c5-81d5-0a7c4cc6013a&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;92ffcb70-6ca7-4d9a-88d5-c130e36e6c4f&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;3bd2010d-00a2-401b-8cfb-7e8c24deac52&quot;&gt; Facebook.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;7f087527-f491-4cb6-a79d-3b4a67d1ec89&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ogilvy Paris, est une agence de communication globale, membre du groupe WPP.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fondée par David Ogilvy, un pionnier de la publicité dont l&#39;histoire a inspiré la série &quot;Mad Men&quot;, nous sommes présents dans le monde entier et nous accompagnons les plus grandes marques. Notre mission : Making Brands Matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Concrètement, nous créons des campagnes innovantes et impactantes qui font la différence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 &lt;strong&gt;TA FUTURE DREAM TEAM :&lt;/strong&gt; Une équipe d&#39;expert.e.s du Social Media passionné.e.s, créatif.ve.s et ultra-connecté.e.s, prête à t&#39;accueillir pour faire rayonner nos clients sur l&#39;ensemble des plateformes sociales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu auras l&#39;opportunité d&#39;accompagner l&#39;équipe Account Management middle et/ou senior dans la gestion quotidienne de campagnes d&#39;envergure et le développement de la relation client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant qu&#39;&lt;strong&gt;Account Manager Social Media junior (F/H)&lt;/strong&gt;, tu seras impliqué(e) dans :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La gestion de clientèle et le support commercial :&lt;/strong&gt; Assister les Account Managers middle et senior au quotidien, préparer les présentations, les rapports de performance ainsi que les worklists (internes et clients). Tu participeras aux réunions clients, rédigeras les comptes rendus, effectueras des recherches de marché/benchmarks concurrentiels et aideras à la préparation des propositions commerciales (budgets, rétroplannings, templates).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La stratégie et la planification social media :&lt;/strong&gt; Contribuer à la réalisation d&#39;audits social media, aider à la rédaction des briefs créatifs pour nos social creatives et suivre de près les performances des campagnes pour identifier des axes d&#39;optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La gestion de projet et les opérations :&lt;/strong&gt; Assurer le suivi opérationnel des campagnes, coordonner les équipes internes (création, média, data...) sous la supervision de ton manager, et veiller à ce que les équipes Traffic soient briefées le plus en amont possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le suivi financier :&lt;/strong&gt; Participer à la gestion des budgets, au suivi des temps passés sur les projets, ainsi qu’au suivi de la facturation et des paiements clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎓 &lt;strong&gt;TON PROFIL :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es diplômé(e) d&#39;un Bac +5 en communication, marketing ou équivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as une première expérience significative (stage de fin d&#39;études ou premier emploi) dans le domaine du social media, idéalement en agence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as une bonne connaissance des plateformes social media (TikTok, Instagram, Facebook, LinkedIn, etc.) et des notions solides en marketing digital.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu maîtrises les outils bureautiques (Excel, PowerPoint, Word).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es reconnu(e) pour ta rigueur, ton organisation et ton excellent relationnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es curieux(se), tu as envie d&#39;apprendre et tu disposes d&#39;une excellente communication écrite et orale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤩 &lt;strong&gt;POURQUOI NOUS ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;L&#39;opportunité de travailler pour des marques internationales de premier plan et d&#39;apprendre aux côtés des meilleurs experts du marché.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un rôle transverse et formateur combinant gestion de projet, stratégie social media et relation client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une agence à l&#39;envergure internationale offrant un terrain de jeu créatif sans limite et des perspectives d&#39;évolution uniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✨ &lt;strong&gt;QUAND NOUS REJOINDRE ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Début : ASAP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤝🏻 &lt;strong&gt;NOTRE PROCESS :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un catch-up call RH avec notre Senior TAM (Talent Acquisition Manager) : Validation des Key points et culture fit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un entretien avec ton futur N+1 (Account Manager Senior et/ou Head of Social Media).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Envoie-nous ta candidature et rejoins notre équipe ! 📧&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Ogilvy, our people are at the heart of what we do: a creative agency that sparks game-changing ideas across culture and business through collaboration, integrity, and a celebration of self-expression.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in building powerful teams with purpose - and we relentlessly curate transformative initiatives that make our commitment to fairness, and equity a reality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ultimate mission is to leave a positive impact on the world, creating a better future for all, while supporting and uplifting the global communities we serve.&amp;nbsp; This is central to our mantra of Borderless Creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Ogilvy is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any assistance seeking a job opportunity, or if you need reasonable accommodation with the application process, please contact us at ----- Please note that this contact is only for candidates who are requesting accommodation. Emails for other purposes, including application status requests, will not receive a response.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;SLSQ427R400&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;As we continue our rapid expansion, we are seeking a dynamic, results-oriented Strategic Hunter Account Executive to join our team in France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;In this pivotal role, you will take ownership of some of France’s leading&amp;nbsp;accounts. This is a&amp;nbsp;high-visibility opportunity to deepen relationships, explore new business avenues, and deliver&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;transformative outcomes within the accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Reporting to our Director of Enterprise Sales, as a Strategic Hunter Account Executive at&amp;nbsp;Databricks, you will focus on identifying, engaging, and securing new opportunities within the&amp;nbsp;accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;You are a true hunter — establishing executive-level connections, uncovering&amp;nbsp;untapped potential, and positioning Databricks as the premier platform for data, analytics, and&amp;nbsp;AI innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;You will be leveraging your extensive hunting expertise, along with your solutions sales&amp;nbsp;experience in selling technical solutions in data/AI, advanced Analytics to inspire the client’s&amp;nbsp;vision and help shape how they leverage these technologies to drive business outcomes. Your&amp;nbsp;success will be measured by your ability to generate demand, close high-value deals, and&amp;nbsp;expand Databricks’ footprint within the accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you&#39;ll have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Leverage your expertise to identify new opportunities and&amp;nbsp;create use cases that demonstrate Databricks’ value and impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Use your commercial network and strong relationship skills to broaden our presence&amp;nbsp;within complex organizations—engaging key decision-makers and trusted partners to drive growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Develop structured account plans that address your client’s business priorities and&amp;nbsp;position Databricks as a long-term digital transformation partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Draw on your experience selling cloud-based solutions to navigate enterprise cycles,&amp;nbsp;secure executive sponsorship, and deliver beyond customer expectations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Work closely with Databricks teams and selected partners to deliver tailored solutions that&amp;nbsp;meet the specific needs of the customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply your sales expertise to close sophisticated business and drive clear, measurable results within the accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Demonstrated passion and experience in selling complex, technical cloud solutions, with&amp;nbsp;the drive to understand and translate advanced technology into business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Extensive Hunting experience and understanding of the complexities and nuances of strategic accounts. A track record of selling into Large Enterprise accounts is&amp;nbsp;essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Proven hands-on experience working with open source technologies, and a strong&amp;nbsp;background in advising on build-versus-buy decisions for enterprise clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Proven track record in selling big data, AI/Analytics solutions, with&amp;nbsp;expertise navigating multi-stakeholder enterprise environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;An understanding of, or experienced in selling consumption model solutions is highly&amp;nbsp;desirable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Experience of applying value-based selling methodologies, consistently positioning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;technology solutions around measurable customer impact and ROI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Creative, resourceful sales professional with a structured and proactive prospecting&amp;nbsp;motion—capable of building a sustainable pipeline from scratch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Consistently exceeded sales quotas, showing a results-driven approach and commitment&amp;nbsp;to surpassing ambitious targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Grit, resilience, and tenacity—excited by the challenge of opening greenfield accounts,&amp;nbsp;building new relationships, and driving growth in untapped territories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Fluency in French and English is essential.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dataiku.com/?utm_source=newswire&amp;amp;utm_medium=press-release&amp;amp;utm_campaign=PlatformforAISuccess&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Dataiku&lt;/a&gt; is the Platform for AI Success, the enterprise orchestration layer for building, deploying, and governing AI. In a single environment, teams design and operate analytics, machine learning, and AI agents with the transparency, collaboration, and control enterprises require. Sitting above data platforms, cloud infrastructure, and AI services, Dataiku connects the full enterprise AI stack - empowering organizations to run AI across multi-vendor environments with centralized governance.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The world’s leading companies rely on Dataiku to operationalize AI and run it as a true business performance engine delivering measurable value. For more, visit the Dataiku &lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.dataiku.com/?_gl=1*17edvf4*_ga*MjA1Mjk5NzY4OC4xNjY3MjMyMDUz*_ga_B3YXRYMY48*MTY2OTA1MDY5NS4xMi4xLjE2NjkwNTA2OTguNTcuMC4w&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/dataiku/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/dataiku&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/dataiku&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Global Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re ~1,300 builders across 18 countries. We share context openly, work across functions and borders, question defaults, and own our outcomes. Our People team runs on Dataiku too, with AI agents and automated workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; EMEA - Remote · &lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&lt;/strong&gt; Global Total Rewards Lead&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own Dataiku’s global benefits programs across all countries where we operate. The goal: benefits that help us win AI talent, feel consistent and fair wherever people work, meet local requirements, and stay financially sustainable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our People function is lean and decentralized. You’ll set benefits strategy with the Global Total Rewards Lead, partner directly with Finance, Legal, Payroll and our brokers, lead day-to-day benefits operations, and have real autonomy. This is a builder role: you’ll challenge how benefits work today and use AI to make them simpler to run and easier for employees to use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Shape the strategy.&lt;/strong&gt; Define and evolve our global benefits philosophy with the Global Total Rewards Lead, balancing market competitiveness, consistency across countries and cost discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Own the global portfolio.&lt;/strong&gt; Design and manage health, retirement, insurance, leave and wellbeing programs across our entities and EOR countries, setting a clear global floor with smart local variation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Run renewals and vendors.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead annual renewals, broker and carrier relationships, and RFPs. Negotiate on data, not habit, and hold vendors to clear service levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Keep us compliant.&lt;/strong&gt; Make sure plans meet local rules in every country. You’ll own US compliance directly (ERISA, ACA, COBRA, nondiscrimination testing, Form 5500) as well as statutory and collective-agreement obligations in Europe and beyond.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Manage cost.&lt;/strong&gt; Own the global benefits budget and forecasts with Finance. Model plan changes, track claims and utilization trends, and bring clear trade-offs to decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Lead benefits operations.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the team that runs enrollment, life events, leaves, payroll and HRIS integrations, and EOR coordination. Build processes that scale without adding headcount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Use AI to reinvent the experience.&lt;/strong&gt; Automate enrollment, eligibility checks, reconciliations and employee questions with AI agents and workflows. Make it easy for employees to understand and use what we offer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Support growth and change.&lt;/strong&gt; Set up benefits for new countries, entity conversions from EOR, and acquisitions, with clean harmonization plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Communicate clearly.&lt;/strong&gt; Build benefits guides, open-enrollment campaigns and manager resources that people actually read.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Extensive global benefits experience in a global, high-growth tech or enterprise software company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Deep expertise in benefits design, renewals, vendor/broker management and benchmarking across multiple countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Strong, hands-on US benefits compliance experience, plus experience with European programs and statutory requirements, including UK and French benefits and pensions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Experience managing benefits through both owned entities and Employer of Record providers (e.g. Deel, Remote).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; A track record of building or transforming benefits programs, not just administering them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Experience leading a team and influencing senior stakeholders in lean, fast-moving environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Strong analytical skills for cost modeling and claims analysis, and real curiosity for AI and automation (Workday a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Real impact:&lt;/strong&gt; shape benefits for a global AI company helping the world’s largest enterprises make AI work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; the autonomy to build, with direct access to Total Rewards, Finance and People leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; help reinvent how People programs are delivered, with AI-powered workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote #LI-FR1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are you waiting for!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Dataiku, you&#39;ll be part of a journey to shape the ever-evolving world of AI. We&#39;re not just building a product; we&#39;re crafting the future of AI. If you&#39;re ready to make a significant impact in a company that values innovation, collaboration, and your personal growth, we can&#39;t wait to welcome you to Dataiku! And if you’d like to learn even more about working here, you can visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/dataiku/&quot;&gt;Dataiku LinkedIn page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our practices are rooted in the idea that everyone should be treated with dignity, decency and fairness. Dataiku also believes that a diverse identity is a source of strength and allows us to optimize across the many dimensions that are needed for our success. Therefore, we are proud to be an equal opportunity employer.&amp;nbsp;All employment practices are based on business needs, without regard to race, ethnicity, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, age, neurodiversity, disability status, citizenship, veteran status or any other aspect which makes an individual unique or protected by laws and regulations in the locations where we operate. This applies to all policies and procedures related to recruitment and hiring, compensation, benefits, performance, promotion and termination and all other conditions and terms of employment. If you need assistance or an accommodation, please contact us at: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; ----------
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect yourself from fraudulent recruitment activity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dataiku will never ask you for payment of any type during the interview or hiring process. Other than our video-conference application, Zoom, we will also never ask you to make purchases or download third-party applications during the process. If you experience something out of the ordinary or suspect fraudulent activity, please review our page on identifying and reporting fraudulent activity&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dataiku.com/legal/dataiku-recruitment-scams/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Manager, Professional Services Engineers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, you will manage a team that works directly with customers to deliver installation, migration, training, and advisory services across the full GitLab platform. In this role, you will be accountable for the performance, development, and day-to-day management of a team of Professional Services Engineers based across Europe, helping them deliver high-quality outcomes in a remote, asynchronous environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner closely with Technical Architects and Professional Services management to enable consistent delivery across implementation projects, migrations, and statement of work engagements. This is a people-first role with meaningful technical depth. You will step in hands-on with your team when needed while also building the operating rhythm, team culture, and delivery approach that help the broader practice scale. You will also work closely with cross-functional partners to improve utilization, customer satisfaction, and delivery execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your first year, you will help strengthen team capability, improve delivery consistency, and create the conditions for a high-performing services team across the region. This is an opportunity to manage a team doing technically complex, customer-facing work that directly helps customers realize value from GitLab.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some examples of our projects:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Leading a team of Professional Services Engineers through end-to-end GitLab implementation and migration engagements for enterprise customers across Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Partnering with Sales, Customer Success, and Technical Architects to support statement of work scoping and align the right technical resources to customer needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Lead and manage a team of Professional Services Engineers, supporting their growth, performance, and day-to-day delivery across customer engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Develop team members through regular 1:1s, coaching, feedback, and career conversations that help them grow their technical and consulting skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Own delivery outcomes across your team’s portfolio, including implementations, migrations, advisory services, and statement of work engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Monitor project health, identify delivery risks early, and step in directly or escalate when needed to keep customer work on track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Partner with Technical Architects, Engagement Managers, Sales, and Customer Success to plan, scope, resource, and support successful services engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Track team utilization, customer satisfaction, and escalation trends, and use those insights to improve team performance and operational effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Act as a senior escalation point for complex customer situations, helping guide resolution while maintaining a high bar for service quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Contribute to the continuous improvement of Professional Services processes, tooling, knowledge sharing, and delivery standards across the broader organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Significant experience leading and developing high-performing technical teams in a customer-facing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;A strong technical foundation in software delivery, DevSecOps, platform engineering, or a related area, with the ability to engage credibly in technical discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Experience managing or supporting professional services, implementation delivery, migration programs, or technical consulting engagements for enterprise customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Proven ability to navigate customer escalations, balance competing priorities, and drive clear outcomes in complex situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Strong collaboration skills and the ability to work effectively with cross-functional partners such as Sales, Customer Success, and Technical Architects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;A delivery mindset focused on accountability, quality, and measurable results rather than activity alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Comfort working in a fully remote, asynchronous organization with strong written communication and organizational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Alignment with GitLab’s values and the ability to lead with transparency, trust, and a focus on team development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On the &lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Professional Services&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; team at GitLab, we help customers adopt the platform in ways that fit their technical goals and operating environment through technical delivery, guidance, and enablement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of this organization, we focus on hands-on delivery work across customer engagements across EMEA. We work closely with a sister team of &lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Technical Architects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, along with cross-functional partners across the business, to support strong project execution and customer outcomes. We are building a high-quality services practice grounded in technical excellence, customer focus, and continuous improvement. This is a good fit for someone who enjoys leading experienced technical practitioners, improving how services are delivered, and helping customers succeed through meaningful, complex work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Upsun&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Upsun is the software factory for human-AI workflows. We give teams one unified platform to create, review, deploy, and run software, with AI agents and humans working in sync. Developers, DevOps engineers, and platform teams use Upsun to build and ship with confidence, without wrestling with infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Upsun brings this together through two products: one that shapes the work, and one that runs it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Upsun Dispatch™: the AI-first product accelerator.&lt;/strong&gt; Dispatch governs and simplifies collaboration between AI agents and cross-functional human teams, so work gets shaped, reviewed, and moved to production faster. Ship better code, not just more code.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Upsun Cloud: the Cloud Application Platform for AI acceleration.&lt;/strong&gt; Cloud is where that software runs. It helps organizations launch agentic software into production confidently and reliably, with:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Predictable performance, even at scale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Secure, compliant environments by default&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Real-time observability and profiling built in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Cloning, configuration, and provisioning in seconds&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Sandbox environments where AI agents can build and test safely&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The name says it all. &quot;Up&quot; means uptime, reliability, and acceleration. &quot;Sun&quot; reflects our follow-the-sun-support, a 24x7, globally distributed support team keeping the lights on while you rest. Our core belief is that software should power brighter solutions and greater innovation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What&#39;s our commonality, our cultural fabric? A curious spirit and a thirst for knowledge; an eagerness for innovative ideas and cultures. We believe we can build anything together in an environment that frees you to do your best work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our values:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;🌿 We make a positive impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;✨ We aim for the stars.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;💚 We care for each other.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact of a Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Product Manager at Upsun, you own a significant area of Upsun Cloud, our cloud application platform, and the outcomes it delivers for the developers who build on it. The team you join owns the platform&#39;s foundations: the API, the runtime, environments, and the reliability every application running on Upsun depends on. And because Upsun is the cloud application platform humans and robots love, much of what you build will be used by AI agents as much as by people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on, technically rich role that bridges product strategy and deep infrastructure understanding. You own the strategy and the roadmap for your area, working closely with engineering to define platform behavior, build scalable abstractions, and shape workflows that empower modern development teams. Throughout, you act as the key voice for the user, making sure everything we ship contributes meaningfully to an exceptional developer experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy and roadmap:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the strategy, roadmap, and priorities for your area of Upsun Cloud, balancing established foundations with uncharted territory.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem definition:&lt;/strong&gt; Synthesize inputs from customers, support, sales, and engineering into clear problem statements, constructively testing underlying assumptions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution definition:&lt;/strong&gt; Explore options with your team, weigh trade-offs, and land on the right scope.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ship small, iterate fast:&lt;/strong&gt; Release in increments and shorten the loop between shipping and learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with engineering (especially infrastructure and systems teams) to deliver platform capabilities that are reliable, scalable, and developer-friendly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design for humans and agents:&lt;/strong&gt; Build with two audiences in mind—ensuring features, APIs, documentation, and error messages serve both people and AI agents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer and data authority:&lt;/strong&gt; Connect with customers regularly, serve as an internal advocate for their needs, and define metrics that demonstrate value for users and the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence across teams:&lt;/strong&gt; Build alignment across engineering, design, Product Marketing, support, and leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-to-market:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Product Marketing early so go-to-market strategy helps shape the product, not just the launch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product management experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience in product management owning a distinct product area, ideally focused on developer platforms, PaaS, or cloud infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding of building, deploying, and running applications in the cloud, with the ability to collaborate closely with infrastructure engineers on multi-tenant architectures or distributed systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software development background:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with building software using languages such as Python, Ruby, JavaScript, PHP, Go, or Rust.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD, containers &amp;amp; APIs:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience or close collaboration with CI/CD workflows, Docker/OCI container technologies, and a clear vision for intuitive API design.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Daily use of modern AI tools to research, draft, and prototype workflows, paired with a realistic understanding of where current tools and models fall short.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic development:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong perspective on autonomous agent architecture and how agentic workflows are transforming modern software engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigating ambiguity:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfort with turning unstructured problem spaces into clear strategies and taking thoughtful action even with incomplete information.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Clear written and verbal communication skills, with a track record of listening, building consensus, and uniting teams around a shared vision.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-informed decision making:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to seek out and evaluate data to guide decisions and track success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Enthusiasm for using and testing the platform capabilities you help build.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience using Kubernetes, or building self-service platforms on Kubernetes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where we hire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Upsun, remote work isn’t just a trend. It’s our foundation. Upsunners are a global workforce, and we thrive in a multicultural team. We’re committed to open source and an open, welcoming environment. Our team spans more than 30 countries and a wide range of experience levels, and we’re currently hiring for this role in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Germany, Canada, Spain, France, and the UK&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We’re unable to provide visa sponsorship at this time, but we welcome applications from all qualified candidates who are legally authorized to work in these countries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we hire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our interview process is a chance for us to understand how you think, what you’ve built, and what you want to take on next, and for you to get to know us. Together, we’ll explore where your strengths and interests meet the challenges our teams are solving.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We know a great hire won’t meet every requirement above. If you can see yourself making the team better, we want to hear your story. Few of us would be here if someone hadn’t taken a chance on us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You can expect &lt;strong&gt;5 video interviews&lt;/strong&gt; on Google Meet to follow the order below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;45 Minutes with Talent Acquisition&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;60 Minutes with Hiring Manager (Director, Product)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;60 Minutes with Team (IC&#39;s)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;60 Minutes with Product Leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;45 Minutes with Executive (CTO)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All roles require background checks.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;💡 &lt;strong&gt;A product you can believe in&lt;/strong&gt; - Join us in transforming how businesses build and manage web applications, driven making a positive impact as a proud &lt;strong&gt;B Corp&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🏆 An Award-Winning Workplace&lt;/strong&gt; - We’ve been recognized by Forbes’ Top 30 Companies for Remote Jobs and France’s Best Workplaces for Women.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;🗣️ &lt;strong&gt;A culture that values your voice &lt;/strong&gt;- Join a flexible, open, and inclusive work environment where your voice is encouraged, and your ideas shape our growth and evolution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;A global team &lt;/strong&gt;- Collaborate with colleagues from diverse backgrounds across the world, embracing different perspectives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎉 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and perks&lt;/strong&gt; - Make the most of what matters to you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏝 Flexible PTO&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🩺 Comprehensive healthcare coverage (UK, Canada, France, Spain, USA)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📈 Company stock options&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 Professional development budget&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💻 Office equipment budget&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💆‍♀️ Wellness budget&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧳 Annual team gatherings&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🛜 Internet reimbursement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👶 Inclusive parental leave&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ Remote work travel program&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Upsun, we celebrate diversity in all its forms and are committed to fostering an inclusive, equitable, and supportive workplace where everyone can thrive. We embrace and value different perspectives, backgrounds, and experiences, because they make us stronger as a team. Whoever you are, wherever you&#39;re from, and whatever path you&#39;ve taken, you are welcome here. We encourage you to bring your whole self to work, connect with others, and share your passion. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you need accommodations at any stage of our hiring process, please let us know. We&#39;re here to ensure an accessible and comfortable experience for you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Fraud Alert&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve learned that scammers are impersonating Commvault team members—including HR and leadership—via email or text. These bad actors may conduct fake interviews and ask for personal information, such as your social security number. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to know:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commvault does&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;not&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;conduct interviews by email or text.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We will never ask you to submit sensitive documents (including banking information, SSN, etc) before your first day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commvault recruiters may contact prospective candidates through LinkedIn and other professional networking platforms regarding career opportunities. If you are unsure whether a recruiting communication is legitimate, review the profile to ensure they have a badge verifying them as a Commvault employee.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you suspect a recruiting scam, please contact us at &lt;u&gt;&lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Commvault&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commvault (NASDAQ: CVLT) delivers continuous recovery for the AI era. We help organizations stay ready for constant disruption by returning critical data, applications, identities, and AI systems to a clean, trusted state. Our purpose-built recovery solutions span cloud-native and hybrid environments, leveraging AI to enable resilience at enterprise scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Enterprise Account Executive is responsible for achieving quota by selling solutions into a defined account list that may include current Commvault customers and high value prospects. The position is a field sales role where the AE will engage in face-to-face sales with customers and prospects either directly or through partners. The Account Executive plans, organizes, leads and controls balanced sales growth, account penetration and customer satisfaction on a long-term multi-quarter basis. This individual may lead a cross-functional sales team and is responsible for creating sales campaigns to penetrate/expand his/her target accounts. The AE must have the ability to articulate an in-depth understanding of the customers’ environment, current challenges/goals and have the ability to align Commvault solutions to those challenges/goals including a financial and strategic value proposition. The candidate must have a history of success in selling complex software platforms (vs. IT component or narrow focused tools) and should have some level of prior engagement with the target account set.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve quarterly and annual quotas by selling to new and established – large, complex prospects and customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement Strategic account plans for target account expansion and new account acquisition including performance objectives, financial targets, and critical milestones for a one and three-year period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create sale campaigns into target accounts and closely coordinate company executive involvement with customer/prospect leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the involvement of company personnel, including support, service, and management resources, in order to meet account performance objectives and customers’ expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a matrixed sales team; liaison with clients, Deal Desk, inside sales, partners, channels, sales engineers, professional services, finance and legal to drive a prospect to close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain a productive, professional relationship with key personnel in assigned customer/prospect accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construct and deliver tangible business cases at the CXO level including financial (ROI &amp;amp; TCO), technical and strategic value propositions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and present sales proposals and presentations to new and existing clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and build strategic relationships with partners and alliances that have existing relationships with the assigned target accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate and close deals following the company’s practices and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure orders meet all legal and financial requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a high level of relevant industry, Commvault and competitive knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, attend and coordinate executive briefings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage internal sales tools and processes to drive opportunities to a successful close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree and proven sales experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable success in software sales at the enterprise level; selling six-and-seven figure deals and managing an integrated selling team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the storage management industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the storage management or data management industry, products, competitors, history, emerging trends and changing marketplace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of two years success in identifying, building relationships and selling directly or with partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, persuasive, listening skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in IT infrastructure; SaaS Experience Preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-EL1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;jd-info au-target&quot; data-ph-at-id=&quot;jobdescription-text&quot; data-ph-id=&quot;ph-page-element-page5-4e8TMw&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commvault is an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. We are always committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or Veteran status and we will not discriminate against on the basis of such characteristics or any other status protected by the laws or regulations in the locations where we work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commvault’s goal is to make interviewing inclusive and accessible to all candidates and employees. If you have a disability or special need that requires accommodation to participate in the interview process or apply for a position at Commvault, please email &lt;a ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span ----- any inquiries not related to an accommodation please reach out to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span -----
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.commvault.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Commvault&#39;s Privacy Policy &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Value Engineering is responsible for our largest Fortune 500 customers and owns their transformation journey by working on the very frontier of what’s possible with data and AI on the Celons Platform. Partnering closely with the Sales team, Value Engineering is responsible for ensuring that the Celonis Platform is deployed to tackle the most strategic business challenges, fits into the right place in our customers’ technology stack and most importantly generates strong ROI through deep and broad deployments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt; As a Senior Value Engineer, you will spearhead AI and data-driven business transformation within the FSI sector by contributing to your customer’s end-to-end value journey using the Celonis Context Model. Working alongside Lead and Principal VEs, you will combine technical execution with consulting and project management. As an AI-fluent operator, your core mandate is to orchestrate complex roadmaps and execute targeted transformation initiatives that improve how these businesses operate across their ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Selling &amp;amp; Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Uncover the real issues by peeling back layers of organizational complexity. Own the Outcome from first discovery through realized ROI for your process areas. Tell the Value Story by crafting powerful executive narratives and leading business value workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate powerful executive sponsorship across core business units to champion transformation programs. Co-own change management with customer leaders and design CoE roadmaps that build self-sufficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Steer Global Transformations across complex workstreams. Own and implement AI-driven account planning and AI-assisted project management. Automate executive governance (QBRs, SteerCos) with minimal manual friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as an AI-fluent operator, utilizing AI tools for rapid technical outputs while partnering with Applied Value Engineers for deep-dive solution builds. Champion platform adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Value &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a strategic expansion roadmap embedding Celonis as a strategic platform to drive adoption. Provide feedback to R&amp;amp;D based on evolving customer use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of experience taking ownership of complex workstreams, process areas, and customer relationships in Value Engineering, Consulting, or Pre-Sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Technical &amp;amp; Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid background in enterprise IT and business software (e.g., SAP, Workday, Salesforce, Oracle). You operate primarily as an AI-fluent operator, utilizing AI copilots to generate outputs and automations, avoiding heavy manual coding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder Mentality:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable setting your own direction within an account team. Driven to &lt;em&gt;live for customer value&lt;/em&gt;, proactively hunting and ideating for highest-impact solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Value Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven expertise in executing process improvements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Program &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated expertise orchestrating multi-region or business unit transformation programs. Expert at mobilizing VP/Director-level sponsorship. Flawless English and French communication with commanding executive presence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of the Finance/Supply Chain domains and FSI trends. You stay continuously updated on business-critical use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Degree:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineering, Computer Science, Mathematics, Business Analytics,&amp;nbsp; comparable technical degree or a Business/Economics degree paired with a technical minor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Value Engineer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Value Engineering is responsible for our largest Fortune 500 customers and owns their transformation journey by working on the very frontier of what’s possible with data and AI on the Celons Platform. Partnering closely with the Sales team, Value Engineering is responsible for ensuring that the Celonis Platform is deployed to tackle the most strategic business challenges, fits into the right place in our customers’ technology stack and most importantly generates strong ROI through deep and broad deployments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt; As a Senior Value Engineer, you will spearhead AI and data-driven business transformation within the Automotive &amp;amp; Manufacturing sector by contributing to your customer’s end-to-end value journey using the Celonis Context Model. Working alongside Lead and Principal VEs, you will combine technical execution with consulting and project management. As an AI-fluent operator, your core mandate is to orchestrate complex roadmaps and execute targeted transformation initiatives that improve how these businesses operate across their ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Selling &amp;amp; Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Uncover the real issues by peeling back layers of organizational complexity. Own the Outcome from first discovery through realized ROI for your process areas. Tell the Value Story by crafting powerful executive narratives and leading business value workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate powerful executive sponsorship across core business units to champion transformation programs. Co-own change management with customer leaders and design CoE roadmaps that build self-sufficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Steer Global Transformations across complex workstreams. Own and implement AI-driven account planning and AI-assisted project management. Automate executive governance (QBRs, SteerCos) with minimal manual friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as an AI-fluent operator, utilizing AI tools for rapid technical outputs while partnering with Applied Value Engineers for deep-dive solution builds. Champion platform adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Value &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a strategic expansion roadmap embedding Celonis as a strategic platform to drive adoption. Provide feedback to R&amp;amp;D based on evolving customer use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of experience taking ownership of complex workstreams, process areas, and customer relationships in Value Engineering, Consulting, or Pre-Sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Technical &amp;amp; Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid background in enterprise IT and business software (e.g., SAP, Workday, Salesforce, Oracle). You operate primarily as an AI-fluent operator, utilizing AI copilots to generate outputs and automations, avoiding heavy manual coding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder Mentality:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable setting your own direction within an account team. Driven to &lt;em&gt;live for customer value&lt;/em&gt;, proactively hunting and ideating for highest-impact solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Value Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven expertise in executing process improvements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Program &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated expertise orchestrating multi-region or business unit transformation programs. Expert at mobilizing VP/Director-level sponsorship. Flawless English and French communication with commanding executive presence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of the Finance/Supply Chain domains and Automotive/Manufacturing trends. You stay continuously updated on business-critical use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Degree:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineering, Computer Science, Mathematics, Business Analytics,&amp;nbsp; comparable technical degree or a Business/Economics degree paired with a technical minor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Anthropic&#39;s Public Sector Sales Lead for France, you will be the face of Anthropic to the French State. This is a founding, zero-to-one role: there is no public sector team in France today, and you will build our strategy, our routes to market and our first strategic relationships from the ground up. Reporting to our EMEA South leadership, you will lead the adoption of safe, frontier AI across central government, starting with the largest ministries. You will work hand in hand with our Public Policy lead in Paris, because in few companies is policy as central to the mission as it is at Anthropic, and with Partnerships, Legal, Security and Product to put in place the commercial and compliance frameworks the State needs in order to work with us at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior individual contributor role. We expect you to have run a public sector business and led teams, and to be energised by stepping back into a hands-on seat where you build it yourself and where the size of your team says nothing about the size of your scope. In the first year, success is measured less by a large number and more by putting Anthropic on the map with the French State: a clear strategy, the right foundations and our first strategic agreements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and own Anthropic&#39;s public sector go-to-market strategy for France: where we play first, how we win, and what we need to build to get there&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the senior face of Anthropic to the French State, building trusted relationships with ministerial cabinets, senior officials and digital and technology leaders across the largest ministries, including defence, finance and justice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full sales cycle on our first strategic public sector opportunities, from first engagement through procurement route, close, deployment and expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Partnerships, Legal and Finance to put in place the routes to market the State needs, including resale and partner channels, framework agreements and central purchasing bodies such as UGAP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner day to day with our Public Policy lead in France so that commercial and policy engagement reinforce each other, and stay aligned with French and European AI strategy and regulation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the conversation with customers on data sovereignty, security and compliance (for example SecNumCloud and the State&#39;s cloud doctrine), and work with Security, Legal and Product on how we meet those requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prove value with customers alongside a shared Applied AI architect, cloud providers and systems integrators, doing much of the groundwork yourself in the early stages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn from and contribute to our UK and US public sector teams, bringing what works to France and sharing what you learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create the playbooks, references and operating rhythm that will let us scale a public sector team in France over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years in enterprise technology sales, including significant time running a public sector business unit or leading sales teams that sell to French central government&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The appetite to move from a leadership role into a hands-on senior individual contributor role with no team at the outset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence that you thrive building from zero: a new market, a new business line or an early-stage company, where systems, processes and support were not yet in place&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of landing large, complex and genuinely transformative agreements with major ministries, as the person leading the deal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep, senior network across central government, and the credibility to engage at director and cabinet level as well as with technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical command of French public procurement, including tenders, framework agreements, central purchasing bodies and partner or resale routes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real expertise in data sovereignty, security and compliance requirements in the French State, and experience leading those conversations with customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of, or a clear aptitude for, working closely with public policy or government affairs colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership and resilience: you treat what is missing as something to build, and you bring colleagues with you to build it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The technical curiosity to learn our products in depth and hold credible conversations with both engineering leaders and senior officials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent French and English, with excellent written and spoken communication in both&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to go through French security clearance (habilitation) should specific accounts require it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine commitment to safe and beneficial AI, and the ability to articulate why it matters for public institutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À propos du poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que Responsable des ventes secteur public d&#39;Anthropic pour la France, vous incarnerez Anthropic auprès de l&#39;État français. Il s&#39;agit d&#39;un poste fondateur, à construire de zéro : il n&#39;existe aujourd&#39;hui aucune équipe secteur public en France, et vous bâtirez notre stratégie, nos voies d&#39;accès au marché et nos premières relations stratégiques en partant d&#39;une page blanche. Ce poste est rattaché à la direction EMEA Sud. Vous piloterez l&#39;adoption d&#39;une IA de pointe et sûre au sein de l&#39;administration centrale, en commençant par les plus grands ministères. Vous travaillerez main dans la main avec notre responsable des affaires publiques à Paris — dans peu d&#39;entreprises les politiques publiques sont aussi centrales à la mission que chez Anthropic — ainsi qu&#39;avec les équipes Partenariats, Juridique, Sécurité et Produit, afin de mettre en place les cadres commerciaux et de conformité dont l&#39;État a besoin pour travailler avec nous à grande échelle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Il s&#39;agit d&#39;un poste senior de contribution individuelle. Nous attendons de vous que vous ayez dirigé une activité secteur public et encadré des équipes, et que la perspective de revenir à un poste pleinement opérationnel vous enthousiasme : un poste où vous construisez vous-même, et où la taille de votre équipe ne dit rien de l&#39;étendue de votre périmètre. La première année, la réussite se mesurera moins à un grand chiffre qu&#39;à votre capacité à installer Anthropic auprès de l&#39;État français : une stratégie claire, les bonnes fondations et nos premiers accords stratégiques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsabilités&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir et porter la stratégie de mise sur le marché d&#39;Anthropic pour le secteur public en France : nos premiers terrains d&#39;action, nos leviers de succès et ce qu&#39;il nous faut construire pour y parvenir&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incarner Anthropic au plus haut niveau auprès de l&#39;État français, en nouant des relations de confiance avec les cabinets ministériels, les cadres dirigeants de l&#39;administration et les responsables du numérique et de la technologie des plus grands ministères, dont la défense, les finances et la justice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter l&#39;intégralité du cycle de vente sur nos premières opportunités stratégiques dans le secteur public, du premier contact au choix de la voie de passation, jusqu&#39;à la signature, au déploiement et à l&#39;extension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travailler avec les équipes Partenariats, Juridique et Finance pour mettre en place les voies d&#39;accès au marché dont l&#39;État a besoin : canaux de revente et de partenariat, accords-cadres et centrales d&#39;achat telles que l&#39;UGAP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborer au quotidien avec notre responsable des affaires publiques en France, pour que les démarches commerciales et politiques se renforcent mutuellement, en cohérence avec la stratégie et la réglementation française et européenne en matière d&#39;IA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mener les échanges clients sur la souveraineté des données, la sécurité et la conformité (par exemple SecNumCloud et la doctrine « cloud au centre »), et travailler avec les équipes Sécurité, Juridique et Produit sur la façon dont nous répondons à ces exigences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Démontrer la valeur auprès des clients en vous appuyant sur une expertise d&#39;architecture Applied AI mutualisée, sur les fournisseurs cloud et sur les intégrateurs, en réalisant vous-même une grande part du travail de terrain dans les premiers temps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apprendre de nos équipes secteur public au Royaume-Uni et aux États-Unis et contribuer à leur travail, en important en France ce qui fonctionne et en partageant vos enseignements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Créer les playbooks, les références clients et le rythme opérationnel qui nous permettront de faire grandir une équipe secteur public en France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce poste peut vous correspondre si vous réunissez&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus de 15 ans dans la vente de technologies aux grandes organisations, dont une période significative à la tête d&#39;une activité secteur public ou à l&#39;encadrement d&#39;équipes commerciales à destination de l&#39;administration centrale française&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;L&#39;envie de passer d&#39;un poste d&#39;encadrement à un poste senior pleinement opérationnel, en contribution individuelle et sans équipe au départ&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un parcours qui montre que vous vous épanouissez en construisant à partir de zéro : un nouveau marché, une nouvelle ligne d&#39;activité ou une entreprise à ses débuts, là où les systèmes, les processus et les soutiens n&#39;existaient pas encore&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des accords majeurs, complexes et réellement transformateurs conclus avec de grands ministères à votre actif, en étant la personne à la tête de la négociation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un réseau dense et de haut niveau au sein de l&#39;administration centrale, et la crédibilité nécessaire pour échanger au niveau des directions et des cabinets comme avec les équipes techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une maîtrise concrète de la commande publique française : appels d&#39;offres, accords-cadres, centrales d&#39;achat et voies de partenariat ou de revente&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une véritable expertise des exigences de souveraineté des données, de sécurité et de conformité au sein de l&#39;État français, et l&#39;expérience de ces échanges avec les clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;L&#39;expérience — ou une aptitude manifeste — du travail en étroite collaboration avec les équipes affaires publiques ou relations institutionnelles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Le sens de la responsabilité et la ténacité : ce qui manque est pour vous quelque chose à construire, et vous embarquez vos collègues dans cette construction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La curiosité technique nécessaire pour apprendre nos produits en profondeur et tenir des échanges crédibles aussi bien avec les responsables d&#39;ingénierie qu&#39;avec les responsables publics de haut niveau&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un français et un anglais courants, avec une excellente expression écrite et orale dans les deux langues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La disponibilité pour engager une procédure d&#39;habilitation de sécurité si certains comptes l&#39;exigent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un engagement sincère en faveur d&#39;une IA sûre et bénéfique, et la capacité d&#39;expliquer pourquoi cela compte pour les institutions publiques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education, training, and/or experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required field of study:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;A field relevant to the role as demonstrated through coursework, training, or professional experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Years of experience required will correlate with the internal job level requirements for the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-based hybrid policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently, we expect all staff to be in one of our offices at least 25% of the time. However, some roles may require more time in our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We do sponsor visas! However, we aren&#39;t able to successfully sponsor visas for every role and every candidate. But if we make you an offer, we will make every reasonable effort to get you a visa, and we retain an immigration lawyer to help with this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not believe you meet every single qualification.&lt;/strong&gt; Not all strong candidates will meet every single qualification as listed.&amp;nbsp; Research shows that people who identify as being from underrepresented groups are more prone to experiencing imposter syndrome and doubting the strength of their candidacy, so we urge you not to exclude yourself prematurely and to submit an application if you&#39;re interested in this work. We think AI systems like the ones we&#39;re building have enormous social and ethical implications. We think this makes representation even more important, and we strive to include a range of diverse perspectives on our team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt; To protect yourself from potential scams, remember that Anthropic recruiters only contact you ----- addresses. In some cases, we may partner with vetted recruiting agencies who will identify themselves as working on behalf of Anthropic. Be cautious of emails from other domains. Legitimate Anthropic recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before your first day. If you&#39;re ever unsure about a communication, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u data-stringify-type=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;anthropic.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;directly for confirmed position openings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the highest-impact AI research will be big science. At Anthropic we work as a single cohesive team on just a few large-scale research efforts. And we value impact — advancing our long-term goals of steerable, trustworthy AI — rather than work on smaller and more specific puzzles. We view AI research as an empirical science, which has as much in common with physics and biology as with traditional efforts in computer science. We&#39;re an extremely collaborative group, and we host frequent research discussions to ensure that we are pursuing the highest-impact work at any given time. As such, we greatly value communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to understand our research directions is to read our recent research. This research continues many of the directions our team worked on prior to Anthropic, including: GPT-3, Circuit-Based Interpretability, Multimodal Neurons, Scaling Laws, AI &amp;amp; Compute, Concrete Problems in AI Safety, and Learning from Human Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come work with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t want to inherit a sales organisation. You want to build one. You start in the region between Paris and Strasbourg and spend the first months in the field yourself: you meet dealers, sign the first customers, and see their first cars sell at auction. Then you hire a team of up to six and take it nationwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; France, Paris to Strasbourg region - you work independently in the field, with a high share of dealer visits and your onboarding in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CarOnSale is the AI-powered platform for B2B used car trading in Europe. Over 40,000 buyers from more than 20 countries trade on our platform, and 85% of inventory is exclusive to us. We connect software, pricing intelligence, logistics and financing in one layer, as the operating system for an entire industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One Platform. One Profit Engine.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You own the sales targets for France, first in the region between Paris and Strasbourg, then nationwide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In the first months you sell in the field yourself: you meet dealers, sign the first customers, and take them through their first sales on the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hire and lead a team of up to six sales reps (field and inside sales) and steer them on clear KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work with the teams of our French partner to bring the dealers in their network onto CarOnSale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You connect the French market with our teams in Berlin (Product, Operations, Marketing): you bring in what French dealers need and explain our processes to your customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You set up clean processes from day one: customer onboarding, KYC and opportunity management in Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You represent CarOnSale at trade fairs, in trade media, and at industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least three years of disciplinary leadership of a sales team, with people of very different profiles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in French automotive retail, ideally as a site manager, dealership director, or sales director in a dealer group&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong network among French dealers and used-car professionals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of the French used-car market: registration, taxation, and regulation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You like building from scratch, and you have the resilience and patience a market launch needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;French at C2 level, English at B2 level or above for working with our teams in Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving license (category B) and willingness to travel regularly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in B2B used-car trading or online vehicle auctions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience opening a new market or working in a start-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed salary plus variable compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company car&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Laptop and mobile phone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thorough onboarding in Berlin and in the field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to build CarOnSale&#39;s French business from the first customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An international, diverse team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply now - your CV is enough.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

