&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;A culture of growth. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;With over 50 nationalities represented, we’re proud to welcome people of all backgrounds to our growing community, and we’re always finding new ways to help people feel welcomed and included. Here, you’ll have the tools, training and support you need to work in a way that suits you, learn new skills and reach your potential.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;For a career where you can drive our business and shape your future, apply now.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__blocks c-message_kit__blocks--rich_text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message__message_blocks c-message__message_blocks--rich_text&quot; data-qa=&quot;message-text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer&quot; data-qa=&quot;block-kit-renderer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper--first&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Reddit is a community of communities. It’s built on shared interests, passion, and trust, and is home to the most open and authentic conversations on the internet. Every day, Reddit users submit, vote, and comment on the topics they care most about. With 100,000+ active communities and approximately 130 million daily active unique visitors, Reddit is one of the internet’s largest sources of information. For more information, visit &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://www.redditinc.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://redditinc.com&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;www.redditinc.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is open to candidates based in the UK or the Netherlands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ads team is developing Dynamic Product Ads, enabling us to match users to specific advertiser products. Our vision is for Reddit’s product ads to be highly relevant and contextual. A user browsing r/golf sees ads for popular golf clubs. A user reading a thread on r/buyitforlife about sunglasses sees ads for the exact models being discussed, just a few clicks away from a purchase. To achieve this vision, we need a highly scalable catalog infrastructure and intuitive user experience to onboard thousands of advertisers and ingest millions of products into our systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Engineering Manager for the Product Catalogs team at Reddit, you will lead the full stack team responsible for our entire advertiser-facing experience. You will build UIs, APIs, and backend systems that manage advertiser’s products. The team also works closely with the knowledge graph teams to power organic shopping. This role combines technical expertise, leadership abilities, and drive to understand and deliver on customer needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a world class catalogs system that can scale to support billions of products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with product managers and designers to craft compelling user experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with a wide range of teams from Ad Formats to Ad Delivery to ensure successful end-to-end delivery of product ads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and manage to SLAs within your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a strong mentor and cross-functional advocate for your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute meaningfully to team strategy. We give everyone a seat at the table and encourage active participation in planning for the future. Don’t just come along for the ride.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in backend or full stack product development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience managing engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re highly technical, enough to solve almost any problem your team has yourself, but you prefer to guide your team into solving them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently. You’ll be working with stakeholders that are mostly based in North America. You need to be able to make decisions and solve problems autonomously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills. You must be able to collaborate effectively with teams in a fully-remote environment and discuss complex topics with technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Benefit programs that fit your lifestyle, from workspace to professional development to caregiving support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family Planning Support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gender-Affirming Care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Health &amp;amp; Coaching Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Group Personal Pension Scheme with Employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical and Dental Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Income Replacement Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bike to Work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Vacation &amp;amp; Paid Volunteer Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;In select roles and locations, the interviews will be recorded, transcribed and summarized by artificial intelligence (AI). You will have the opportunity to opt out of recording, transcription and summarization prior to any scheduled interviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;During the interview, we will collect the following categories of personal information: Identifiers, Professional and Employment-Related Information, Sensory Information (audio/video recording), and any other categories of personal information you choose to share with us. We will use this information to evaluate your application for employment or an independent contractor role, as applicable.&amp;nbsp; We will not sell your personal information or disclose it to any third party for their marketing purposes.&amp;nbsp; We will delete any recording of your interview promptly after making a hiring decision.&amp;nbsp; For more information about how we will handle your personal information, including our retention of it, please refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://redditinc.com/policies/candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy for Potential Employees and Contractors&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reddit is proud to be an equal opportunity employer, and is committed to building a workforce representative of the diverse communities we serve.&amp;nbsp; Reddit is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities and disabled veterans in our job application procedures. If, due to a disability, you need an accommodation during the interview process, please let your recruiter know.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Data Center Operations Implementation Manager to own the end-to-end Day 0 to Day 2 transition of Nscale&#39;s data centres — spanning construction, fit-out, and live, steady-state local operations — across an assigned region and set of sites. Rather than owning construction execution itself, you&#39;ll be the connective tissue between Construction, Network Engineering, Compute/Infrastructure Deployment, and local Operations teams — driving a structured, well-documented transition so every site goes live on schedule and ready to support production workloads. This is an individual-contributor role built on strong stakeholder management, cross-functional influence, and travel to sites during critical transition windows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day 0 to Day 2 Transition Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end Day 0 to Day 2 transition process for each data centre site within your assigned region — spanning construction, fit-out, and steady-state operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and maintain a standardized transition framework and readiness checklist applied consistently across your assigned sites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and drive closure of cross-team action items, dependencies, and blockers standing between construction handover and operational go-live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and escalate risks to go-live timelines, and drive resolution across the relevant stakeholder groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track progress and status across Construction, Network Engineering, Compute/Infrastructure Deployment, Facility Engineering, SDM, and local site Operations teams throughout the transition window.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Construction teams to track handover status, outstanding items, and site readiness milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track Network Engineering&#39;s buildout, testing, and cutover activities required for a site to go live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track hardware intake, rack-and-stack, and deployment scheduling with Compute/Infrastructure Deployment teams to stay aligned with the transition timeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Facility Engineering on site systems and infrastructure readiness ahead of transition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with the Service Delivery Management (SDM) team to ensure alignment with customer needs, SLAs, security, and facility performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take part in regular cross-functional syncs and stakeholder reviews to stay current on transition status.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a shared sense of ownership and accountability across stakeholder teams, even without formal authority over them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local Day Two Operations Readiness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with local Operations leads to confirm staffing, training, tooling, and support processes are in place before a site transitions to Day 2 ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and validate standard operating procedures (SOPs) and operational processes required for local Operations teams to run the site post-handover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create the operational site tool bill of materials (BOM) required for local Operations teams to maintain the site post-handover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verify the spare parts bill of materials (BOM) is complete and in place ahead of Day 2 handover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate structured knowledge transfer and handover documentation from Construction, Network, and Compute teams to local Operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confirm monitoring, ticketing, and ITSM processes are validated and operating before a site is handed to local Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an escalation point for local Operations teams during the early post-handover period to smooth the transition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reliability, Safety &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and enforce Day 2 readiness criteria that a site must meet before transitioning to local Operations ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate root-cause analysis for transition delays or gaps surfaced during handover, and drive remediation across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure health, safety, and environmental requirements are validated and documented as part of readiness sign-off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support certification and audit readiness (ISO 27001, ISO 22237, SOC 2, Cyber Essentials Plus, ISO 22301) ahead of go-live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor &amp;amp; Supplier Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with construction contractors and colocation providers as needed to close out remaining items affecting the transition timeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track vendor commitments and SLAs relevant to the transition window, and escalate delays that put go-live at risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with the Supply Chain team to align hardware intake and staging with the transition schedule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monitoring, Reporting &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track KPIs and KRIs for the Day 0 to Day 2 transition process (time to transition, readiness checklist completion rate, post-handover incident rate, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain dashboards that track transition status across your assigned site pipeline for all stakeholder teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce regular reports for senior leadership on transition status, risks, and blockers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data-driven insights to identify systemic bottlenecks in the Day 0 to Day 2 process and drive continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Background&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-8 years of experience in data centre operations, program/project management, or infrastructure deployment at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record coordinating the transition of new sites into live operations across construction, network, compute, and operations functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in a matrixed environment, influencing outcomes without direct authority over every stakeholder team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success managing multiple concurrent site transitions in a high-growth, fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in hyperscale, cloud, or HPC data centre environments (preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Knowledge &amp;amp; Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of data centre power, cooling, networking, and compute infrastructure, sufficient to coordinate effectively across specialist teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with network deployment and cutover processes, and compute/hardware deployment lifecycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Layer 1 network infrastructure, including fiber, copper, optics, and transceivers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with ITSM tooling, ticketing systems, and monitoring platforms used by local Operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence &amp;amp; Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills, with the ability to influence and align Construction, Network, Compute, and Operations teams without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent cross-functional communication skills, able to translate technical detail between teams with different priorities and vocabularies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Program management discipline, with the ability to track and drive multiple concurrent workstreams to closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in ambiguous, matrixed, fast-moving environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bias toward ownership, pragmatism, and delivering results with urgency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigorous tracking of readiness checklists, risk logs, and action items across many concurrent site transitions within your assigned region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build and refine standardized transition frameworks that scale with business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail in transition documentation and handover packages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel to sites during critical transition windows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with program management tooling (e.g., Smartsheet, Asana, Jira, monday.com) for tracking multi-workstream transitions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with network cutover or compute/hardware deployment processes specifically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ITSM platforms and ticketing workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Palantir Foundry or similar data platforms for operational analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Nscale, we are committed to fostering an inclusive, diverse, and equitable workplace. We believe that a variety of perspectives enriches our work environment, and we encourage applications from candidates of all backgrounds, experiences, and abilities.&amp;nbsp; We strongly encourage applications from people of colour, the LGBTQ+ community, people with disabilities, neurodivergent people, parents, carers, and people from lower socio-economic backgrounds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there’s anything we can do to accommodate your specific situation, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The responsibilities outlined in this job description are not exhaustive and are intended to provide a general overview of the position. The employee may be required to perform additional duties, tasks, and responsibilities as assigned by management, consistent with the skills and qualifications required for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information on how Nscale handles candidate personal data, please see our Employee &amp;amp; Candidate Privacy Notice:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QK5Yg04WHD9K9IAtJgQWubJZC9oLvatK/view?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QK5Yg04WHD9K9IAtJgQWubJZC9oLvatK/view?usp%3Dsharing&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1765375172804000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2Ncte4rmlGl8OKuFuDgDtx&quot;&gt;Here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nscale does not accept unsolicited candidate submissions from recruitment agencies.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3833 - Director, Planning, UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP 650&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join an award-winning team at the heart of UK government, where your work will genuinely shape lives. As part of WPP 650 you’ll be part of a supportive, collaborative environment that values curiosity, kindness, and growth. Together, we use behaviour change pinciples to design smarter services, influence better decisions, and help millions of people across the country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Named WPP 650, after the 650 UK constituencies, the name is a reminder that our work must reflect the full breadth of the country, every community, every audience. No two days are the same. The challenges are complex, the problems worth solving, and the learning constant. You’ll tackle issues that matter, alongside talented colleagues who care deeply about what they do. It’s demanding – but always rewarding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP 650 is a bespoke agency unit within WPP, dedicated to serving the evolving communications needs of government clients. We bring together the best of WPP&#39;s talent, technology, and insights to deliver impactful, modern, and effective public communications. We are at the forefront of reimagining how government engages with its citizens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is meaningful work with real-world impact – the kind you can point to with pride.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;The planning team are the guardians of creating industry leading, unrivalled work at WPP 650. We are central conduits to all specialists, striving to push boundaries and have a positive impact on consumers and brand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP 650 is looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Planning Director&lt;/strong&gt; to join our growing planning team, to drive planning across specific clients and be a media planning expert.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Media planning craft:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop an advanced understanding of media channels, channel ecosystems and planning best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start to translate strategic approach into planning practices for specific client briefs and pitches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an advanced understanding of WPP 650’s Consumer Journey thinking and planning philosophy across all client work. Including being an expert in a broad set of internal tools, as well as external tools to build a deep understanding of the consumer, the client’s business and its specific opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an expert overview of the media market landscape, trends and start to build media owner relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign management &amp;amp; effective communication:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee campaign management, ensuring quality control and output is of the highest standard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a skilled understand of commercial practises and of the wider agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain client and agency relationships at a mid-senior level, to ensure a comprehensive understanding of stakeholders and client business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comms planning and storytelling: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own planning presentations including defining the inputs needed and working with the wider teams to compile work and meet deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead brainstorm and idea creation for campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start to independently problem solve, including integrating and questioning data and insights and find solutions based on knowledge and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice Area Knowledge -Skilled-&lt;/strong&gt; Develops breadth and depth of industry understanding. Becomes confident using tools, technology, techniques and systems and is able to train others. Comfortable presenting both direct from platform (Open) and developing a story from data but delivered outside of platform (Telmar etc). Can confidently answer client questions and liaise with internal teams on best solutions to use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem Solving – Skilled&lt;/strong&gt; - Uses critical questioning and maintains a broad perspective when analyzing information to gain a deeper understanding of the problem and wider impact. Quickly generates appropriate solutions informed by previous experience. Understands how to resolve escalated issues and supports others to problem solve. Supports or leads troubleshooting communication for issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Relationships – Skilled&lt;/strong&gt; - Has an expert knowledge of client and agency structures. Can identify key decision makers and understands their perspectives which is used to build relationships. Has strong knowledge of the client sector/industry which is shared to build strategies and plans. Identifies strategic issues and raises questions to help stakeholders explore and understand their wider business challenges. ​​​​​​​ Can easily suggest business solutions to match client/stakeholder needs and achieve objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effective Communication -Advanced-&lt;/strong&gt; Leads the delivery of relevant and accurate information to drive maximum impact. Consistently delivers communications to influence and educate all levels of seniority, appropriately judging the demands of the situation. Creatively develops presentations and comms to help with the understanding/education of complex information. Guides others on the best practices and approaches for creating clear, concise and organized communication materials to convey plans in a user-friendly way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Management – Advanced -&lt;/strong&gt; Reviews the work of others to ensure accuracy and thoroughness objectives have been met; provides coaching on ways to improve work outputs.&amp;nbsp; Applies best practice to campaign management and acts as the escalation point for issues.&amp;nbsp; Provide actionable insights during mid and post campaign reports to improve in-flight optimizations and future campaign brief recommendations.&amp;nbsp; Oversees team members to discuss current projects, workload and activities prioritises resources accordingly.&amp;nbsp; Improves workload management by supporting other in setting priorities and by postponing less relevant work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compelling Storytelling – Skilled -&lt;/strong&gt; Applies big picture thinking in work and proactively leverages an understanding of the organization and key industry trends.&amp;nbsp; Understand the different elements of responses.&amp;nbsp; Designs differentiated communications (content focus, style, presentation etc) for various internal and external audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideas Creation – Advanced -&lt;/strong&gt; Lead new projects/activities that can create ideas to deliver effective solutions to clients’ business objectives.&amp;nbsp; Ability to proactively generate ideas to provoke and deliver against broader business strategies.&amp;nbsp; Coaches others to gain new insights and view opportunities from different perspectives.&amp;nbsp; Championing an environment that fosters innovation by encouraging others to openly share and build on other’s new ideas, products and solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comms Planning – Skilled -&lt;/strong&gt; Applies knowledge of client, audience, channel, market and category to effectively deliver compelling multi-media plans.&amp;nbsp; Translates learnings and trends to create marketing communication strategies that are effective with clear measurement.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Application of purchase journey thinking and visualization of how the media plan works channels.&amp;nbsp; Translation of strategic direction/platform/provocation into directional role for media, channel role and behaviour in channel.&amp;nbsp; Identifies and recommends budget shifts as campaign is in-flight where appropriate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4011 - Associate Director, Planning, UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
