&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;Job details&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Permanent position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Paris, France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Hybrid work setup (up to 2 remote days per week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Start date: as soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, or disability.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g., pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;Your data privacy&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;All information provided is processed by Doctolib for application management. For data processing details, click here: &lt;a class=&quot;break-words font-semibold transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out hover:underline text-highlight hover:text-highlight-400 active:text-highlight-dark&quot; href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-FR&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;France&lt;/a&gt;. Please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com for inquiries or to exercise your rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vous rejoindrez l&#39;équipe&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.doctolib.fr/prevention/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Doctolib Prévention&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, une équipe d&#39;entrepreneur(euse)s qui construit une nouvelle activité depuis 2022 avec l&#39;ambition de transformer le système de santé vers plus de prévention. En participant à des missions très diversifiées aux côtés du Prevention Strategy Associate, vous contribuerez directement à accompagner l&#39;effort national de virage vers une médecine plus préventive et à donner aux patients les moyens de devenir acteurs de leur santé.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vos responsabilités incluent, mais ne sont pas limitées à :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Réaliser des analyses quantitatives et améliorer les outils de mesure (enquêtes, analyses comparatives) pour évaluer l’impact des campagnes de prévention et formuler des recommandations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mener des études de marché pour soutenir le développement de Doctolib Prévention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer à la priorisation de la roadmap produit et marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Préparer les reportings internes et coordonner avec les équipes (communication, affaires publiques, autres équipes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimiser les processus internes et produire des supports (scripts, pitchs, présentations) pour l’équipe sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les qualités attendues&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Avant de poursuivre votre lecture, si vous n&#39;avez pas le profil exact décrit ci-dessous, mais que vous pensez que cette description de poste correspond à vos compétences et à vos besoins, nous vous encourageons tout de même à postuler.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous pourrez être le prochain membre de notre équipe si vous :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Êtes étudiant.e en Master 1/2 en école de commerce ou d&#39;ingénieur, avec une spécialisation en stratégie, santé publique, ou data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Êtes à l&#39;aise avec la data, l&#39;analyse de données quantitatives et faites preuve de rigueur et d&#39;esprit de synthèse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avez un esprit entrepreneurial, une envie d&#39;apprendre et de vous impliquer dans un projet à impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Faites preuve d&#39;adaptabilité, de flexibilité et de qualités relationnelles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ce serait fantastique si :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous portez un intérêt fort pour la santé et/ou l&#39;innovation en santé&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous souhaitez monter en compétences sur des sujets variés : stratégie, data, marketing, opérations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous possédez une appétence pour le domaine des médias&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre offre&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un programme d’onboarding complet, avec la Doctolib Academy et de nombreuses sessions de formation au sein de votre équipe (langues, soft skills, compétences techniques)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une carte Swile et de nombreuses offres de restauration au sein de nos locaux&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une offre de sport : un abonnement Urban Sports Club, des cours de sport gratuits dans les bureaux ou à distance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Le remboursement des titres de transport à 50%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;De nombreux bureaux offrant des espaces de collaboration et de bien-être&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une politique de travail flexible avec un mode hybride&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le processus de recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un call RH avec Flore, Talent Partner (15 minutes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un entretien opérationnel avec Aabir Elakili, Prevention Strategy Lead (1 heure)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Détails du poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage conventionné à temps plein&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Durée : 6 mois&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Début souhaité : mars 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lieu de travail : Levallois-Perret&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rémunération : À définir selon profil&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Doctolib, nous sommes convaincus que nous devons améliorer la santé pour tout le monde. Cela se reflète dans notre processus de recrutement. Nous évaluons les candidatures uniquement sur la base des qualifications et de la motivation, sans aucune forme de discrimination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Plus les idées sont diverses, plus notre produit améliorera véritablement la santé pour tout le monde. Vous pouvez postuler chez Doctolib, quel que soit votre genre, religion, âge, orientation sexuelle, origine ethnique ou handicap.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Afin de garantir l&#39;égalité des chances, nous vous invitons à exclure les informations personnelles (par exemple : photos, âge) de vos candidatures. Si vous avez besoin d&#39;aménagements particuliers, merci de nous en informer pour que nous puissions adapter le processus de recrutement. Rejoignez-nous pour construire la santé dont nous rêvons tous !&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Toutes les informations fournies sont traitées par Doctolib pour la gestion des candidatures. Pour plus de détails sur le traitement des données, cliquez&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://media.doctolib.com/image/upload/mkg/file/privacy_notice_recrutement_fr_1.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;ici&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Veuillez contacter hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com pour toute question ou pour exercer vos droits.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;L&#39;équipe&amp;nbsp;Corporate Development recherche un(e) stagiaire pour un stage de 6 mois afin de contribuer aux réflexions stratégiques et financières de Doctolib et travailler sur de possibles opérations d’acquisition ou de levée de fonds. Rattachée au CFO et ayant de nombreuses interactions avec le Comex, l&#39;équipe intervient à l’intersection de la finance d’entreprise, de la stratégie et des relations investisseurs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que Corporate Development Analyst, vous serez pleinement intégré(e) dans l’équipe et&amp;nbsp; travaillerez en étroite collaboration avec l’ensemble de ses membres.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vos responsabilités incluent mais ne sont pas limitées à :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer aux réflexions stratégiques de Doctolib et à la préparation des présentations à destination du Comité Exécutif&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suivre l’activité des acteurs de l’écosystème digital health et tech (innovations, acquisitions, nouvelle géographie, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer à la transformation IA de l&#39;équipe : participation à la réflexion des workflows à automatiser, test et déploiement d’agents IA, mesure d’impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer aux exercices d’origination de cibles M&amp;amp;A et à l’exécution des deals M&amp;amp;A : valorisation de l’entreprise, participation au processus de due diligence, soutien à la préparation des documents de décisions du Comex et du Board, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Appuyer la gestion des relations investisseurs (présentes et futures) de Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les qualités attendues pour ce poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Avant de poursuivre votre lecture, si vous n’avez pas le profil exact décrit ci-dessous, mais que vous pensez que cette description de poste correspond à vos compétences et à vos besoins, nous vous encourageons tout de même à postuler !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous pourrez être le prochain membre de notre équipe si:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous recherchez un stage de fin d&#39;études (niveau bac+5) ou de 2ème partie de césure, avec un background financier, commerce ou ingénieur – avec un fort angle analytique&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez une première expérience en Stratégie et / ou en Corporate Finance (cabinet de conseil, banque d’investissement, M&amp;amp;A corporate, VC, PE)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous savez faire preuve de leadership, d’autonomie dans votre travail et vous n’avez pas peur de prendre des initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous parlez couramment français, maîtrisez l’anglais professionnel &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous maîtrisez Excel et Powerpoint ou les équivalents sur la suite Google&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ce serait fantastique si :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez envie de travailler dans une entreprise tech &amp;amp; en forte croissance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Le secteur de la santé vous attire, et vous cherchez un travail avec un fort impact dans la société&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre offre&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un programme d’onboarding complet, avec la Doctolib Academy et de nombreuses sessions de formation au sein de votre équipe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des programmes de formation (langues, soft skills, compétences techniques)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une carte Swile et de nombreuses offres de restauration au sein de nos locaux&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une offre de sport : Un abonnement Urban Sports Club, des cours de sport gratuits dans les bureaux ou à distance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Le remboursement des titres de transport à 50%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;De nombreux bureaux offrant des espaces de collaboration et de bien-être&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une politique de travail flexible avec un mode hybride et au bureau&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le processus de recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un call RH avec Flore, Talent Partner (15 minutes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un entretien fit avec un membre de l’équipe (45 minutes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un case study live avec deux membres de l’équipe (1 heure)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Détails du poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage conventionné à temps plein&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Durée : 6 mois&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Début souhaité : Janvier 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gratification : À définir selon le niveau d&#39;études&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Doctolib, nous cherchons à améliorer l&#39;accès aux soins de santé pour tous - indépendamment de vos origines, de votre apparence. Cet état d&#39;esprit se traduit aussi dans notre processus de recrutement : Doctolib est un employeur qui respecte l&#39;égalité des chances. Nous n&#39;acceptons pas seulement la diversité chez Doctolib, nous la respectons et la célébrons !&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Plus les idées seront diverses, plus notre produit améliorera réellement les soins de santé pour tous. Vous êtes invité à postuler chez Doctolib ou à recommander quelqu&#39;un que vous connaissez, quel que soit leur sexe, leur religion, leur âge, leur orientation sexuelle, leur origine ethnique, leur handicap ou leur lieu d&#39;origine. Si vous avez un handicap, faites-nous savoir si nous pouvons faciliter le processus d&#39;entretien pour vous!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;L’ensemble des informations transmises via ce formulaire est traité par Doctolib à des fins de gestion des candidatures. Pour plus d’informations concernant la façon dont Doctolib traite les données liées à ta candidature, cliquez&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://media.doctolib.com/image/upload/mkg/file/privacy_notice_recrutement_fr_1.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;ici&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Si vous souhaitez exercer vos droits ou que vous avez des questions concernant le traitement des données vous concernant, vous pouvez nous écrire à -----<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Au sein de l&#39;équipe Grands Comptes, rattachée à l’Adminsitration des Ventes, vous contribuerez directement à la croissance et à la sécurisation du chiffre d&#39;affaires de Doctolib. Vous jouerez un rôle opérationnel clé dans le processus de closing mensuel et la gestion du cycle de facturation, tout en développant une expertise complète du cycle commercial et financier chez Doctolib.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vos responsabilités incluent, mais ne sont pas limitées à :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accompagner le closing mensuel en soutenant les équipes commerciales Grands Comptes dans leurs démarches contractuelles et en anticipant les pics d&#39;activité de fin de mois&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer le suivi opérationnel de l&#39;ARR closé en identifiant les dossiers présentant des risques de facturation et en alertant les équipes concernées&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordonner avec les équipes Finance l&#39;envoi effectif des factures une fois tous les justificatifs réceptionnés et validés&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter le suivi du chiffre d&#39;affaires non facturé par commercial/équipe, en maintenant un reporting en temps réel pour minimiser les délais&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer à la facturation mensuelle des comptes publics et accompagner les clients dans leur suivi de factures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les qualités attendues&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Avant de poursuivre votre lecture, si vous n&#39;avez pas le profil exact décrit ci-dessous, mais que vous pensez que cette description de poste correspond à vos compétences et à vos besoins, nous vous encourageons tout de même à postuler.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous pourrez être le prochain membre de notre équipe si vous :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Êtes actuellement en formation ou étudiant(e) en école de commerce, université (Master) ou formation équivalente avec une spécialisation commerciale, administrative ou finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Faites preuve de rigueur et d&#39;attention aux détails dans le traitement des données financières et contractuelles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Savez gérer les priorités et travailler efficacement dans une periode de forte activité, notamment lors des périodes de closing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrisez les outils bureautiques (Excel, Google Sheets) et avez une appétence pour les outils de reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possédez d&#39;excellentes capacités de communication pour coordonner avec différentes équipes (Key Account Sales/Managers , Finance, Legal)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ce serait fantastique si :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez une première expérience en environnement commercial ou financier (stage, alternance, job étudiant)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous maîtrisez les processus de facturation B2B ou avez des notions de comptabilité&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous êtes à l&#39;aise avec les outils CRM et de gestion commerciale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre offre&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un programme d’onboarding complet, avec la Doctolib Academy et de nombreuses sessions de formation au sein de votre équipe (langues, soft skills, compétences techniques)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une carte Swile et de nombreuses offres de restauration au sein de nos locaux&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une offre de sport : un abonnement Urban Sports Club, des cours de sport gratuits dans les bureaux ou à distance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Le remboursement des titres de transport à 50%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;De nombreux bureaux offrant des espaces de collaboration et de bien-être&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une politique de travail flexible avec un mode hybride&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le processus de recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un entretien avec Flore, talent partner (15 minutes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un entretien avec Chloé, KA Sales Administration Manager, votre future manager (1 heure)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Détails du poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage conventionné à temps plein&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Durée : 6 mois&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Début souhaité : Janvier 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lieu de travail : Levallois-Perret&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rémunération : À définir selon niveau d&#39;études&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ce poste est éligible au télétravail partiel (3 jours au bureau, 2 jours en télétravail possibles)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Doctolib, nous sommes convaincus que nous devons améliorer la santé pour tout le monde. Cela se reflète dans notre processus de recrutement. Nous évaluons les candidatures uniquement sur la base des qualifications et de la motivation, sans aucune forme de discrimination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Plus les idées sont diverses, plus notre produit améliorera véritablement la santé pour tout le monde. Vous pouvez postuler chez Doctolib, quel que soit votre genre, religion, âge, orientation sexuelle, origine ethnique ou handicap.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Afin de garantir l&#39;égalité des chances, nous vous invitons à exclure les informations personnelles (par exemple : photos, âge) de vos candidatures. Si vous avez besoin d&#39;aménagements particuliers, merci de nous en informer pour que nous puissions adapter le processus de recrutement. Rejoignez-nous pour construire la santé dont nous rêvons tous !&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Toutes les informations fournies sont traitées par Doctolib pour la gestion des candidatures. Pour plus de détails sur le traitement des données, cliquez&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://media.doctolib.com/image/upload/mkg/file/privacy_notice_recrutement_fr_1.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;ici&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Veuillez contacter hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com pour toute question ou pour exercer vos droits.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Vos missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Au sein de Doctolib, le Customer Engineering est au cœur du cycle de vie client. En tant que Head of Customer Engineering, vous pilotez une organisation de 50 personnes répartie en quatre équipes couvrant l&#39;implémentation technique, la migration des données, le support engineering et le succès technique. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Votre rôle est de définir la direction stratégique de la fonction, de faire grandir vos managers et d&#39;accompagner l&#39;organisation dans une période de transformation ambitieuse. Vous créez les conditions pour que les équipes performent avec clarté et confiance, en connectant les enjeux techniques aux priorités client et business.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos responsabilités incluent, mais ne sont pas limitées à :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Définir et communiquer la vision, les priorités et le modèle opérationnel du Customer Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Piloter et développer les managers, clarifier les responsabilités et construire une culture managériale saine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Accompagner l&#39;organisation dans sa transformation en apportant stabilité, contexte et cap dans les périodes de changement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Renforcer la collaboration entre le Customer Engineering et les équipes Sales, Account Management, Support, Tech et Produit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Garantir que l&#39;implémentation technique, la migration des données, le support engineering et le succès technique génèrent une valeur mesurable pour les clients et le business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Améliorer la scalabilité via des modèles de service clairs, la planification des capacités, des standards de qualité, des outils, l&#39;automatisation et une utilisation responsable de l&#39;IA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Les qualités attendues en tant que Head of Customer Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Avant de poursuivre votre lecture, si vous n&#39;avez pas le profil exact décrit ci-dessous, mais que vous pensez que cette description de poste correspond à vos compétences et à vos aspirations, nous vous encourageons tout de même à postuler.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Vous pourrez être le prochain membre de notre équipe si vous :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Justifiez d&#39;une expérience significative à la tête d&#39;une organisation technique orientée client (customer facing) d&#39;environ 40 personnes ou plus, avec management de managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Avez un solide bilan en matière de transformation organisationnelle et de conduite du changement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Faites preuve d&#39;un style de leadership calme, empathique et crédible, avec la capacité de rassurer les équipes et de construire la confiance dans les périodes de changement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Disposez d&#39;excellentes compétences en communication, notamment pour expliquer clairement des décisions complexes et influencer des parties prenantes senior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Maîtrisez le français et l&#39;anglais à un niveau professionnel (C1 minimum).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Ce serait fantastique si :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Vous disposez d&#39;une profondeur technique suffisante pour challenger les hypothèses, comprendre les architectures clients et prendre des décisions éclairées sur les intégrations, les API et la gestion des données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Vous avez déjà construit des modèles opérationnels scalables ou des organisations de services techniques orientées client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Vous adoptez une approche fondée sur les données pour la priorisation, la planification des capacités et l&#39;amélioration continue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Notre offre&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Une mutuelle avantageuse prise en charge à 100 % par Doctolib (régime de base) pour les employés et leurs enfants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;25 jours de congés payés et 12 à 14 jours de RTT par an&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Un programme de santé mentale et de coaching personnalisé gratuit avec notre partenaire Moka.care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;10 jours par an de télétravail à l&#39;étranger possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Des tickets restaurant d&#39;une valeur de 8,50 € par jour, dont 4,50 € pris en charge par Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Adhésion au plan de partage de la valeur de Doctolib, appelé DoctoGrowth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Un programme d&#39;intégration complet de 3 mois incluant la Doctolib Academy et diverses formations (langues, soft skills, compétences techniques)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Une subvention du comité d&#39;entreprise pour le remboursement partiel d&#39;adhésions à des activités sportives ou de loisirs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Un remboursement à 50 % de l&#39;abonnement aux transports en commun&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Programme ParentCare : bénéficiez d&#39;un congé de naissance couvert par Doctolib à 100 % le premier mois et à 75 % le deuxième mois&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Pour les salariés en situation de handicap ou proches aidants, un package comprenant une adaptation du télétravail, des jours d&#39;absence autorisée payés pour les rendez-vous médicaux et un soutien psychologique renforcé&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Aide au déménagement en cas de mobilité internationale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Le processus de recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Entretien avec un recruteur :&lt;/strong&gt; Un échange pour découvrir votre parcours, vos motivations et évaluer l&#39;adéquation de vos compétences avec nos besoins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Rencontre avec nos Senior managers / Business Case :&lt;/strong&gt; Une étude de cas à préparer chez vous pour vous projeter sur le rôle avec restitution auprès de nos managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Échange avec notre Directeur de département :&lt;/strong&gt; Un approfondissement de votre candidature et de vos compétences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Prise de référence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Détails du poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;CDI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Temps plein&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Nantes ou Levallois-Perret — Hybride (2 jours de télétravail par semaine)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Prise de poste : dès que possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Doctolib, nous sommes convaincus que nous devons améliorer la santé pour tout le monde. Cela se reflète dans notre processus de recrutement. Nous évaluons les candidatures uniquement sur la base des qualifications et de la motivation, sans aucune forme de discrimination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Plus les idées sont diverses, plus notre produit améliorera véritablement la santé pour tout le monde. Vous pouvez postuler chez Doctolib, quel que soit votre genre, religion, âge, orientation sexuelle, origine ethnique ou handicap.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Afin de garantir l&#39;égalité des chances, nous vous invitons à exclure les informations personnelles (par exemple : photos, âge) de vos candidatures. Si vous avez besoin d&#39;aménagements particuliers, merci de nous en informer pour que nous puissions adapter le processus de recrutement. Rejoignez-nous pour construire la santé dont nous rêvons tous !&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Toutes les informations fournies sont traitées par Doctolib pour la gestion des candidatures. Pour plus de détails sur le traitement des données, cliquez&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;break-words font-semibold transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out hover:underline text-highlight hover:text-highlight-400 active:text-highlight-dark&quot; href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-FR&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;ici&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;em&gt;Veuillez contacter hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com pour toute question ou pour exercer vos droits.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Figma is growing our team of passionate creatives and builders on a mission to make design accessible to all. Figma’s platform helps teams bring ideas to life—whether you&#39;re brainstorming, creating a prototype, translating designs into code, or iterating with AI. From idea to product, Figma empowers teams to streamline workflows, move faster, and work together in real time from anywhere in the world. If you&#39;re excited to shape the future of design and collaboration, join us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Strategic Account Executive who will play a critical role driving sales and maximizing expansion opportunities with a defined list of top-tier Enterprise customers. You will be responsible for targeting, building and nurturing positive relationships with key C-level decision-makers, understanding complex business needs, and delivering innovative solutions across our product suite. This is an opportunity to accelerate your career, learn from leading sellers in the industry and build an incredible network of cross functional partners throughout Figma. This role is based in our Paris hub.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do at Figma:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a defined list of named strategic accounts to consistently meet or exceed quarterly and annual sales targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply effective discovery and value-selling techniques to build and strengthen C-level relationships for every account in your book&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align with executives on business challenges and gain sponsorship for enterprise wide deployments for a suite of products, identifying where Figma’s roadmap and innovations fit in the long term&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct thorough analysis to create strategic account plans that outline company priorities and initiatives, multi-threading at a senior level to build on expansion opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-create with cross-functional partners to expertly position Figma, drive deals forward and ensure customer success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage opportunities to advance executive level relationships through in-person meetings and networking opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience closing sales, over multiple years, for a software or SaaS business with the highest tier of Enterprise customers (5000+ FTEs), selling to executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent performance meeting pipeline generation targets for net new business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience successfully managing complex sales cycles (9 months+)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in a sales methodology and process that creates value for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in French and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;While it’s not required, it’s an added plus if you also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling solutions to technical audiences at the highest level in Engineering, Product and Design teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to succeed in a changing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certified in deal qualification and prospect discovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Figma, one of our values is Grow as you go. We believe in hiring smart, curious people who are excited to learn and develop their skills. If you’re excited about this role but your past experience doesn’t align perfectly with the points outlined in the job description, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Figma we celebrate and support our differences. We know employing a team rich in diverse thoughts, experiences, and opinions allows our employees, our product and our community to flourish. Figma is an &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2022-10/EEOC_KnowYourRights_screen_reader_10_20.pdf&quot;&gt;equal opportunity workplace&lt;/a&gt; - we are dedicated to equal employment opportunities regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity/expression, veteran status&lt;strong&gt;, &lt;/strong&gt;or any other characteristic protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will work to ensure individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to apply for a role, participate in the interview process, perform essential job functions, and receive other benefits and privileges of employment. If you require accommodation, please reach out to &lt;a ---------- These modifications enable an individual with a disability to have an equal opportunity not only to get a job, but successfully perform their job tasks to the same extent as people without disabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Examples of accommodations include but are not limited to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holding interviews in an accessible location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enabling closed captioning on video conferencing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring all written communication be compatible with screen readers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changing the mode or format of interviews&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure the integrity of our hiring process and facilitate a more personal connection, we require all candidates keep their cameras on during video interviews. Additionally, if hired you will be required to attend in person onboarding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this job, the candidate acknowledges and agrees that any personal data contained in their application or supporting materials will be processed in accordance with &lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Figma&#39;s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application limits:&lt;/strong&gt; To help candidates focus on the opportunities most relevant to their skills and experience, Figma limits the number and frequency of applications. These limits apply to all roles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates may submit up to 5 applications during any rolling 30-day period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates may not reapply to the same role while an application is active or within 90 days of receiving a rejection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Once the applicable days has passed, candidates are welcome to apply again.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Figma is growing our team of passionate creatives and builders on a mission to make design accessible to all. Figma’s platform helps teams bring ideas to life—whether you&#39;re brainstorming, creating a prototype, translating designs into code, or iterating with AI. From idea to product, Figma empowers teams to streamline workflows, move faster, and work together in real time from anywhere in the world. If you&#39;re excited to shape the future of design and collaboration, join us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Account Executive, Mid-Market who will play a critical role in driving sales and maximizing revenue with our customers. You will be responsible for targeting, building and nurturing positive relationships with key decision-makers, understanding complex business needs, and delivering innovative solutions across our product suite. This is an opportunity to accelerate your career, learn from leading sellers in the industry and build an incredible network of cross functional partners at Figma.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full time role in our Paris office within a hybrid environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you’ll do at Figma:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and manage a pipeline of Mid-Market accounts from inbound and outbound activity to consistently meet or surpass sales targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply effective discovery and value-selling techniques to build and strengthen relationships with key decision-makers in both new and existing customers (500-5000 FTEs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align with executives on business challenges and gain sponsorship for enterprise wide deployments for a suite of products, identifying where Figma’s roadmap and innovations fit in the long term&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct thorough analysis to create account plans that outline company priorities and initiatives, multi-threading at senior level to build on expansion opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a book of business by tiering accounts and initiating techniques to save contractions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-create with cross-functional partners to expertly position Figma, drive deals forward and ensure customer success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage opportunities to advance executive level relationships through in-person meetings and networking opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience closing sales, over multiple years, for a software or SaaS business with a book of customers (&amp;lt;5000 FTEs), selling to executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent performance meeting pipeline generation targets for net new business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience successfully managing complex sales cycles (3-9 months)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A sales methodology and process that creates value for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in French&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;While not required, it’s an added plus if you also have:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling solutions to technical audiences at executive level (i.e. Engineering, Product, Design teams)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to succeed in a changing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certified in deal qualification and prospect discovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Figma, one of our values is Grow as you go. We believe in hiring smart, curious people who are excited to learn and develop their skills. If you’re excited about this role but your past experience doesn’t align perfectly with the points outlined in the job description, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Figma we celebrate and support our differences. We know employing a team rich in diverse thoughts, experiences, and opinions allows our employees, our product and our community to flourish. Figma is an &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2022-10/EEOC_KnowYourRights_screen_reader_10_20.pdf&quot;&gt;equal opportunity workplace&lt;/a&gt; - we are dedicated to equal employment opportunities regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity/expression, veteran status&lt;strong&gt;, &lt;/strong&gt;or any other characteristic protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will work to ensure individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to apply for a role, participate in the interview process, perform essential job functions, and receive other benefits and privileges of employment. If you require accommodation, please reach out to &lt;a ---------- These modifications enable an individual with a disability to have an equal opportunity not only to get a job, but successfully perform their job tasks to the same extent as people without disabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Examples of accommodations include but are not limited to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holding interviews in an accessible location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enabling closed captioning on video conferencing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring all written communication be compatible with screen readers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changing the mode or format of interviews&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure the integrity of our hiring process and facilitate a more personal connection, we require all candidates keep their cameras on during video interviews. Additionally, if hired you will be required to attend in person onboarding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this job, the candidate acknowledges and agrees that any personal data contained in their application or supporting materials will be processed in accordance with &lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Figma&#39;s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application limits:&lt;/strong&gt; To help candidates focus on the opportunities most relevant to their skills and experience, Figma limits the number and frequency of applications. These limits apply to all roles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates may submit up to 5 applications during any rolling 30-day period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates may not reapply to the same role while an application is active or within 90 days of receiving a rejection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Once the applicable days has passed, candidates are welcome to apply again.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-lfile-container=&quot;d5053952-2b4c-4422-9693-d8a9db7a898d&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team and role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-lfile-container=&quot;d5053952-2b4c-4422-9693-d8a9db7a898d&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;Rubrik&#39;s sales organisation is a unified group of cross-functional professionals helping companies across every major industry, from financial services and manufacturing to the public sector, achieve true resilience against cyberattacks, malicious insiders and operational disruption. As an Account Executive in France, you will drive Rubrik&#39;s growth across one of Europe&#39;s most dynamic markets, owning the full sales cycle from first contact to close and building the pipeline that powers our growth across the French commercial landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what-youll-do&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute a territory sales plan for France, driving net new logo acquisition through disciplined prospecting, pipeline development and focused account pursuit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run complete sales cycles end to end, from discovery and qualification through solution design, negotiation and close, consistently building toward and exceeding your targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage a high-quality pipeline that balances breadth across your territory with depth in your highest-priority opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Solutions Engineers, Channel Development and Rubrik&#39;s partner ecosystem to position our data security platform against the full scope of customer risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop relationships with key decision makers and sponsors within target accounts, connecting Rubrik&#39;s capabilities to their most pressing business priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with channel partners, distributors and VARs to extend your reach and accelerate growth across the territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide market intelligence back to Rubrik leadership, including competitive signals, customer insights and partnership opportunities that shape our go-to-market in France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;experience-youll-need&quot;&gt;Experience you&#39;ll need&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 to 5 years of closing experience in technology sales (IT infrastructure, SaaS, or ideally both)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to source your own pipeline and land net new logos within the French market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in French and English; you engage confidently with business and technical stakeholders in both languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of buying cycles, procurement processes and multi-stakeholder decision making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A driven, goal-oriented approach; you hold yourself accountable to pipeline metrics and push consistently to convert activity into outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with channel partners as part of a broader go-to-market motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;preferred-qualifications&quot;&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in cybersecurity, data protection, backup and recovery, or adjacent infrastructure categories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MEDDPICC as a sales qualification and execution framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships within the French market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Salesforce for pipeline management and forecast accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;#LI-VR1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;#LI-hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (NYSE: RBRK) is the Security and AI Operations Company, delivering one platform built at the intersection of data, identity, and AI. The platform enables agentic cyber resilience and trusted AI operations for enterprises worldwide, built to recover before disruption strikes and stay a step ahead, so security is never the reason ambition stalls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/rubrikinc&quot;&gt;X (formerly Twitter)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rubrik.com&quot;&gt;Rubrik.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion @ Rubrik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world’s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Culture: We strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where individuals from all backgrounds feel a strong sense of belonging, can thrive, and do their best work. Your contributions help us innovate and break boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Communities: We are dedicated to expanding our engagement with the communities we operate in, creating opportunities for underrepresented talent and driving greater innovation for our clients. Your impact extends beyond Rubrik, contributing to safer and stronger communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer/Veterans/Disabled&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, protected veteran status, or any other status protected by applicable law. Rubrik provides equal employment opportunities to employees and applicants in all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, promotion, compensation, training, leave, and termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik provides reasonable accommodations to qualified applicants and employees with disabilities in accordance with applicable law. If you need an accommodation to participate in the application process or to perform your job, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- ----- Accommodations may include changes to the application process, documents in an alternate format, a sign language interpreter, or specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO IS THE LAW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/olms/regs/compliance/eo_posters/employeerightsposter2page_19final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;NOTIFICATION OF EMPLOYEE RIGHTS UNDER FEDERAL LABOR LAWS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;🧡 About Alma&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well‑balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place - serving merchants and consumers. Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience - without encouraging bad debt. As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered over +25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers. With 400+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;👐 About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join the Checkout Experience squad within Alma’s Consumer Tribe, reporting to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/tetianavorgul/&quot;&gt;Tetiana&lt;/a&gt;, Group Product Manager. The squad is composed of an Engineering Manager and several Software Engineers, and works on key parts of Alma’s consumer checkout experience across online and in-store journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Manager, you will join as an individual contributor and take ownership of strategic product topics spanning checkout conversion, account creation and identity verification. You will work at the intersection of consumer experience, merchant needs, business performance and regulatory requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position is a permanent contract (CDI) based in Paris with a hybrid working model.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;💼 About the job&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make checkout simpler and more effective:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and improve Alma’s checkout experience across e-commerce and in-store journeys, reducing friction and supporting conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn complexity into trusted experiences:&lt;/strong&gt; Own account creation and identity verification journeys, integrating KYC and CCD2 requirements into clear and seamless customer flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test, learn and repeat:&lt;/strong&gt; Use funnel analysis, customer insights and experimentation to identify opportunities, measure impact and continuously improve the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make it happen together:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with cross-functional stakeholders to prioritize the roadmap and balance consumer, merchant, business, risk and compliance needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🧰 You will work with&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Slack&lt;/strong&gt; for day-to-day cross-functional communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notion&lt;/strong&gt; for product documentation, briefs and roadmaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linear&lt;/strong&gt; for backlog and delivery tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Figma&lt;/strong&gt; for product design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Metabase&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Looker&lt;/strong&gt; for data analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🧩 About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;To succeed in this job&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have proven experience as a Product Manager working on checkout, e-commerce, payments or another high-volume consumer transaction experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand conversion funnels and experimentation, and are comfortable using data to identify opportunities, define success metrics and prioritize initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can turn complex customer needs, business constraints and regulatory requirements into simple, intuitive product experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You demonstrate strong ownership, structured problem-solving and effective cross-functional collaboration, while using AI tools to improve your product work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;And it will be nice if you...&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with account creation, identity verification, authentication, KYC or fraud prevention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have built products in regulated environments, ideally within payments, BNPL, lending, consumer finance or another financial services context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked on in-store, POS or omnichannel experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with European markets or an interest in emerging purchase journeys, including agentic commerce and AI-assisted transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don&#39;t meet every single requirement? At Alma, we believe great hires come from diverse paths. If this role excites you, we encourage you to apply. We value potential, curiosity and the ability to grow as much as experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🧘 What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you join, you will be able to grow and impact on:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive measurable impact on Alma’s checkout conversion across both e-commerce and in-store experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a strategic product scope at the intersection of checkout, payments, identity and regulation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the future of checkout, including new purchase journeys initiated by AI agents and LLM assistants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🤑 Compensation &amp;amp; benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary based on 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Profit-sharing and employee savings plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance: 100% covered by Alma including family package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disability insurance: 100% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sport: partnerships with Gymlib and Classpass, or €30/month reimbursement for your sports activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maternity/paternity leave: salary maintained at 100% during leave with no seniority requirement. Return to work at 4/5 schedule paid at 100% for 8 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sustainable Mobility Package (FMD): €544.80/year (excluding full-remote contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal vouchers: €10/day, 50% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health: free access to MindDay platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off: 25 days/year (+ additional paid leave granted for employees on executive contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to our Learning &amp;amp; Development Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 weeks of full remote possible per year in summer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🎯 Interview Process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video call with a Talent Acquisition team member to understand your path, motivation &amp;amp; present you the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video call with your future manager to deep dive the role, the team, your profile and answer all your questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Case study presentation with 2 team members (ideally in house) to assess your practical knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A coffee chat to further assess your skills and team fit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;References check.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🌍 Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Alma, we believe that diversity fuels innovation and makes our community stronger. We are committed to building a workplace where every person feels seen, respected, and empowered to do their best work whatever their gender, background, ethnicity, age, sexual orientation, religion, disability or lived experience. As an equal opportunity employer, we welcome applicants from all walks of life, and all employment decisions are made based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Auterion builds a cutting-edge operating system for autonomous robotic systems that empower a diverse range of platforms to perform surveillance, reconnaissance, inspection, mapping and logistics tasks. Our industry-leading software drives the adoption of robotic fleets and is recognized by the U.S. government as the future standard for its drone programs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Embedded Performance Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; who is passionate about getting the most out of embedded systems — from low-level Linux tuning and hardware integration to high-performance video and data pipelines. This role is ideal for someone who enjoys working close to hardware, moving across the stack, and solving the kinds of problems where milliseconds, bandwidth, startup time, and system efficiency matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work across the AuterionOS ecosystem on topics such as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embedded Linux performance and system tuning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low-latency video streaming and media pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;C/C++, Python, and Bash-based platform development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hardware integration, system profiling, and end-to-end optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration with experienced and driven engineers across Auterion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within the Apps &amp;amp; Simulation team and collaborate with other development teams to build high-performance products for autonomous systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, optimize, and maintain performance-critical components within AuterionOS, Auterion’s custom embedded Linux distribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve end-to-end system behavior across compute, networking, video, and hardware interfaces, with a strong focus on latency, throughput, reliability, and resource efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and optimize demanding workloads such as real-time telemetry, video streaming, media processing, and communication between distributed system components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate system bottlenecks across the full stack, from kernel and OS behavior to application-level code and tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering and product teams to understand both internal and customer use cases, and translate them into robust technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose and implement new platform capabilities with a strong emphasis on measurable performance gains in real-world deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in daily stand-ups, release planning, and prioritization discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.Sc. or M.Sc. in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience writing object-oriented C++ and/or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with embedded Linux systems, including cross-compilation, debugging, profiling, and performance tuning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on background in diagnosing and optimizing real-world system behavior, including CPU, memory, I/O, networking, boot time, and application latency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or optimizing low-latency video or data-streaming pipelines, ideally on embedded platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent understanding of software systems that span embedded devices, higher-level applications, and fully integrated products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering fundamentals, including system design, implementation, debugging, and testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with video codecs, GStreamer, RTP/RTSP, or hardware-accelerated media pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with Debian/Ubuntu-based systems, Bash scripting, and systemd.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Docker and docker-compose in complex development and deployment environments, as well as qemu.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong debugging and performance analysis skills at both system and application level, combined with a proactive and self-directed working style.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in ROS2/DDS-style middleware and experienced with networking across multiple OSI layers, including REST APIs and performance-sensitive communication paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with system integration and interfacing sensors or peripherals, especially via USB and Ethernet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in an agile engineering environment with stand-ups, sprint planning, and shared ownership across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: Experience with build systems such as CMake, including improving build performance in large-scale software projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car parking&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;As an Electronics Engineer, you will be a member of our interdisciplinary hardware engineering team, contributing to the design and development of electronics for our next-generation drone platforms. You’ll work on electronic modules such as flight controllers, sensors, and vision systems, supporting PCB development from concept through production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of a cross-functional team, you will contribute to advanced systems such as interceptor and reconnaissance drones with integrated visual navigation, as well as quadcopters for defense applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, prototype, and validate avionics PCBs, sensors, and electronic modules for drone platforms, contributing to designs from initial concepts through detailed design and manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support PCB and product verification activities, including test planning, execution, and documentation; contribute to electrical and mechanical validation such as EMI/EMC compliance testing, thermal cycling, and mechanical shock testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain technical documentation, including design concepts, schematics and CAD drawings, bills of materials (BOMs), assembly instructions, and repair documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with test engineering, manufacturing, and production teams to support the transition of hardware designs from development to production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with hardware and software engineers to define electronics requirements, system interfaces, and design solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support troubleshooting and design improvements based on test results, production feedback, and field performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development and improvement of engineering processes and best practices within the hardware team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Electrical or Electronics Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in PCB design and electronic product development, including prototyping, layout, and testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of mixed-signal PCB design, signal integrity, and power integrity principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with PCB testing and troubleshooting, including basic EMC considerations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Altium Designer is required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with high-power applications, ESCs, and lithium batteries is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, solution-oriented mindset with a proactive approach to problem-solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively as part of a cross-functional hardware/software team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good problem-solving and communication skills, with a willingness to learn and take ownership of assigned tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CH/EU citizenship required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car parking&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Lead Backend Engineer &lt;/strong&gt;in the &lt;strong&gt;Service Standards&lt;/strong&gt; team, you will shape how services are built, deployed, and operated across all of Vinted. You will work closely with a team on the development of our core service framework—providing engineering teams with golden paths, robust service contracts, standardized tooling, and performance benchmarks to ensure high reliability and developer velocity at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will sit in the Service Standards team, part of the Service Ecosystem domain, reporting to the Engineering Manager of that team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Service Standards team is responsible for standardizing service startup, consumer APIs, and foundational backend frameworks across Vinted&#39;s engineering landscape. Within it, this is a senior individual-contributor role combining technical leadership with high autonomy—you will define architectural directions, establish best practices, and guide engineers across domains without requiring full management overhead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will collaborate closely with platform, observability, and product engineering teams to ensure our service framework and standards seamlessly integrate into daily workflows. Your work will directly impact developer experience, platform reliability, and system performance as Vinted continues to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the technical direction and design around service standards and golden paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and evolve company-wide service standards, including consumer APIs, service contracts, startup routines, and performance guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable backend libraries, tools, and scaffolding to streamline new service creation and maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with backend engineers across domains to drive adoption of framework updates and gather continuous feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate pragmatic trade-offs between architectural consistency, delivery speed, and technical debt across the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Observability and Infrastructure teams to integrate telemetry, SLOs, and resilience practices into standard service templates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure security, privacy, and compliance guidelines are embedded directly into service contracts and framework templates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor senior backend engineers, participate in architectural design reviews, and foster high engineering standards across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive architectural proposals (RFCs/ADRs) for platform-wide backend standardization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have deep backend engineering experience and strong architectural intuition, with proven success building scalable services and frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate a track record of driving cross-team technical alignment and leading complex initiatives across multiple engineering groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess expert knowledge in designing API contracts, service startup patterns, and performance optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand trade-offs in platform design and know how to build golden paths that engineers love to use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate technical vision and architectural choices clearly to both technical leads and engineering leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy mentoring engineers, conducting design reviews, and sharing best practices to level up the backend engineering community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per working day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NS Business Card for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€93.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€126.500 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Our Purpose&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SentinelOne, we are driven by a clear purpose: to give the advantage to those who secure our future. As AI reshapes how organizations build, operate, and innovate, the responsibility to protect them becomes more critical than ever. When you join SentinelOne, your work helps protect global enterprises, critical infrastructure, and the technologies shaping tomorrow. If you are motivated by meaningful challenges and want your impact to be real, measurable, and global, you will find purpose here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SentinelOne is a company at the intersection of AI and security, pioneering a new operating model for cybersecurity. Our AI-native platform unifies protection across endpoint, cloud, identity, data, and AI systems to deliver autonomous detection and response with clarity and speed. By combining real-time analytics, intelligent automation, and a unified data foundation, we reduce noise, simplify complexity, and empower security teams to focus on what truly matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our teams are builders, problem-solvers, and innovators committed to shaping the future of security. If you are excited to solve hard problems alongside talented, mission-driven people, we invite you to help us build a safer future for humanity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Are We Looking For?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for people who are relentlessly curious and committed to continuous learning. AI is reshaping every function across our business, and we enable every team member, regardless of role or level, to build fluency in AI tools and concepts. Those who thrive here actively seek out new solutions, experiment thoughtfully, and apply what they learn to drive better, faster, smarter outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Manager, Commercial Sales, you will lead and inspire a team of Commercial Sales Representatives covering diverse markets and segments across Southern EMEA, driving results through hands-on coaching, strategic pipeline management, and a relentless focus on exceeding targets. You will combine deep commercial expertise with a passion for developing people, building the programs, partnerships, and team culture needed to sustain high performance in a fast-moving, competitive cybersecurity market. If you are a creative self-starter who thrives on both leading from the front and investing in the success of those around you, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What Will You Do?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Primary responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, expand, and coach a team of Commercial Sales Representatives covering multiple Southern EMEA markets and segments — providing the resources, training, and day-to-day guidance needed to consistently achieve and exceed targets, including active call shadowing and ad hoc feedback sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute and supervise end-to-end sales activities including prospecting, lead follow-up, opportunity qualification, proof of concept management, commercial negotiation, and deal closure, while proactively managing the team’s funnel to ensure both quantity and quality of opportunities are on track for quota attainment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct and execute quarterly business plans, create and develop new programs and campaigns in conjunction with Marketing and Sales, and design incentive plans and SPIFFs that foster a competitive, collaborative, and high-energy team environment — operating with confidence and limited guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set accurate business expectations and maintain clear communication with senior sales management, measuring and reporting against KPIs and creating ad hoc reports as needed, while maintaining a thorough working knowledge of SentinelOne’s full product capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in recruiting, hiring, and onboarding top commercial sales talent, and invest deeply in the growth and long-term success of each team member through mentoring, career development, and a genuine commitment to both individual and collective goal attainment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What Skills and Knowledge Will You Bring?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideal candidates will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven sales management experience in a B2B SaaS environment, with a track record of exceeding goals as both an individual contributor and a team leader — cybersecurity or endpoint security experience is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in an indirect, two-tier go-to-market model that includes channel partners and distributors, with a solid understanding of how to maximize reach and performance through partner ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build and lead highly skilled, motivated, and results-oriented commercial sales teams, with a passion for coaching and mentoring emerging sales talent and experience delivering both positive and constructive feedback that drives real growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills — verbal, written, and presentation — combined with strong interpersonal skills, a customer-focused mindset, and the organizational ability to create and track individual and team metrics with precision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A creative, “roll-up-the-sleeves” self-starter attitude with the energy to thrive in a fast-paced, continuously evolving environment, and the ability to inspire a collaborative team culture focused on collective lead generation and quota attainment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why SentinelOne?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is redefining how the world operates and rewriting the rules of security in real time, and SentinelOne was built for this moment. From day one, we architected an AI-native platform designed to operate at machine speed, not as an add-on to legacy systems but as the foundation itself. If you want to build where innovation and impact move together, this is that place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in our Sentinels with comprehensive, competitive benefits designed to support you and your family:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity &amp;amp; Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Restricted Stock Units (RSUs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Stock Purchase Plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive leave benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gender-neutral parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insurance &amp;amp; Financial Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Insurance and medical allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Perks &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global home office allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile phone reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter or work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness &amp;amp; Lifestyle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;SentinelOne is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;SentinelOne participates in the E-Verify Program for all U.S. based roles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More about the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Consultant (Account Director) in the Burson Tech PR team you will be heading up business technology accounts for some of the biggest businesses in this space. We are looking for someone with deep knowledge of B2B technology comms, with an understanding of the B2C landscape also, who can lead a team to deliver outstanding work for clients who are the industry leaders in this space. You’ll be someone who thrives in fast paced environments and experienced in working with globally recognised businesses who lead their fields and expect their communications to as well.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We treat our Senior Consultants as both client and business leaders, expecting strong client counsel, energetic and committed team leadership, ambition to create award-winning work, and a consistent commitment to day-to-day excellence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trusted client counsel&lt;/strong&gt;: Serve as the trusted senior point of contact for clients, providing strategic counsel and developing a comprehensive understanding of client objectives and industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Planning and Creativity:&lt;/strong&gt; Know what gets cut through in the business space and be able to develop and deliver creative storytelling that lands great coverage and content&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day to day leader &amp;amp; Quality control&lt;/strong&gt;: Direct overall account activity, ensuring seamless execution, brilliant delivery, and consistently high levels of client service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team leader&lt;/strong&gt;: Provide clear direction, motivate, and foster the professional growth of your team members, embodying strong leadership qualities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactivity:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive innovative execution for day-to-day press office work and campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Confident problem solver&lt;/strong&gt;: Apply strong analytical and problem-solving skills, confidently challenging senior members and/or clients in pursuit of strategic integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team player&lt;/strong&gt;: Play an active and helpful part in client teams and broader Burson initiatives, demonstrating effective time management and acting as an agency ambassador&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Media Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll have a nose for news and know how to develop excellent and insightful media strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience that contributes to success:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Established B2B Tech Senior Manager or Account Director experience, with broad expertise across areas such as Enterprise Tech, Cyber Tech or Fintech preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of how to build and deliver effective media strategies for the new media era.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated knowledge of media tech and enterprise technology&amp;nbsp;with a &#39;nose for news&#39;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A robust network of relevant media contacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage fast-paced, ambitious clients and dynamic portfolios, providing exceptional client counsel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energetic and committed team leadership experience, capable of inspiring and motivating teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High levels of Intelligence, Initiative, and Integrity, with an ambition to create award-winning work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, problem-solving, and time management skills, coupled with a commitment to day-to-day excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-RE1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Flexport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Flexport, we believe global trade can move the human race forward. That’s why it’s our mission to make global commerce so easy there will be more of it. We’re shaping the future of a $10T industry with solutions powered by innovative technology and exceptional people. Today, companies of all sizes—from emerging brands to Fortune 500s—use Flexport technology to move more than $19B of merchandise across 112 countries a year.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The recent global supply chain crisis has put Flexport center stage as we continue to play a pivotal role in how goods move around the world. We are proud to have the support of the best investors in the game who believe in our mission, solutions and people. Ready to tackle global challenges that impact business, society, and the environment? Come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities as a &lt;strong&gt;Director, EMEA Ocean Operations&lt;/strong&gt; include, but are not limited to the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a leadership team of Senior Managers and Managers, who in turn run Ocean Operations teams across EMEA. You are accountable for organisation design, hiring plans and succession planning at every level beneath you. You build a culture of high performance and psychological safety, and you make sure the organisation scales with the business rather than just adding people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end EMEA ocean gateway operations (FCL and LCL) across all markets, both insourced and partner-operated countries. You set one operating standard for how work is done, and you decide where it makes sense for local markets to differ.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and deliver the multi-year EMEA ocean strategy and the planning cycles that support it (biannual planning and quarterly check-ins). You separate what the core operation needs to keep running well from what is expansion, and you turn that into clear choices on investment, team size and priorities, aligned with EMEA operations goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and drive the EMEA ocean automation roadmap with your teams. You decide where to remove manual work first, so that volume growth does not need proportional growth in manual work, and you work with Product, Engineering and Operational Excellence to deliver it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the senior operations voice to EMEA Operational Excellence, Global Product and Engineering. You turn operational pain points across EMEA into clear product priorities, and you help decide what gets built.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report to the EMEA Head of Operations and serve as a member of the EMEA Senior Leadership Team. You help set the direction for EMEA as a whole, not just for your own area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with EMEA commercial leadership (GMs) and global operations leaders in other regions. You make sure commercial promises and operational reality match, you flag deal and delivery risk early, and you share what works across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold executive-level relationships with key clients, carriers and partner operators. You lead major escalations, negotiate service commitments with partners, and represent EMEA operations in client business reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data to find the biggest bottlenecks and root causes across markets, not just fix individual cases. You set the metrics the organisation runs on and make sure leaders at every level are held to them in regular reviews (weekly, monthly and quarterly business reviews).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the long-term capacity plan. You work with Operations Excellence and Finance on staffing models that cope with seasonal peaks and multi-year growth, including the balance between insourced teams and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the P&amp;amp;L and operational health of EMEA ocean gateway operations. You set the financial discipline for your area, stop revenue and cost leakage at scale (for example, billing accessorials), and make sure your leaders do the same in their teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prerequisites:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS degree in Logistics, Supply Chain Management or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of measurable business results, including quantified impact on quality, productivity, efficiency and customer service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in cross-border supply chains, logistics and/or freight forwarding, with ocean freight experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of people management experience, including managing managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in customer-facing roles, with experience managing senior client or partner relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running operations across several countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technology (and AI) first mindset, comfortable in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent English; ideally other European languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent technical skills (e.g. Claude, N8N, Looker, Excel)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owner&#39;s mindset and strong discipline across the whole organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer obsession, with high standards as a point of pride&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An operator at heart who removes waste and redesigns processes for lean, scalable efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dives into metrics to fix root causes while delivering the short-term wins that stabilise operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds trust through transparent, concise communication and encourages the team to challenge the status quo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An opportunity to contribute to one of the fastest-growing companies, where you’ll have the chance to create a global impact while being a part of a&amp;nbsp; thriving multinational environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily catered lunches incl. vegetarian options, breakfast, snacks and soft drinks available in our office on daily basis&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commute expenses: Flexport will cover&amp;nbsp; home-office commuting costs for employees living outside of Amsterdam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazing office in the heart of Amsterdam.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 working days as vacation days based on full time employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance: Flexport offers a collective health insurance plan including a basic package and any available additional packages. Your monthly premium is fully paid by Flexport.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A defined pension contribution scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity program: every team member becomes a shareholder, aligning our success with yours. As a private company in a multi-trillion dollar industry, you have a direct stake in our collective growth and success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program through Aetna Resources for Living: Flexport provides an employer-sponsored program at no cost to you and your household members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave benefit: Flexport is here to support you and your families in one of the most important times in life – the birth of a child! Our parental leave program allows both mothers and partners to take time off from work for pregnancy, childbirth, and to bond with your new child.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-onsite&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-AS1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;1704749847.557549&quot; class=&quot;c-virtual_list__item&quot; data-qa=&quot;virtual-list-item&quot; data-item-key=&quot;1704749847.557549&quot;&gt;
