&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;This is a hybrid role and can be based either from our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;London&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;Glasgow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; or Manchester offices, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;s well as &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; home. &lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;There will be r&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;egular, planned travel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;involv&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;ing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; overnight stays near our offices and other UK locations for &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;customer / internal &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;meetings, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; and training. Occasional planned international travel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; is expected&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Total Reward&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;We offer competitive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; and equal pay which &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;reflects the skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;experience&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;and performance &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;the individual. Any reward &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;package will be discussed &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;honestly &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;during the interview process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Our people&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;have the opportunity to earn performance-based bonuses &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;or &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;commission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; and everyone can benefit from paid holiday, private healthcare, private dental care, life assurance, pension, retail discounts and monthly w&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;ellbeing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We set the bar high and won&#39;t extend an offer until we&#39;re convinced we&#39;ve found the right candidate. This is why a job may stay open for months or be reposted several times. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Studies suggest that women tend not to apply for a job if their CV isn’t a perfect fit. Here, talent takes precedence over experience. So if you like the role and think you could be awesome at it in time, go ahead and apply. HSO is an equal opportunity employer. We will consider for employment any applicant and provide reasonable accommodations for an individual with disabilities - just let us know how we can support you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Cloud Solution Architect - Data &amp;amp; AI&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; UK (Hybrid)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice:&lt;/strong&gt; Data &amp;amp; AI&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About HSO&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HSO is a Business Transformation Partner with deep industry expertise and global reach. As one of Microsoft&#39;s leading partners, we help organisations unlock the full potential of Microsoft Dynamics 365, Azure, Data and AI technologies to deliver meaningful business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With operations across Europe, North America and Asia, HSO combines industry knowledge, technical excellence and a people-first culture to help customers modernise their businesses, transform operations and embrace innovation with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As demand for Data &amp;amp; AI solutions continues to accelerate, we&#39;re expanding our Data &amp;amp; AI practice and looking for experienced Cloud Solution Architects to help shape the next generation of customer transformation programmes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;The Role&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Cloud Solution Architect - Data &amp;amp; AI&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll play a pivotal role in shaping and qualifying customer opportunities across the Microsoft cloud ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly visible role that sits at the intersection of &lt;strong&gt;sales, enterprise architecture and delivery&lt;/strong&gt;, combining technical leadership with commercial thinking. You&#39;ll work closely with customers, Microsoft and internal stakeholders to understand business challenges, identify opportunities, design compelling solutions and create clear pathways from initial discovery through to successful delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll help organisations transform the way they use data, analytics and artificial intelligence, translating business ambition into practical, costed and deliverable solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role requires more than technical expertise. You&#39;ll need strong consulting and stakeholder management skills, the confidence to challenge assumptions, and the commercial awareness to ensure opportunities are both valuable for clients and aligned with HSO&#39;s delivery capability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Opportunity Qualification &amp;amp; Solution Shaping&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Data &amp;amp; AI opportunity qualification alongside Account Managers, Business Development teams and Enterprise Architects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate customer discovery workshops, architecture assessments and strategic discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand customer business drivers, challenges and desired outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help customers define realistic transformation roadmaps aligned to business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify opportunities using structured sales and consulting methodologies, including MEDDIC/MEDDICC approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Solution Architecture &amp;amp; Advisory&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design end-to-end Data &amp;amp; AI solutions using Microsoft technologies and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape modern analytics, AI and data platform architectures that are commercially viable and technically deliverable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide architectural leadership across data platform modernisation, analytics, AI and automation initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment with Microsoft Cloud Adoption Framework and Azure Well-Architected principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate architectural trade-offs and recommendations to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Commercial Leadership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer requirements into proposals, statements of work, delivery plans and business cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce solution estimates, cost models and phased implementation approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support customers in understanding ROI, value realisation and investment considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge unclear scope and identify delivery, cost and commercial risks early in the sales cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with delivery teams to validate assumptions before commitments are made.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Go-to-Market&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the evolution of HSO&#39;s Data &amp;amp; AI propositions and repeatable offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop demonstrations, accelerators, sales collateral and industry-specific solution narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support RFPs, bid responses, executive presentations and proof-of-concept engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Microsoft stakeholders to drive pipeline growth and co-sell opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep up to date with emerging Microsoft technologies and industry trends across Data &amp;amp; AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate combines strong technical capability with exceptional commercial awareness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be equally comfortable discussing board-level business outcomes with executive stakeholders as you are diving into architecture decisions with technical teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Consulting Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in a Solution Architecture, Pre-Sales, Consulting or Technical Advisory role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within a Microsoft partner, consultancy or enterprise technology environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen and experience creating proposals, business cases and Statements of Work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to qualify opportunities and challenge assumptions constructively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent workshop facilitation, discovery and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience presenting to senior business and technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to translate complex technical concepts into clear business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of opportunity qualification methodologies such as MEDDIC or MEDDICC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience across industries such as manufacturing, retail, financial services, healthcare, public sector, not-for-profit, utilities or professional services would be advantageous.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Technical Experience&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We recognise that few candidates will have expertise across every area listed below. We&#39;re primarily looking for strong Data &amp;amp; AI architecture experience across the Microsoft ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Essential&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Data &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Microsoft Fabric&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lakehouse architecture patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Power BI and self-service analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Semantic modelling and reporting solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data platform modernisation and analytics strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Azure Data Platform&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure Data Lake Storage (ADLS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure Synapse Analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure Databricks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure SQL Database&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure Cosmos DB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure Data Factory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;AI &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure AI Services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure OpenAI Service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure AI Foundry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Copilot Studio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agentic AI patterns and intelligent automation solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document intelligence and AI-driven business use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Data Engineering &amp;amp; Platform Delivery&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python and/or PySpark&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data pipelines and transformation frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI/CD concepts and deployment automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure DevOps and/or GitHub&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Infrastructure as Code awareness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Environment promotion and release management approaches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Advantageous&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Data Governance &amp;amp; Security&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Microsoft Purview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data governance frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data lineage and catalogue solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Information protection concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Role-based access control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure Key Vault&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Secure platform design principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Integration &amp;amp; Application Connectivity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure Logic Apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure Functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure Service Bus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure API Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise integration patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational and analytical workload integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Certifications&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Microsoft certifications are not essential but are highly desirable, particularly across:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Microsoft Azure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Microsoft Fabric&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Artificial Intelligence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a leading Microsoft partner, HSO actively invests in certification, specialisation and continuous learning, helping our consultants stay at the forefront of Microsoft&#39;s rapidly evolving technology landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Why Join HSO?&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an exciting opportunity to join one of Microsoft&#39;s most respected global partners during a period of significant growth in Data &amp;amp; AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll have the opportunity to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the future of HSO&#39;s Data &amp;amp; AI propositions and offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside Microsoft on strategic customer initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence major digital, data and AI transformation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help organisations realise measurable value from data and artificial intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with some of the most innovative technologies in the Microsoft ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with highly skilled consultants, architects and delivery professionals across the globe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from continuous professional development, certification support and access to Microsoft&#39;s latest technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most importantly, you&#39;ll have the freedom to combine commercial thinking, architectural leadership and innovation to create meaningful outcomes for customers and make a real impact on the future of Data &amp;amp; AI transformation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to help shape the future of Data &amp;amp; AI? We&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Anthropic Residency is our paid, fixed-term research program, with placements lasting between six weeks and six months. We are looking for people who have led ambitious work in a variety of technical fields and want to transition to full-time work focused on making sure AI systems are safe and beneficial for all of humanity. If you are a &lt;strong&gt;professor in a quantitative discipline, a technical founder or a staff-level engineer&lt;/strong&gt; and want to transition to work on transformative AI, we want to hear from you. Background in machine learning is not required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A concrete, scoped project matched to your background, with direct mentorship from Anthropic researchers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Claude models and GPU compute&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connection to the broader AI safety and security research community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The interview process will include an initial application, recruiter screen, technical assessment, research discussion and a reference check.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applications for this round close on November 22, 2026 (11:59 PM PT). We expect to make offers in January 2027.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are motivated by making sure AI is safe and beneficial for society as a whole&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are excited to transition into working on empirical AI research full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have led ambitious work in a variety of technical fields (professor in a quantitative discipline, a technical founder or a staff-level engineer)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in fast-paced, collaborative environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can implement ideas quickly and communicate clearly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong candidates may also&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience authoring research papers in machine learning, NLP, or AI safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with LLMs, reinforcement learning or Kubernetes clusters and complex shared codebases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentors and research areas&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Potential Anthropic mentors include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/sara-price-310757b2/&quot;&gt;Sara Price&lt;/a&gt;: leads the Alignment Training team; background in data science&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ethanperez.net/&quot;&gt;Ethan Perez&lt;/a&gt;: leads the Alignment Science team; background in machine learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://evhub.github.io/&quot;&gt;Evan Hubinger&lt;/a&gt;: leads the Alignment Stress-Testing team; formerly at The Machine Intelligence Research Institute (MIRI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=fW7yK10AAAAJ&amp;amp;hl=en&quot;&gt;Samuel Marks&lt;/a&gt;: leads the Scalable Oversight team; background in mathematics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://elanapearl.github.io/&quot;&gt;Elana Simon&lt;/a&gt;: researches the interpretability of language models and biological models; background in biomedical informatics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://belindal.github.io/&quot;&gt;Belinda Li&lt;/a&gt;: researches how language models represent the world, users, and themselves; background in natural language processing (PhD, MIT)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jlindsey15.github.io/&quot;&gt;Jack Lindsey&lt;/a&gt;: leads the Model Psychology team; background in theoretical neuroscience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nicholas.carlini.com/&quot;&gt;Nicholas Carlini&lt;/a&gt;: researches adversarial machine learning and AI security; previously at DeepMind and Google Brain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sohldickstein.com/&quot;&gt;Jascha Sohl-Dickstein&lt;/a&gt;: works at the intersection of safety and pretraining; background in physics and neuroscience, formerly Principal Scientist at Google Brain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Residents will work on empirical research questions in collaboration with Anthropic&#39;s research teams. Areas we are particularly interested in include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI safety &amp;amp; alignment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scalable Oversight: Developing techniques to keep highly capable models helpful and honest, even as they surpass human-level intelligence in various domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adversarial Robustness and AI Control: Creating methods to ensure advanced AI systems remain safe and harmless in unfamiliar or adversarial scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model Organisms: Creating &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/ChDH335ckdvpxXaXX/model-organisms-of-misalignment-the-case-for-a-new-pillar-of-1&quot;&gt;model organisms of misalignment&lt;/a&gt; to improve our empirical understanding of how alignment failures might arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model Internals and Interpretability: Advancing our understanding of the internal workings of large language models to enable more targeted interventions and safety measures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Safeguards Research: Developing robust defenses against adversarial attacks, comprehensive evaluation frameworks for model safety, and automated systems to detect and mitigate potential risks before deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI Welfare: Improving our understanding of potential AI welfare and developing related evaluations and mitigations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI security &amp;amp; frontier red-teaming&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stress-testing frontier models to understand the full extent of their current capabilities in fields such as cybersecurity, robotics or cryptography.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ML systems &amp;amp; reinforcement learning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improving how frontier models are trained and building the infrastructure behind that research, from model architecture, optimizers and training data to accelerator simulators, hardware backends and RL environment pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For a fuller picture of the questions we care about, see our &lt;a href=&quot;https://alignment.anthropic.com/2025/recommended-directions/&quot;&gt;Recommendations for Technical AI Safety Research Directions&lt;/a&gt; and recent publications from our &lt;a href=&quot;https://alignment.anthropic.com/&quot;&gt;Alignment&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://transformer-circuits.pub/&quot;&gt;Interpretability&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://red.anthropic.com/&quot;&gt;Frontier Red&lt;/a&gt; teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration:&lt;/strong&gt; Placements are six weeks, three months or six months, depending on team fit and candidate preferences. Other lengths between three and six months are possible by exception.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; This application is for a remote UK position, with the option to work from our London office. However, we prefer that Residents work from our San Francisco office, where most of our research staff is based, but remote participation is possible, especially for shorter placements. Most full-time research roles at Anthropic require relocation to San Francisco. Remote participants need to be based in a country where Anthropic can hire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commitment:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time role for the duration of the residency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt; £265,000 to £375,000/year pro-rated for the duration of the residency + benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt; We sponsor visas for placements of three months or longer. For six-week placements we encourage remote participation from a country where Anthropic can hire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants may also be considered for the &lt;a href=&quot;https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/anthropic/jobs/5183044008&quot;&gt;Anthropic Fellows Program&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For sales roles, the range provided is the role’s On Target Earnings (&quot;OTE&quot;) range, meaning that the range includes both the sales commissions/sales bonuses target and annual base salary for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£265,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£375,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education, training, and/or experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required field of study:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;A field relevant to the role as demonstrated through coursework, training, or professional experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Years of experience required will correlate with the internal job level requirements for the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-based hybrid policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently, we expect all staff to be in one of our offices at least 25% of the time. However, some roles may require more time in our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We do sponsor visas! However, we aren&#39;t able to successfully sponsor visas for every role and every candidate. But if we make you an offer, we will make every reasonable effort to get you a visa, and we retain an immigration lawyer to help with this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not believe you meet every single qualification.&lt;/strong&gt; Not all strong candidates will meet every single qualification as listed.&amp;nbsp; Research shows that people who identify as being from underrepresented groups are more prone to experiencing imposter syndrome and doubting the strength of their candidacy, so we urge you not to exclude yourself prematurely and to submit an application if you&#39;re interested in this work. We think AI systems like the ones we&#39;re building have enormous social and ethical implications. We think this makes representation even more important, and we strive to include a range of diverse perspectives on our team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt; To protect yourself from potential scams, remember that Anthropic recruiters only contact you ----- addresses. In some cases, we may partner with vetted recruiting agencies who will identify themselves as working on behalf of Anthropic. Be cautious of emails from other domains. Legitimate Anthropic recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before your first day. If you&#39;re ever unsure about a communication, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u data-stringify-type=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;anthropic.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;directly for confirmed position openings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the highest-impact AI research will be big science. At Anthropic we work as a single cohesive team on just a few large-scale research efforts. And we value impact — advancing our long-term goals of steerable, trustworthy AI — rather than work on smaller and more specific puzzles. We view AI research as an empirical science, which has as much in common with physics and biology as with traditional efforts in computer science. We&#39;re an extremely collaborative group, and we host frequent research discussions to ensure that we are pursuing the highest-impact work at any given time. As such, we greatly value communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to understand our research directions is to read our recent research. This research continues many of the directions our team worked on prior to Anthropic, including: GPT-3, Circuit-Based Interpretability, Multimodal Neurons, Scaling Laws, AI &amp;amp; Compute, Concrete Problems in AI Safety, and Learning from Human Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come work with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;About the opportunity&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Enterprise Account Executive (f/m/d) for UKI , you’ll drive Contentful’s growth by spearheading the end-to-end sales process from prospecting to close. You’ll be instrumental in driving net new revenue and uncovering upsell opportunities with existing and new Customers. You’ll drive Customer enablement initiatives and follow a consultative sales process by speaking the language of both professional technologists and business leaders. Working in partnership with our Customer Experience, BDR, Partnerships and Marketing teams, you’ll foster and grow a regional Customer base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What to expect?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with our cross-functional sales team to help drive new and existing Customers to different Contentful capabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position, negotiate, and close expansion opportunities with existing customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet quarterly and annual sales goals by developing an account strategy and pipeline, overseeing internal and client processes, maintaining sales reports, developing market and competitor knowledge, delivering presentations to Customers, and creating sales proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with BDR to identify potential customers, qualify leads&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect and develop new business opportunities across a dedicated territory. Conduct research, identify key players, and qualify inbound leads to drive new business relationships. Then sustain value-add relationships with key decision makers by becoming a trusted advisor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee RFI/RFQ requests with Contentful internal and Customer teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refine and evolve our &quot;land-and-expand&quot; model in collaboration with Sales, Partnerships, Marketing, and Customer Experience teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seek to identify the digital experience problems of prospects and customers while aligning the ROI of Contentful with those difficulties to ensure a value based selling approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Solution Engineers to uncover technical problems and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop proposals, position complex pricing structures and negotiate contracts and deal-closing requirements efficiently.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Customer experience &amp;amp; marketing teams to ensure that best practices of Contentful are shared and implemented at the respective Customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you need to be successful&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience selling a technical platform&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of quota carrying experience in the UKI market&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of selling and positioning to customers a technical SaaS and/or PaaS platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of growing and expanding existing customer accounts in a SaaS and/or PaaS environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated knowledge of how to sell transactions of $150k+ to organizations with $1b+ in revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of API first, cloud native technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous CMS (content management system) experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More details about our company benefits can be found at the following link: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.salesforcebenefits.com&quot;&gt;https://www.salesforcebenefits.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To view more career opportunities, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.contentful.com/careers/&quot;&gt;https://www.contentful.com/careers/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contentful is now officially part of Salesforce.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Unleash Your Potential&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you join Salesforce, you’ll be limitless in all areas of your life. Our benefits and resources support you to find balance and be your best, and our AI agents accelerate your impact so you can do your best. Together, we’ll bring the power of Agentforce to organizations of all sizes and deliver amazing experiences that customers love. Apply today to not only shape the future — but to redefine what’s possible — for yourself, for AI, and the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you need reasonable accommodations at any point during the application or interview process, please let your Recruiter know.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salesforce is an equal opportunity employer and maintains a policy of non-discrimination with all employees and applicants for employment. What does that mean exactly? It means that at Salesforce, we believe in equality for all. And we believe we can lead the path to equality in part by creating a workplace that’s inclusive, and free from discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/know-your-rights-workplace-discrimination-illegal&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know your rights: workplace discrimination is illegal.&lt;/a&gt; Any employee or potential employee will be assessed on the basis of merit, competence and qualifications – without regard to race, religion, color, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, gender expression or identity, transgender status, age, disability, veteran or marital status, political viewpoint, or other classifications protected by law. This policy applies to current and prospective employees, no matter where they are in their Salesforce employment journey. It also applies to recruiting, hiring, job assignment, compensation, promotion, benefits, training, assessment of job performance, discipline, termination, and everything in between. Recruiting, hiring, and promotion decisions at Salesforce are fair and based on merit. The same goes for compensation, benefits, promotions, transfers, reduction in workforce, recall, training, and education.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #3e3e3e;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please be aware of scammers who may fraudulently claim to be from Contentful. These types of fraud can occur through copycat websites, fake email addresses claiming to be from our company, or social media. We do not ask for your personal information, such as bank account numbers, identification numbers, etc., through social media or chat-based apps, nor do we request or send money to purchase business equipment. If you suspect fraud, please report it to your local authorities and contact us at &lt;a ----- ----- &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #3e3e3e;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;with any information you may have.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;By clicking “Apply for this job,” I acknowledge that I have read the “&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.contentful.com/legal/us/privacy-notice-to-candidates/privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Contentful’s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;” and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Are you interested in working directly for a single sponsor while having the security and additional career opportunities that working for a global CRO can bring? Our team says it’s the best of both worlds….&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;ClinChoice is searching for a &lt;strong&gt;Associate Director, Biostatistics Consultant &amp;nbsp;– Oncology&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to join one of our clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Position Summary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Associate Director, Biostatistics&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in &lt;strong&gt;oncology drug development and clinical trial strategy&lt;/strong&gt;. The individual will provide strategic statistical leadership across development programs and work closely with Clinical Development, Regulatory, Medical, Commercial, and Portfolio teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have experience in:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Selecting Trial Types: decide if a trial should be superiority, non-inferiority, or equivalence-based depending on what regulators and payers need to prove the drug beats a placebo or standard of care.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Endpoint Selection: define and validate primary and secondary endpoints (e.g., overall survival, biomarker response rates, quality-of-life scores) to ensure they are measurable, clinically meaningful, and statistically robust.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Innovative Designs: statisticians frequently design &lt;strong&gt;adaptive trials&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., seamless Phase II/III designs, group sequential designs, or biomarker-driven basket/umbrella trials) to save time and patients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Sample Size &amp;amp; Power Calculations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Balancing Risk and Resources: &amp;nbsp;use power calculations to ensure a trial has a high probability of detecting a true clinical effect without enrolling excess patients, which drives up costs and exposes unnecessary individuals to experimental risks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Subgroup Powering: They determine if the study is large enough to analyze specific patient subsets (e.g., biomarker-positive patients or specific age groups).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Establishing &lt;strong&gt;Go/No-Go Decision Gates&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proof-of-Concept Criteria: establish quantitative thresholds for Phase II trials (e.g., &quot;If the hazard ratio is below 0.70 with a p-value , we proceed to Phase III&quot;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Futility Stopping Rules: Experience in build rules into trial protocols to stop a failing trial early, preventing sunk costs on a drug that is unlikely to succeed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Regulatory Strategy and Health Authority Negotiations : experience in preparing and reviewing data packages and attending meetings with regulatory bodies (like the FDA or EMA) to defend trial designs, proposed endpoints, and statistical analysis plans (SAPs).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Mitigating Regulatory Risk: Experience in anticipating and addressing statistical objections from health authorities regarding missing data handling, multiplicity adjustments (controlling for false positives when looking at multiple endpoints), and bias.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At the macro–Strategic Drug Development level, statisticians should have experience working with &lt;strong&gt;commercial and portfolio management teams&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Quantifying Uncertainty: Experience in using historical benchmark data and simulation models to estimate the Probability of Technical Success (PoS) for an asset at each development phase.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Pipeline Prioritization: Using risk models to help executive leadership in deciding whether to advance, partner, or kill an asset based on its statistical likelihood of clearing regulatory and market hurdles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Master&#39;s or Ph.D. in Statistics, Biostatistics, or a related quantitative discipline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Significant experience in pharmaceutical, biotechnology, or CRO environments with strong &lt;strong&gt;oncology experience&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience in &lt;strong&gt;strategic drug development and clinical trial design&lt;/strong&gt;, beyond traditional study-level responsibilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of oncology endpoints, adaptive designs, sample size/power, simulations, and statistical methodology.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience supporting &lt;strong&gt;regulatory submissions and health authority interactions&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and leadership skills with the ability to influence senior cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Application Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Once you have submitted your CV, you will receive an acknowledgement that we received it. If you have the requirements we need, you will be invited for phone interview as the first step.&amp;nbsp; Unfortunately, due to the number of applications we receive, we cannot reply to everyone individually if you are not successful.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who will you be working for?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About ClinChoice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;ClinChoice is a global full-service CRO specializing in clinical development and functional solutions for pharmaceutical, biotechnology, medical device, and consumer health companies. We have over 28 years of proven high-quality delivery and results across all our services, with over 4,000 professionals in more than 20 countries across the Americas, Europe, and Asia-Pacific.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Company Ethos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our mission drives our culture: to contribute to a healthier and safer world by accelerating the development and commercialization of innovative drugs and devices. Our employees are the most valuable company asset and they are the fulcrum around which all ClinChoice activities are built and close management and training is the core instrument to develop and maintain highly-qualified personnel. The continuous training keeps the resources qualified in terms of competence and expertise and gives all personnel the clear tools needed to manage both internal and client processes with the same methodology.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; The success of these core values is evidenced by our below industry average turnover rates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;ClinChoice is an equal opportunity employer. We have based our success on attracting, developing, and promoting talent guided by diversity and inclusivity. Our employees come from very diverse backgrounds: gender, race, beliefs, and ethnicities. We recognize this is our strength and celebrate it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot; style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;#LI-TT1 #LI-Remote #Associate Director #contract&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;With electric vehicles expected to be nearly 30% of new vehicle sales by 2025 and more than 50% by 2040, electric mobility is becoming a reality. ChargePoint (NYSE: CHPT) is at the center of this revolution, powering one of the world’s leading EV charging networks and a comprehensive set of hardware, software and mobile solutions for every charging need across North America and Europe. We bring together drivers, businesses, automakers, policymakers, utilities and other stakeholders to make e-mobility a global reality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Since our founding in 2007, ChargePoint has focused solely on making the transition to electric easy for businesses, fleets and drivers. ChargePoint offers a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to create an all-electric future and a trillion-dollar market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At ChargePoint, we foster a positive and productive work environment by committing to live our values of Be Courageous, Charge Together, Love our Customers, Operate with Openness, and Relentlessly Pursue Awesome. These values guide how we show up every day, align, and work together to build a brighter future for all of us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Join the team that is building the EV charging industry and make your mark on how people and goods will get everywhere they need to go, in any context, for generations to come.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Reports To&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Director, Solutions Engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&amp;nbsp;will be responsible for all technical aspects of pre-sale customer engagement including actively driving and managing technology evaluations, working as a key advisor and advocate for our products and solutions, engaging with customers virtually or in person, performing engineering site or architecture assessments, and developing recommendations to assist customers with deployment of electric vehicle charging solutions infrastructure. You will also be responsible for developing RFP/Tender responses and providing training on our products.&amp;nbsp;Key focus areas also encompasses electric vehicle supply equipment (EVSE), infrastructure, and the operational needs of light, medium and heavy duty fleets, including vehicle,&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;energy management and battery storage solutions that consider the charging capabilities, dwell time, routing and scheduling of the vehicles, and integrations with 3&lt;sup&gt;rd&lt;/sup&gt; party platforms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The applicant must be a critical thinker, self-motivated and able to effectively manage their time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travel requirement: up to 50% travel across Europe, predominantly within the UK and Ireland.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Will Bring to ChargePoint&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain deep technical and business knowledge of electric vehicle and fleet directions and trends, and how to effectively integrate electric vehicles and charging infrastructure into fleet operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver presentations to partners and customers in support of the sales process, educating potential customers on the benefits of ChargePoint solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a technical consultant, learning and understanding customer needs and developing the right solutions; working with product management to help align product development with customer and market needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain deep technical and business knowledge of market and industry trends, and how to effectively integrate electric vehicles and charging infrastructure into client business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for identifying technical issues that may affect customer satisfaction and proactively work to resolve such issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide both general “best practice” and customer-specific engineering recommendations for ChargePoint software feature usage, API implementations and integrations with external systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain knowledge of local electrical installation codes and relevant standards, specifically related to Electric Vehicle Supply Equipment (EVSE) and energy management solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to functional and technical elements of RFPs/Tenders; assist in the development and execution of SoWs (statements of work) and other proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for identifying technical issues that may affect customer satisfaction and proactively work to solve such issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor or Masters degree in Engineering, Mathematics, Computer Science, or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 8 years of combined experience in technical sales or technical consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience should include some: electrical engineering, telecommunications, information technology, software development, technical writing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent presentation, oral and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong customer facing and relationship building skill&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and oral language skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fleet vehicle operations, High Power solutions, Battery Energy Storage&amp;nbsp;or large facility experience desired.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;UK- Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are committed to an inclusive and diverse team. ChargePoint is an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based on race, color, ethnicity, ancestry, national origin, religion, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, sexual orientation, age, disability, veteran status, genetic information, marital status or any legally protected status.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there is a match between your experiences/skills and the Company needs, we will contact you directly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ChargePoint is committed to fostering an inclusive workplace that welcomes and supports all qualified individuals. In alignment with this commitment, we ensure that persons with disabilities are provided with reasonable accommodations throughout the employment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need a reasonable accommodation to participate in the application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, or to access any other benefits and privileges of employment, please contact us at -----
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ChargePoint is an equal opportunity employer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Applicants only - Recruiting agencies do not contact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

