&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;0334254fe942&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Lead highly talented product management teams solving complex technical challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
