&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;066064d66e9e&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Influence company strategy and the future direction of Datadog&#39;s security platform.&lt;/p&gt;
