&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;81abccda4b53&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Grow your leadership through meaningful ownership, mentorship, and cross-functional collaboration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
