&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;How to apply&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please upload a CV and covering letter by clicking &#39;Apply&#39;. Your covering letter should explain why you are applying for the job and what skills and experience you can bring to the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We review CVs as we receive them and interview as soon as we have applications that&amp;nbsp;look&amp;nbsp;like a good match. We do not use closing dates. So, please&amp;nbsp;apply as soon as possible to avoid&amp;nbsp;missing out on&amp;nbsp;this role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you need any adjustments made to the application or selection process so you can do your best, please let us know. We will be happy to help. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you have any queries, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a ----- data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span ----- data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;GDPR notice: Riverlane collects and processes personal data in accordance with applicable data protection laws. If you are a European Job Applicant see the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA843b0309-1485-8922-978c-b4a29d28b8a6&quot; class=&quot;x_x_fui-Link x_x____1q1shib x_x_f2hkw1w x_x_f3rmtva x_x_f1ewtqcl x_x_fyind8e x_x_f1k6fduh x_x_f1w7gpdv x_x_fk6fouc x_x_fjoy568 x_x_figsok6 x_x_f1s184ao x_x_f1mk8lai x_x_fnbmjn9 x_x_f1o700av x_x_f13mvf36 x_x_f1cmlufx x_x_f9n3di6 x_x_f1ids18y x_x_f1tx3yz7 x_x_f1deo86v x_x_f1eh06m1 x_x_f1iescvh x_x_fhgqx19 x_x_f1olyrje x_x_f1p93eir x_x_f1nev41a x_x_f1h8hb77 x_x_f1lqvz6u x_x_f10aw75t x_x_fsle3fq x_x_f17ae5zn x_x_OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://riverlane.workable.com/gdpr_policy/v1?lang=en&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;1&quot;&gt;privacy notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for further details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Cambridge, UK | Full-time | Permanent | Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Salary: £40,000.00&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Riverlane’s&amp;nbsp;mission is to master quantum error correction (QEC) and unlock a new age of human progress. From advances in material and climate science, to complex chemistry simulation for new drug design, quantum computers will help humanity solve some of its most important challenges. But without QEC, the industry’s defining technical challenge, such breakthroughs can never be achieved.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Riverlane is the world leader in QEC technology. QEC is a complex problem that requires a range of skills,&amp;nbsp;talent&amp;nbsp;and passion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;Having raised more than $125M in funding to date to accelerate our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;cutting-edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;R&amp;amp;D in quantum error correction (QEC), Riverlane partners with many of the world’s leading quantum hardware providers and government agencies to make fault-tolerant quantum computing a reality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;We’re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;making remarkable progress and growing fast. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Riverlane’s Engineering Graduate Scheme is designed for graduates in Computer Science, Electronic Engineering, Engineering, Physics, Maths and related subjects who want to build a career in quantum computing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will join us as a permanent, full-time employee at our head office in Cambridge, UK. During your first 12 months, you will rotate through Engineering teams, gaining hands-on experience of different technical challenges and approaches to developing QEC technology. Your work throughout the scheme will focus on engineering, in close collaboration with research teams and learn how research is translated into working technology.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will have a dedicated supervisor to support you through your rotations and help you develop your technical and professional skills. You will take on meaningful work from the outset, while learning from experienced colleagues across our multidisciplinary team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You do not need a background in quantum computing. You will have the opportunity to learn about QEC as part of the scheme.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At the end of the programme year, you will move into an Engineering team or Engineering Research role to continue developing your career at Riverlane.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you will do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Design, develop and improve software or hardware tools used in quantum computing and QEC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Contribute to engineering projects from initial design through implementation, testing and improvement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Learn how to build and test complex products at the cutting edge of technology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work with engineers and scientists from different disciplines to solve technical problems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Develop your engineering skills through hands-on work, feedback and support from your team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What we need&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;3 3 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A completed or in-progress Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Computer Systems Engineering, Electronic Engineering, Engineering, Physics, Mathematics or a related subject.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Graduation in 2026 or expected graduation in 2027.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Evidence of strong technical skills and creative problem-solving through academic work, research, personal projects or other relevant experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with at least one programming language, preferably C++ or Python.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong critical thinking and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clear written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ability to take initiative and work effectively as part of a team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An interest in applying your skills in an industrial setting and a strong desire to learn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Important notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Engineering Graduate Scheme is the beginning of a permanent, full-time career at Riverlane. The 2027 intake will start in autumn 2027. The rotational element lasts for 12 months, after which graduates will move into an Engineering team or Engineering Research role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Deadline &amp;amp; Selection Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please submit your application by &lt;strong&gt;Friday 6 November 2026&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 1: Remote technical challenges&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;These will be arranged individually, with seven days to complete them. All challenges must be completed by &lt;strong&gt;Monday 7 December 2026&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 2: Assessment day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;An assessment day will be held at our headquarters in Cambridge, UK, on &lt;strong&gt;Thursday 14 January 2027&lt;/strong&gt;. Please keep this date available.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;How to apply &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please upload a CV and covering letter. Your covering letter should explain why you are applying for Riverlane’s Graduate Recruitment Scheme and what skills and experience you feel you can bring to the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What can you expect from us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Alongside a competitive salary, we offer private medical insurance, a health cash plan and life assurance, as well as many other benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You can also expect a diverse work environment that brings together experts in many fields (including software and hardware development, quantum information theory, physics and maths) and over 25 different nationalities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you have any queries, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a ----- data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span ----- data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt; Please do not send your applications to this email address, all applications should be submitted via our careers page.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Everyone is welcome at Riverlane. We are an equal opportunities employer and encourage applications from eligible and suitably qualified candidates regardless of age, disability, ethnicity, gender, gender reassignment, religion or belief, sexual orientation, marital or civil partnership status, or pregnancy and maternity/paternity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Women and other underrepresented groups may be less likely to apply for a role unless they meet all or&amp;nbsp;nearly all&amp;nbsp;of the requirements.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;If this applies to you, we still encourage you to apply - you may be a great fit, even if you&amp;nbsp;don’t&amp;nbsp;meet every single qualification.&amp;nbsp;We’d&amp;nbsp;love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you need any adjustments made to the application or selection process so you can do your best, please let us know. We will be happy to help.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;GDPR notice: Riverlane collects and processes personal data in accordance with applicable data protection laws. If you are a European Job Applicant see the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA843b0309-1485-8922-978c-b4a29d28b8a6&quot; class=&quot;x_x_fui-Link x_x____1q1shib x_x_f2hkw1w x_x_f3rmtva x_x_f1ewtqcl x_x_fyind8e x_x_f1k6fduh x_x_f1w7gpdv x_x_fk6fouc x_x_fjoy568 x_x_figsok6 x_x_f1s184ao x_x_f1mk8lai x_x_fnbmjn9 x_x_f1o700av x_x_f13mvf36 x_x_f1cmlufx x_x_f9n3di6 x_x_f1ids18y x_x_f1tx3yz7 x_x_f1deo86v x_x_f1eh06m1 x_x_f1iescvh x_x_fhgqx19 x_x_f1olyrje x_x_f1p93eir x_x_f1nev41a x_x_f1h8hb77 x_x_f1lqvz6u x_x_f10aw75t x_x_fsle3fq x_x_f17ae5zn x_x_OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://riverlane.workable.com/gdpr_policy/v1?lang=en&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;1&quot;&gt;privacy notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for further details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hi, we’re Phiture — the mobile growth consultancy working with the teams behind leading apps like Adobe, Headspace, and LEGO® 👋. We’re setting the standard for growth in the brave new digital world, and we need great people to join our global team!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT TO EXPECT:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Phiture as a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Growth Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;, owning the day-to-day relationship, communication, and delivery for one of our largest and most demanding accounts. You&#39;ll act as one of the main points of contact for client communications, owning conversations and decisions directly with the client, orchestrating across PM, ASO, and Creative, while advising the Growth Lead on strategy and execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, individual account-ownership role that requires both strong technical craftsmanship and genuine comfort leading client conversations. &lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll bring deep expertise in paid user acquisition for mobile apps, including GAC, Apple Ads, MMPs&lt;/strong&gt;, and attribution, and pair it with the confidence to represent the account&#39;s strategy directly to senior, demanding stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Paid UA Campaign Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Own the end-to-end strategy, setup, and continuous optimization of paid campaigns (Google App Campaigns, Apple Ads, Meta Ads and other UA channels as relevant) to scale user acquisition efficiently, proactively monitoring spend efficiency and creative performance, and independently investigating technical issues (tracking discrepancies, delivery problems, attribution mismatches) before escalating.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Client Relationship&lt;/strong&gt;: Own the client relationship end-to-end with day-to-day communication, deliverables (reports, proposals, strategic planning docs), and hands-on execution of the agreed strategy. Lead client meetings, educate clients beyond reporting, and communicate the real, accurate cause of any issue, including when it traces back to our own setup or execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead, Not Just Attend, Client Conversations&lt;/strong&gt;: Confidently drive client meetings, questioning client requests that don&#39;t hold up, proactively bringing recommendations rather than waiting to be asked, and representing the account&#39;s strategic direction directly to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect PM to ASO and Creative&lt;/strong&gt;: Actively bring the organic and creative perspective into paid conversations (and vice versa) rather than staying within a single channel, by flagging cross-functional implications to the wider team without needing to be prompted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply App-Specific Paid Media Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;: Bring deep expertise in paid user acquisition specifically for mobile apps, SDKs and their implementation, SKAN&#39;s measurement restrictions and their implications for testing and attribution, and what an MMP does and why app marketers rely on one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyze Performance &amp;amp; Drive Recommendations&lt;/strong&gt;: Dive deep into monthly metrics, set targets, analyze trends, and independently identify areas of concern or opportunity, arriving with a point of view and a recommendation grounded in the numbers, translated into what it means for the client&#39;s business. Comfort reading dashboards in a tool like Looker Studio is expected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guide Client POCs &amp;amp; Junior Team Members&lt;/strong&gt;: Guide Client POCs and junior team members as they build expertise, while retaining individual ownership of your own accounts. Given a problem, investigate it, propose a course of action, follow through, and close the loop with stakeholders without needing reminders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL NEED:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of hands-on experience in paid user acquisition / performance marketing&lt;/strong&gt;, for mobile apps, with a track record of demonstrable results (efficiency gains, scaled spend, measurable campaign impact) you can speak to concretely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid app-specific paid UA fluency&lt;/strong&gt;: including GAC, Meta Ads, Apple Ads, SDKs, SKAN, and MMP concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on attribution/MMP experience&lt;/strong&gt;: comfortable troubleshooting tracking and attribution issues directly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Genuine confidence leading client meetings&lt;/strong&gt;: with a track record of proactively driving conversations and pushing back on client asks when warranted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Independent data interpretation skills&lt;/strong&gt;: able to arrive at a point of view and recommendation grounded in the numbers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent in English, with excellent written and spoken client communication skills&lt;/strong&gt; and being able to simplify technical concepts for less growth-literate stakeholders without losing substance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A demonstrated track record of proactive ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: able to walk through a real past troubleshooting or client-management example.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;NICE TO HAVE:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with kids/family-audience apps or highly regulated/brand-sensitive clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with programmatic/DSP media buying is a big plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working alongside a dedicated data/attribution specialist: comfortable collaborating closely with a technical counterpart.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Remote Work&lt;/strong&gt; — Unlimited remote work within your home country (EMEA), plus up to 90 days per year internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous Vacation Allowance&lt;/strong&gt; — Enjoy up to 30 days of paid vacation annually, plus extra days for special occasions (country-specific), so you can recharge and pursue your passions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quarterly Bonus Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt; — Boost your earnings through our quarterly bonus scheme, directly linked to our shared success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental Wellness Prioritized&lt;/strong&gt; — Free, confidential mental health support from licensed therapists through our partnership with Oliva.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Development Investment&lt;/strong&gt; — €1,000 annual personal growth budget and 10 dedicated learning hours each month, empowering your continuous growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working Hours&lt;/strong&gt; — Shape your workday around your lifestyle and productivity, choosing working patterns that best suit you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vibrant Berlin Office&lt;/strong&gt; — Enjoy a flexible, pet-friendly workspace at our spacious headquarters located in one of Berlin’s most vibrant neighborhoods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Team Connection&lt;/strong&gt; — Regular team-building events and a memorable annual all-expenses-paid company offsite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tailored Career Growth&lt;/strong&gt; — A personalized career roadmap and development plan designed to keep you advancing professionally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Home Office Allowance&lt;/strong&gt; — Monthly remote-work cash allowance to level up your home workspace or help cover internet costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Premium Onboarding Kit&lt;/strong&gt; — Branded Phiture gear and your very own MacBook from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thoughtful Celebrations&lt;/strong&gt; — Responsibly sourced birthday, anniversary, and seasonal gifts, because every milestone deserves recognition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We encourage all qualified individuals to apply, regardless of their age, gender identity, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability status, or religion. We celebrate diversity and are excited about building teams that represent a variety of backgrounds, perspectives, and skills. All employment decisions are based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Avec une stratégie de croissance, le groupe Capco renforce le développement de son pôle FRC (Finance, Risques &amp;amp; Conformité) et tout particulièrement son offre Risque, et recherche pour son bureau parisien des Senior consultant(e)s pour accompagner ses clients sur leurs enjeux de transformation réglementaire et organisationnelle liés au risque de marché et de contrepartie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votre rôle&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Chez nos clients&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer à l’identification et la gestion des risques liés aux activités de nos clients à travers la mise en place et la revue des dispositifs risques stratégiques (e.g. risk identification, risk appetite, ICAAP &amp;amp; Stress Testing, mitigation, monitoring &amp;amp; reporting),&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer à la définition et la déclinaison opérationnelle des politiques métiers et risques, ainsi qu’à l’optimisation et l’industrialisation des processus et outils associés,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accompagner nos clients dans leurs projets de mise en conformité réglementaire : analyse des textes réglementaires, gap analysis méthodologique/système/data/gouvernance/processus, préconisations et mise en œuvre, documentation et accompagnement du changement,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intervenir en soutien des missions d’inspection interne et externe et des exercices de supervision (QIS, Benchmarking, Stress Testing, TRIM, mission d’homologation) : cadrage, coordination, documentation, traitement des recommandations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le profil recherché&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Titulaire d’une formation de type Bac+5 d’une école de commerce ou d’ingénieur, ou universitaire,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez de solides connaissances méthodologiques et de l’environnement réglementaire (Bâle III/IV, FBL/Volcker, EMIR) ainsi que sur le pricing des opérations de marché et la modélisation des risques afférents,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une expérience des sujets data/digitaux appliqués à la fonction Risque (RPA, Machine learning, Big data), et des compétences solides en programmation et base de données sont des atouts forts,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un excellent relationnel et un bon esprit d’équipe, on vous reconnait pour votre flexibilité, votre curiosité, votre créativité et votre envie d’accompagner activement la croissance d’un cabinet dynamique qui mise sur le management de proximité,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La maitrise du français et de l’anglais comme langues de travail est indispensable et vous savez évoluer avec aisance dans un contexte international,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous justifiez de 3 à 7 ans d’expérience dans le domaine du risque de marché et de contrepartie dont une période significative en cabinet de conseil en organisation, ou en gestion de projets avec une forte composante fonctionnelle au sein d’une institution financière.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi choisir Capco&amp;nbsp;?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Créé en 1998, Capco est un cabinet de conseil en management et en organisation spécialisé dans le secteur des services financiers, avec 35 bureaux répartis entre l’Amérique, l’Asie et l’Europe et regroupant 7 000 collaborateurs dont 160 à Paris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre offre conseil s’appuie sur trois grands domaines d’expertise&amp;nbsp;: Business Consulting, Digital et Techonology&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Capco, nous vous offrons&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un environnement de travail international centré sur l’innovation et la création de valeur pour nos clients bancaires et assuranciels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un parcours de formation continu adapté à vos besoins, pour acquérir de nouvelles compétences et développer une réelle expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une organisation de travail hybride (charte télétravail de 2 jours par semaine)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une rémunération compétitive avec un bonus lié à la performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un PEE avec un abondement de 2903€ par an&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une culture d’entreprise entrepreneuriale, inclusive et méritocratique, de nouveau certifiée Great Place To Work&lt;strong&gt;®&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des initiatives pour construire le Capco de demain :
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;#BeYourselfAtWork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Woman@capco&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSE (forfait mobilité durable, jour de solidarité, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des communautés métiers, sportives et culturelles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;En tant que Consultant ou Consultant Senior au sein de notre activité Stratégie &amp;amp; Business Consulting, vous accompagnerez des acteurs majeurs de la banque et de l’assurance dans la réussite de leurs transformations stratégiques, organisationnelles, opérationnelles et digitales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous interviendrez sur des projets et programmes d’envergure, parfois internationaux, depuis la définition de la stratégie de déploiement jusqu’à son déploiement opérationnel. Vous travaillerez au contact de directions métiers, de directions de la transformation et de fonctions IT afin de mobiliser les parties prenantes &amp;amp; garantir la mise en œuvre de la stratégie de déploiement tout en anticipant et coordonnant les problèmes potentiels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos Missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter la stratégie de déploiement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Garantir l’application de la méthode de déploiement du client et la formalisation des décisions de Go/No Go&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer la coordination des parties prenantes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir et déployer des stratégies de conduite du changement adaptées aux enjeux, à la culture et à l’organisation de nos clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir et mettre en œuvre les dispositifs de communication, de formation, d’engagement et d’accompagnement managérial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accompagner le déploiement de nouveaux modèles opérationnels, processus, outils digitaux et modes de travail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir et suivre les indicateurs d’adoption, identifier les résistances et mettre en place les actions correctives nécessaires&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer au pilotage et à la gouvernance de projets ou programmes de transformation complexes, notamment dans des environnements internationaux&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pour les profils seniors, coordonner les travaux d’équipes de consultants, sécuriser la qualité des livrables et accompagner les profils plus juniors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer au développement de notre expertise Change Management à travers des propositions commerciales, publications, formations et initiatives internes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votre Profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expérience significative en pilotage de projet &amp;amp; conduite du changement, acquise en cabinet de conseil et/ou au sein d’une direction de la transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise des principaux leviers du Change Management : diagnostic, analyse d’impacts, mobilisation des parties prenantes, communication, formation et mesure de l’adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expérience de projets ou programmes de transformation d’envergure, dans des environnements complexes et impliquant de multiples parties prenantes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonne connaissance des métiers, des organisations et des enjeux de transformation de la banque&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacité à structurer une démarche, produire des livrables de qualité et transformer des problématiques complexes en recommandations concrètes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellentes qualités relationnelles, rédactionnelles et de présentation, avec la capacité d’interagir aussi bien avec des équipes opérationnelles qu’avec des dirigeants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomie, rigueur, sens du collectif et forte orientation client&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise professionnelle du français et de l’anglais, à l’oral comme à l’écrit, et aisance dans des contextes multiculturels et internationaux&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Atouts Supplémentaires&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certification en conduite du changement type Prosci, appréciée, mais non indispensable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La Connaissance du secteur des paiements est un plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expérience de transformations digitales, de déploiements technologiques à grande échelle ou d’évolution de modèles opérationnels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarité avec les approches Agile, Design Thinking, Lean ou les outils de mesure de l’engagement et de l’adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Qui sommes-nous&amp;nbsp;?&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco est un cabinet de conseil international, spécialisé dans les services financiers.&lt;br&gt;Fondé en 1998, le cabinet compte aujourd’hui plus de 7 000 collaborateurs dans 36 bureaux à travers le monde, dont 160 à Paris.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Challenger reconnu face aux grands noms du conseil, Capco se distingue par sa double expertise métier et technologique, au service de la stratégie comme de l’exécution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre promesse : accompagner la transformation de nos clients dans un monde en constante mutation – réglementaire, technologique et opérationnel.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous intervenons à l’intersection du business, de la réglementation et de la tech, en mobilisant des équipes pluridisciplinaires, expérimentées et engagées.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nos marqueurs distinctifs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Une spécialisation sectorielle forte&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nous apportons à nos clients une compréhension approfondie de leurs enjeux métiers, en particulier dans la banque, les marchés de capitaux et l’énergie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Une approche collaborative et sur mesure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nous intégrons les équipes clients, adaptons nos méthodes à leur culture et co-construisons des solutions concrètes et opérationnelles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;L’excellence comme exigence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notre ambition est d’obtenir des résultats mesurables et durables pour nos clients – et de toujours viser la valeur ajoutée.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Un esprit “One Capco”&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nos équipes collaborent à l’échelle internationale pour mobiliser les meilleures expertises et partager les bonnes pratiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Une culture entrepreneuriale et inclusive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;L’innovation, l’initiative et le mérite sont au cœur de notre modèle. Nous valorisons les idées, la diversité et le progrès collectif.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nos expertises s’articulent autour de 6 métiers complémentaires&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stratégie &amp;amp; Transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finance, Risque &amp;amp; Conformité&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product, Innovation &amp;amp; Design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conseil Tech (Advisory)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering (Delivery)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chez Capco, nous vous offrons&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un environnement de travail international centré sur l’innovation et la création de valeur pour nos clients bancaires et assuranciels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un parcours de formation continu adapté à vos besoins, pour acquérir de nouvelles compétences et développer une réelle expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une organisation de travail hybride (charte télétravail de 2 jours par semaine)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une rémunération compétitive avec un bonus lié à la performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un PEE avec un abondement de 2903€ par an&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une culture d’entreprise entrepreneuriale, inclusive et méritocratique, de nouveau certifiée Great Place To Work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des initiatives pour construire le Capco de demain&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;#BeYourselfAtWork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Woman@capco&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSE (forfait mobilité durable, jour de solidarité, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des communautés métiers, sportives et culturelles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Capco Paris, handicap visible ou invisible, parcours atypique ou classique, toutes les candidatures sont les bienvenues et seront traitées avec équité.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is a new company operating at the intersection of collectibles, culture, and technology. Backed by world-class investors, operators, and sports &amp;amp; entertainment partners, we are building the global leader in next-generation collectibles. As part of the broader Fanatics ecosystem, we leverage a digital sports platform that spans over 900 sports properties and engages more than 81 million fans. Together, we are reimagining every part of the collectibles experience for fans, partners, and creators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is seeking a dynamic and experienced Marketing Manager to join our team in Paris. This role is crucial in driving the growth of Topps’ Sport and Entertainment collectibles in the French and Benelux markets. The successful candidate will be responsible for developing and executing &amp;nbsp;locally relevant marketing strategies, building strong partnerships and delivering integrated campaigns tailored to different consumer audiences and channels to grow the collector community, strengthen Topps&#39; premium positioning and accelerate category growth across France and Benelux.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing Strategy and Planning:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement effective marketing plans and brand strategies for sport &amp;amp; entertainment collections tailored to the French and Benelux markets, ensuring alignment with global direction while adapting to local consumer behaviour and culture, retail landscape and growth opportunities. Rebuild and strengthen Topps’ local marketing presence in France and Benelux, identifying market opportunities, key partners and cultural entry points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage fully integrated campaigns across PR, influencer marketing, digital and social, co-marketing activities, sampling initiatives and media partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive category growth by engaging fans, expanding the collector community, recruiting new collectors through impactful marketing initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the planning and strategic direction of local events, including Topps-owned events, defining event objectives, talent involvement and communication strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the main point of contact for all suppliers, agencies and partners, owning and developing the relationships to maximise brand visibility and marketing impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget management for all marketing activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse performance of campaigns/activations to inform future marketing and communication strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree in Marketing, Business Administration, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-10 years of marketing experience, ideally in sport, entertainment, collectibles, consumer products or culturally relevant brands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in the French and Benelux markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of delivering successful marketing campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong passion for and comprehensive knowledge of football and sports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-confident, energetic, proactive, organized, highly detailed, and goal-oriented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong influencing, communication, and interpersonal skills with a ‘can-do’ mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work collaboratively and autonomously in a fast-paced team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to multitask, juggle multiple projects, and effectively determine priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with an international, decentralized team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, pragmatic, and results-oriented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to think creatively and strategically while also being able to execute flawlessly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in French and English; Dutch proficiency is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working for an international company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal affinity with or direct experience in collectible sports and/or entertainment products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base Salary Range:&lt;/strong&gt; €74,580–€108,130 gross annually. Final offer will depend on skills, experience, internal equity, and location (where applicable).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;The above list of job duties is not exclusive or exhaustive and the post holder will be required to undertake such tasks as may reasonably be expected within the scope and grading of the post.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Subject to applicable laws, Fanatics Collectibles may choose to run a background check.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants. Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including ----- For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a -----
&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;Wrike is the most powerful work management platform. Built for teams and organizations looking to collaborate, create, and exceed every day, Wrike brings everyone and all work into a single place to remove complexity, increase productivity, and free people up to focus on their most purposeful work.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Wrike is our people, not a place. As a distributed team, we own our growth, stay globally connected, and rely on the product we build to deliver impactful work alongside brilliant minds. You&#39;ll have real ownership over meaningful work, a global team that has your back, and the flexibility to do your best work your way. If that sounds like you, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our vision:&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;A world where everyone is free to focus on their most purposeful work, together.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll help build the very AI-powered platform you use every day, with real autonomy over the features you ship. Wrike is opening a new talent track for builders- senior engineers who take a feature from a rough idea to a production system on their own, and who use AI as a genuine multiplier rather than a buzzword. This isn’t a backfill for an existing seat. It’s a newly created role for someone who already operates autonomously and wants to keep doing that inside a company with real scale, real users, and daily production deployments. You take a high-level idea, figure out what actually needs to be built by talking to the right people, and ship it end-to-end: backend logic, frontend touches where needed, automated and manual testing, infra, and the dozen adjacent things a real feature needs. You read the existing codebase with judgment- reusing what’s solid, rebuilding what isn’t, and refusing to leave tech debt for the next person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is not optional here. You’re expected to work AI-native: using it daily to move faster, and knowing when to push back when it suggests something that doesn’t hold up. If you’ve written your own automation, scripts, or internal tooling to remove friction from your own workflow, that’s exactly the instinct we’re hiring for.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ambiguous, high-level product ideas and turn them into a concrete technical plan- by asking the right people the right questions, not waiting for a fully written spec&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designed, built, and shipped end-to-end features across the full stack- including a Java/Spring backend, REST APIs, data layer, testing, infrastructure touches, and rollout- while utilizing modern frontend technologies like TypeScript, React 19,&amp;nbsp;Microfrontends, and Module Federation, alongside legacy Dart components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate a real, living codebase- deciding what to reuse, what to rebuild, and holding the line against unnecessary tech debt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think in systems: anticipate second-order effects before they become incidents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make technical and product tradeoff calls yourself, manage the risk, and push things over the finish line&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools (Cursor, Claude/Codex, our internal AI portal and MCP) as a daily part of how you build- including writing your own automations and skills where they save real time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge AI output and product asks alike when they don’t hold up- critical thinking is part of the job, not a side skill&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Qualifications:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong full-stack engineering experience, with deep comfort in Java (21), Spring, REST APIs, and SQL, TypeScript, React 19&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of owning features or systems end-to-end, not just executing a fully-specified ticket&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating and improving an existing, non-trivial codebase- this isn’t a greenfield role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced, hands-on use of AI coding tools as part of your daily workflow- you’re past the learning curve already&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort making decisions under ambiguity and owning the outcome, good or bad&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backgrounds we tend to see succeed here: technical founders, early engineers at startups who built the first version, small-company CTOs/Heads of Engineering, or senior engineers with active, recent open-source or side-project work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Stack:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Java (21), Spring, REST APIs, SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TypeScript, React 19, Redux, Dart&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PostgreSQL, Redis, RabbitMQ&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unit/integration testing, Java web stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI tooling: Cursor, Claude/Codex, Zencoder, internal AI portal, internal MCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 weeks of paid vacation + 5 RTT Recovery Days + Seniority Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental Leave: 16 Weeks Maternity / 4 Weeks Paternity + Reserved Daycare Spot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Insurance - Competitive Coverage - for employees + dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid Work – Flexible hybrid working model with a monthly home office allowance of €20 (hybrid) or €50 (fully remote).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Public transportation: Coverage of 75% of subscription fee / Sustainable mobility package 200€/year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CSE Specific Benefits i.e. vacation vouchers, negotiated fees etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested in joining Wrike when the right opportunity opens up? Apply to our Senior Builder today. We’ll reach out as soon as a suitable role becomes available, or simply to arrange a Meet &amp;amp; Greet call.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your recruitment buddy will be &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/aleksandar-chernev-479785214/&quot;&gt;Alexander Chernev&lt;/a&gt;, Senior Recruiter.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-AC1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who Is Wrike and Our Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We’re a team of innovators and creators who solve the complex work problems of today and tomorrow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work mode&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Wrike is our people, not a place. With 1,000+ employees collaborating across nearly every time zone, we support talent through 10 global hubs — Australia, Costa Rica, Cyprus, Czechia, Estonia, France, India, Ireland, Japan, and the United States — offering flexible ways of working that include remote work, hybrid environments, and co-working spaces across many locations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;While flexibility looks different across teams and regions, employees located near certain hubs — particularly in Prague (CZ), Nicosia (CY), Bangalore (IN), and Rennes (FR) — are generally expected to collaborate in person around 2–3 days per week, balancing the flexibility of distributed work with opportunities for in-person collaboration and connection.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our persona&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💡&amp;nbsp; Smart:&lt;/strong&gt; We love what we do, and we’re great at it because this is our domain. Our combined knowledge in this space is unmatched.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💚&amp;nbsp; Dedicated: &lt;/strong&gt;We get up every day focused on helping our customers win. We’re committed to helping our teammates win, too!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤗&amp;nbsp; Approachable:&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re friendly, easy to get along with, considerate, and helpful.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our culture and Values&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 Customer-Focused&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We care about our customers. &lt;/strong&gt;We understand the customer journey, experience, and value derived from Wrike. Decision-making and action-taking are done with the customer in mind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤝 Collaborative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We work as one and win together, &lt;/strong&gt;each bringing unique strengths that contribute to diversity of thought for better outcomes. Leveraging our own work management platform, we foster an environment of creative collaboration and shared achievement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎨 Creative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We strive to succeed through continuous innovation. &lt;/strong&gt;It’s our pursuit of novel concepts that helped us create a market category. We continue to cultivate a workplace that fosters creative thinking as a means of transcending conventional boundaries and empowers us to break new ground to deliver extraordinary work management solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💪 Committed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe in ownership at all levels of the organization, &lt;/strong&gt;by owning workflows from start to finish. Each member of our team is an integral part of this commitment, establishing work as a platform for personal growth and transformation, as well as collective success and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/wrike/life/3fd588bf-73e8-47be-9b0a-1933d404ea88/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn Life Page&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wrike.com/wrike-company-culture/&quot;&gt;Company culture page&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/wriketeam&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wrike.com/wrike-engineering/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Wrike Engineering Team&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://medium.com/wriketechclub&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Medium&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.meetup.com/WrikeTechClub/?_cookie-check=wtgfN9ARYGPSGd3e&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Meetup.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/wriketechclub&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Youtube&lt;/a&gt; for a feel for what life is like at Wrike.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.com/Overview/Working-at-Wrike-EI_IE420969.11,16.htm&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.com/pc-app/static/img/partnerCenter/badges/eng_CHECK_US_273x90.png&quot; alt=&quot;Check us out on Glassdoor.&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Willst Du, dass Deine Arbeit eine echte Bedeutung &amp;amp; spürbare Auswirkung für uns als Gesellschaft hat? Hast Du Lust mit einem großartigen Team eine sichere, digitale Zukunft aufzubauen?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(222, 220, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;„In der Portfolio Unit Security &amp;amp; IT Solutions sorgen wir für die Sicherheit und Stabilität der IT-Systeme unserer Kunden. Gemeinsam übernehmen wir hier Verantwortung, liefern Produkte und professionellen Service, entwickeln und betreiben Lösungen und sorgen mit Freude dafür, dass die Welt ein Stück sicherer wird.&quot; - Christoph Wolf, Director PU Security &amp;amp; IT Solutions&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du fühlst Dich angesprochen und möchtest gemeinsam mit uns die Welt sicherer machen? Unser Team wächst stetig und wir suchen Dich als &lt;strong&gt;Senior Engineer (m/w/d)&lt;/strong&gt; für Proxmox-Plattform an unserem Standort in &lt;strong&gt;Köln &lt;/strong&gt;oder &lt;strong&gt;Wiesbaden &lt;/strong&gt;mit der Option zum mobilen Arbeiten. Gemeinsam sorgen wir für den erfolgreichen Betrieb und die Weiterentwicklung moderner Virtualisierungsplattformen bei unseren Kunden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WAS DU BEI UNS MACHST&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aufbau, Weiterentwicklung und Betrieb unserer zukünftigen Virtualisierungsplattform auf Basis von Proxmox VE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planung und Durchführung von Migrationsprojekten im Rahmen der strategischen Ablösung bestehender VMware-Umgebungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integration und Weiterentwicklung von Storage-, Netzwerk- und SDN-Komponenten zur Sicherstellung einer leistungsfähigen und hochverfügbaren Infrastruktur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erstellung von Betriebs-, Architektur- und Migrationskonzepten sowie Unterstützung bei Technologie- und Architekturentscheidungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automatisierung und Optimierung von Betriebsprozessen sowie Sicherstellung eines stabilen Betriebs der Plattform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WIE DU UNS BEGEISTERST&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfolgreich abgeschlossene Ausbildung im IT-Umfeld, ein Studium der Informatik oder eine vergleichbare Qualifikation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mehrjährige Erfahrung im Betrieb und der Weiterentwicklung von Virtualisierungsplattformen sowie praktische Erfahrung mit Proxmox VE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sehr gute Linux-Kenntnisse sowie fundiertes Know-how in den Bereichen Enterprise Storage, Netzwerkarchitekturen und SDN-Technologien&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung in Infrastrukturtransformations- und Migrationsprojekten sowie ein ausgeprägtes Architekturverständnis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hohe Eigenverantwortung sowie &lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Bereitschaft für Rufbereitschaften bzw. geplante 24/7 Wartungsarbeiten&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Gute Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FEEL GOOD KULTUR @SITSGROUP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wertschätzung:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Eine offen-herzliche, respektvolle und wertschätzende Kommunikationskultur steht bei uns an erster Stelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;Teamspirit:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Es erwarten Dich spannende und vielseitige Aufgaben gepaart mit einem tollen und unterstützenden Team um Dich herum. Wir fördern nicht nur eine gesunde, sondern auch kollegiale Teamstruktur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onboarding &amp;amp; Einarbeitung: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Wir legen großen Wert auf ein strukturiertes Onboarding und eine intensive Einarbeitung. Wir möchten, dass Du bei uns gut ankommst!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life-Blending:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Wir bieten Dir die Option auf mobiles Arbeiten und flexible Arbeitszeitmodelle mit Fokus auf eine gesunde Work-Life-Balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perspektiven:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Du erhältst vielfältige Freiräume für kreatives Arbeiten, persönliche Entwicklungsoptionen und interessante Weiterbildungsmöglichkeiten – auch im Team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Corporate Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Auf Dich warten interessante und zahlreiche Mitarbeiterkonditionen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hire a Friend&lt;/strong&gt;!: &lt;/span&gt;Empfehle Deinen Wunschkollegen! Unser lukratives Mitarbeiterempfehlungsprogramm liegt uns besonders am Herzen und macht sich auch für Dich bezahlt!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern Workplace:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Du erhältst von uns eine moderne IT-Ausstattung (bspw. Firmenlaptop, Headsets, Zweitbildschirm, Smartphone etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Großartige Unternehmenskultur:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Wir pflegen eine offene Du-Kultur und feiern legendäre größere und kleinere Teamevents!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ÜBERZEUGT? SO GEHT’S WEITER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir freuen uns über Deinen aussagekräftigen CV, den Du über das untenstehende Formular hochladen kannst. Ein Anschreiben darfst Du gerne weglassen. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Solltest Du uns noch weitere Dokumente zur Verfügung stellen wollen, kannst Du sie in diesem Feld einfügen. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Wir freuen uns sehr Dich kennenzulernen!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DU WILLST NOCH MEHR ÜBER UNS WISSEN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SITS Group&lt;/strong&gt; - Sicherheit braucht Partner: Als führende Unternehmensgruppe für IT Security stehen wir für eine ganzheitliche Sicherheit. Mit über 700 Mitarbeitenden vereint die SITS Group Erfahrung, Kompetenz, Ressourcen und Services hochkarätiger IT Security-Provider zu einem umfassenden Ganzen. Für unsere Kunden bieten wir mithilfe innovativer Lösungen und Technologien Gesamtkonzepte zur IT Security, die auf den Aspekten Schützen, Erkennen und Abwehren beruhen. Dazu zählen der Einsatz maßgeschneiderter Strategien, die Sensibilisierung der Mitarbeitenden sowie weitreichende Servicepakete. Sämtliche Prozesse in Unternehmen werden immer stärker digital vernetzt. Dank aufeinander abgestimmter Maßnahmen und einem mehrschichtigen Schutzsystem sind unsere Kunden für die Zukunft gewappnet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hilf uns die IT-Sicherheit unserer Kunden zu schützen und werde Teil unserer großartigen Vision mit einem einzigartigen Teamgeist.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KONTAKT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bei Fragen kannst Du Dich gerne per &lt;a ----- an&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;▶ Anna Scherer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; (Talent Acquisition Partnerin) wenden.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Anaplan, we are a team of innovators focused on optimizing business decision-making through our leading AI-infused scenario planning and analysis platform so our customers can outpace their competition and the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What unites Anaplanners across teams and geographies is our collective commitment to our customers’ success and to our Winning Culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;Our customers rank among the who’s who in the Fortune 50. Coca-Cola, LinkedIn, Adobe, LVMH and Bayer are just a few of the 2,400+ global companies who rely on our best-in-class platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;Our Winning Culture is the engine that drives our teams of innovators. We champion diversity of thought and ideas, we behave like leaders regardless of title, we are committed to achieving ambitious goals, and we love celebrating&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;our wins – big and small.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supported by operating principles of being strategy-led, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anaplan.com/careers/&quot;&gt;values&lt;/a&gt;-based and disciplined in execution, you’ll be inspired, connected, developed and rewarded here. Everything that makes you unique is welcome; join us and let’s build what’s next - together!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a versatile and highly skilled Principal Software Engineer who can work seamlessly across our frontend and backend services—from designing highly performant, intuitive modern user interfaces to building robust API services, Model Context Protocol (MCP) services, and autonomous AI agents. In this role, you will lead the architecture, design, and deployment of scalable Generative AI solutions, ensuring seamless integration into our core planning workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a unique role requiring deep software engineering expertise across both frontend and backend development, combined with hands-on experience building production-ready GenAI features. You will bridge the gap between backend APIs, custom MCP services, agentic workflows, and responsive modern user interfaces to deliver intelligent, automated planning experiences for our global customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership &amp;amp; System Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect, design, and deploy scalable Generative AI solutions, autonomous AI agents, and full-stack services (frontends and backend services) into production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End GenAI Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Build comprehensive GenAI features including backend API services, custom tools, LLM model integration, and evaluation harnesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Agents &amp;amp; MCP Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, build, and maintain Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers and services that securely expose backend data and enterprise tools to agentic AI workflows. Implement robust orchestration, tool-calling capabilities, and multi-agent coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Stack Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices across our full stack, guiding the development of responsive frontend applications (React/TypeScript) and robust, scalable backend services (Python, Java, Kotlin, or Node.js).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LLM Observability &amp;amp; Reliability:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish robust LLM observability, evaluations, and caching, implementing latency optimisations and comprehensive monitoring (logging, usage tracking, agent behaviour).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion high availability, performance optimisation, and observability across frontends and backend microservices, focusing on practices that maintain platform reliability and optimise MTTD and MTTR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship &amp;amp; Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Elevate the engineering organisation by mentoring senior and junior engineers, conducting rigorous code and system design reviews, and partnering with product managers to translate product visions into actionable technical roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive professional software engineering experience, with a proven track record of delivering complex, high-quality technical projects in a senior or principal role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Agentic Production Exposure:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep hands-on experience designing, deploying, and scaling agentic AI workflows, tool integrations, and GenAI features in production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Stack Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; High proficiency in modern frontend frameworks (specifically React and TypeScript) and robust backend development languages (Python, Java/Kotlin, or Node.js).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GenAI &amp;amp; MCP Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of LLM APIs, prompt engineering, agentic/multi-agent architectures, and building/consuming Model Context Protocol (MCP) services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Observability &amp;amp; Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong experience with application observability, logging, and performance monitoring across distributed backend systems and frontend applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional communication skills with a demonstrated ability to collaborate across engineering, product, and design teams to take ideas from prototype to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic Tools &amp;amp; Frameworks:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with agent orchestration frameworks and integrating AI agents with enterprise platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Observability Tooling:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with GenAI observability and evaluation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Domain:&lt;/strong&gt; Previous experience in Enterprise Performance Management (EPM), financial planning, business analytics, or related enterprise SaaS environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Community Contributions:&lt;/strong&gt; Contributions to open-source agent frameworks, MCP servers, or published research in distributed systems or Generative AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity, Equity, Inclusion and Belonging (DEIB) &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe attracting and retaining the best talent and fostering an inclusive culture strengthens our business. DEIB improves our workforce, enhances trust with our partners and customers, and drives business success. Build your career in a place where diversity, equity, inclusion and belonging aren’t just words on paper – this is what drives our innovation, it’s how we connect, and it contributes to what makes us a market leader. We believe in a hiring and working environment where all people are respected and valued, regardless of gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, ethnicity, age, neurodiversity, disability status, citizenship, or any other aspect which makes people unique. We hire you for who you are, and we want you to bring your authentic self to work every day! &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will ensure that individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to participate in the job application or interview process, perform essential job functions, and receive equitable benefits and all privileges of employment. Please contact us to request accommodation. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud Recruitment Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It has come to our attention that fraudulent and fictitious job opportunities are being circulated on the Internet. Prospective candidates are being contacted by certain individuals, mainly through telephone calls, emails and correspondence, claiming they are representatives of Anaplan. The main purpose of these correspondences and announcements is to obtain privileged information from individuals.  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anaplan does not: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend offers to candidates without an extensive interview process with a member of our recruitment team and a hiring manager via video or in person.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Send job offers via email. All offers are first extended verbally by a member of our internal recruitment team whenever possible and then followed up via written communication. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All emails from Anaplan would come from an ----- email address. Should you have any doubts about the authenticity of an email, letter or telephone communication purportedly from, for, or on behalf of Anaplan, please send an email to ----- before taking any further action in relation to the correspondence.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW36347262 BCX0&quot;&gt;Privacy &amp;amp; AI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW36347262 BCX0&quot;&gt; Notice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt;andidate data processed during our recruitment activities is handled &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt;in accordance with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt; our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anaplan.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This may include the use of artificial intelligence or automated tools to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt;assist&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt; our team in evaluating qualifications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

