&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Managing Principal - Software Engineering &amp;amp; Architecture H/F&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: Paris (Hybrid) | Practice Area: Technology &amp;amp; Engineering | Type: Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons un(e) Managing Principal - Software Engineering &amp;amp; Architecture pour piloter et développer notre expertise en software engineering, tout en accompagnant nos clients dans leurs transformations les plus complexes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ce rôle de leadership technologique, s&#39;articule autour de trois dimensions essentielles : Engineering Leadership, Architecture &amp;amp; Transformation et Client Development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que Software Engineering Chapter Lead, vous définirez les orientations techniques, renforcerez les standards d&#39;ingénierie et accompagnerez le développement de notre communauté de Tech Leads, d&#39;architectes et d&#39;ingénieurs seniors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous aurez une forte proximité avec les technologies et la réalisation des projets, tout en collaborant avec les décideurs de haut niveau chez nos clients afin de structurer leurs transformations, d&#39;influencer leurs choix technologiques et de développer de nouvelles opportunités pour Capco.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce que vous ferez&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engineering &amp;amp; Chapter Leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter et développer notre communauté software engineering en définissant les standards, les principes et les bonnes pratiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accompagner, coacher et faire monter en compétences les tech leads, les architectes et les ingénieurs seniors, tout en contribuant au développement des expertises.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promouvoir une culture d&#39;excellence en ingénierie, de responsabilisation technique et d&#39;amélioration continue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on Architecture &amp;amp; Engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apporter une expertise technique approfondie et opérationnelle sur les technologies backend, notamment Java&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyser en profondeur les architectures et les conceptions techniques, challenger les choix technologiques et orienter les équipes vers des solutions pragmatiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accompagner les initiatives de modernisation technologique autour des architectures cloud-native, des systèmes distribués, des API, des microservices et des architectures événementielles (event-driven).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Garantir que les solutions répondent aux exigences de sécurité, de scalabilité, de résilience, de performance et &lt;strong&gt;d&#39;observabilité&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Client Advisory &amp;amp; Business Development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développer des relations de confiance avec les CTO, CIO, Heads of Engineering, Heads of Architecture et responsables Product de nos clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenger les approches de manière constructive et influencer les décisions stratégiques de nos clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer à l&#39;élaboration des propositions commerciales et aux soutenances, notamment en définissant les approches, les architectures, les équipes et les modèles de delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer au développement des offres et du portefeuille clients de Capco dans les domaines du Software Engineering, de l&#39;Architecture, du Cloud et de la modernisation technologique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce que nous recherchons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous êtes un(e) leader expérimenté(e) en ingénierie logicielle et en technologie, capable de conjuguer une expertise technique approfondie, une vision architecturale, des compétences en leadership et une forte orientation client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Votre parcours peut notamment vous avoir amené(e) à occuper des fonctions de Principal Engineer, Principal Tech Lead, Engineering Lead, Software Architect ou Head of Engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous disposez des compétences et expériences suivantes :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une expérience confirmée dans l&#39;encadrement et le développement d&#39;ingénieurs seniors, de Tech Leads et/ou d&#39;architectes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une expertise approfondie en conception logicielle, systèmes distribués, architectures cloud-native et pratiques modernes d&#39;ingénierie. Notamment avec l’usage de l’IA appliqués au Product Development Life Cycle (PDLC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;D&#39;excellentes compétences en communication, en &lt;strong&gt;français&lt;/strong&gt; comme en &lt;strong&gt;anglais&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une expérience dans les services financiers, le secteur bancaire ou les paiements constitue un atout.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi rejoindre Capco?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco est un cabinet de conseil international, spécialisé dans les services financiers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fondé en 1998, le cabinet compte aujourd’hui plus de 7 000 collaborateurs dans 36 bureaux à travers le monde, dont 160 à Paris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Challenger reconnu face aux grands noms du conseil, Capco se distingue par sa double expertise métier et technologique, au service de la stratégie comme de l’exécution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre promesse : accompagner la transformation de nos clients dans un monde en constante mutation réglementaire, technologique et opérationnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous intervenons à l’intersection du business, de la réglementation et de la tech, en mobilisant des équipes pluridisciplinaires, expérimentées et engagées.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nos Marqueurs Distinctifs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une spécialisation sectorielle forte Nous apportons à nos clients une compréhension approfondie de leurs enjeux métiers, en particulier dans la banque, les marchés de capitaux et l’énergie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une approche collaborative et sur mesure Nous intégrons les équipes clients, adaptons nos méthodes à leur culture et co-construisons des solutions concrètes et opérationnelles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;L’excellence comme exigence Notre ambition est d’obtenir des résultats mesurables et durables pour nos clients – et de toujours viser la valeur ajoutée.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un esprit “One Capco” Nos équipes collaborent à l’échelle internationale pour mobiliser les meilleures expertises et partager les bonnes pratiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une culture entrepreneuriale et inclusive L’innovation, l’initiative et le mérite sont au cœur de notre modèle. Nous valorisons les idées, la diversité et le progrès collectif.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nos expertises s’articulent autour de 6 métiers complémentaires&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stratégie &amp;amp; Transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finance, Risque &amp;amp; Conformité&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product, Innovation &amp;amp; Design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conseil Tech (Advisory)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering (Delivery)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chez Capco, nous vous offrons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un environnement de travail international centré sur l’innovation et la création de valeur pour nos clients bancaires et assuranciels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un parcours de formation continu adapté à vos besoins, pour acquérir de nouvelles compétences et développer une réelle expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une organisation de travail hybride (charte télétravail de 2 jours par semaine)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une rémunération compétitive avec un bonus lié à la performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un PEE avec un abondement de 2903€ par an&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une culture d’entreprise entrepreneuriale, inclusive et méritocratique, de nouveau certifiée Great Place To Work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des initiatives pour construire le Capco de demain :&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;#BeYourselfAtWork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Woman@capco&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSE (forfait mobilité durable, jour de solidarité, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des communautés métiers, sportives et culturelles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Capco Paris, handicap visible ou invisible, parcours atypique ou classique, toutes les candidatures sont les bienvenues et seront traitées avec équité.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Axon and be a Force for Good.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Axon, we’re on a mission to Protect Life. We’re explorers, pursuing society’s most critical safety and justice issues with our ecosystem of devices and cloud software. Like our products, we work better together. We connect with candor and care, seeking out diverse perspectives from our customers, communities and each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Life at Axon is fast-paced, challenging and meaningful. Here, you’ll take ownership and drive real change. Constantly grow as you work hard for a mission that matters at a company where you matter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Your Impact&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the technical authority for RF hardware behind Dedrone&#39;s airspace security products — the RF detection sensors that find and classify drones, and the countermeasure systems that defeat them. You own the hard RF problems end to end: wideband receive chains, high-power transmit chains, and their physical realization on board. You do not carry direct reports, but you technically lead a group of RF hardware engineers and antenna designers — you set the standards they design to, review their work, and grow their capability.&amp;nbsp;This is a hands-on role. You will spend real time in simulation, on the bench, and in the chamber.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; This role is based out of our Kassel office and follows a hybrid schedule. We rely on in-person collaboration and ask that team members work onsite Tuesdays through Fridays, with the flexibility to work remotely on Mondays, unless there is an approved workplace accommodation. We believe that connection fuels innovation, and our in-office culture is designed to foster meaningful teamwork, mentorship, and shared success.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&lt;/strong&gt; Director RF Engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own RF front-end architecture from VHF through SHF: link budgets, frequency planning, spurious and intermodulation analysis, sensitivity and dynamic-range trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and characterize mixers, high-power amplifiers, filters, and switching networks against demanding linearity, efficiency, and thermal targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive board-level simulation (EM, circuit, and co-simulation) and take designs through multi-layer RF PCB layout, stack-up definition, and fabrication release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead bring-up, characterization, and design-for-test; close the loop between simulated and measured performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and enforce RF design standards, review checklists, and documentation practice across the group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor RF HW engineers and antenna designers; raise the technical bar through design reviews rather than rework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with DSP, software, mechanical, and systems engineering, and with regulatory/compliance on CE, FCC, and MIL-STD qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise leadership on technology direction, build-vs-buy, and technical risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in RF hardware design, with a track record of products shipped to volume.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise across VHF, UHF, and SHF — not just one band.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated design ownership of mixers and high-power amplifiers above 10 W.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong command of RF simulation tooling — EM and circuit solvers (e.g. ADS, AWR, HFSS, CST) — and the judgment to know when simulation is telling you the truth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-layer RF PCB design: controlled impedance, material selection, grounding, isolation, thermal management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent with VNAs, spectrum analyzers, signal generators, and power measurement; comfortable debugging from first principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven technical leadership of a design group — setting direction and standards, mentoring, running rigorous design reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Electrical Engineering, Communications Engineering, or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Antenna design and integration — element and array design, platform effects, radiation-pattern measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direction-finding techniques (amplitude/phase comparison, interferometry, TDOA, AoA estimation).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Beamforming across approaches: analog, digital, and hybrid; phased arrays and adaptive/null-steering methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with SDR platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and qualifying products for regulated markets — CE, FCC, and/or MIL-STD.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of DSP concepts sufficient to trade functionality between analog and digital domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Don’t meet every single requirement? That&#39;s ok. At Axon, we Aim Far. We think big with a long-term view because we want to reinvent the world to be a safer, better place. We are also committed to building diverse teams that reflect the communities we serve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Studies have shown that women and people of color are less likely to apply to jobs unless they check every box in the job description. If you’re excited about this role and our mission to Protect Life but your experience doesn’t align perfectly with every qualification listed here, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important Notes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The above job description is not intended as, nor should it be construed as, exhaustive of all duties, responsibilities, skills, efforts, or working conditions associated with this job. The job description may change or be supplemented at any time in accordance with business needs and conditions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Some roles may also require legal eligibility to work in a firearms environment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We collect personal information from applicants to evaluate candidates for employment. You may request access, deletion, or exercise other CCPA rights at&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot; ----- ----- via our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://privacyportal.onetrust.com/webform/0efc1702-9321-4119-bc9d-a06c3a1d3e4e/ca57cc26-a159-4193-9f6e-58ffe3fd2509&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://privacyportal.onetrust.com/webform/0efc1702-9321-4119-bc9d-a06c3a1d3e4e/ca57cc26-a159-4193-9f6e-58ffe3fd2509&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Axon Privacy Web Form&lt;/a&gt;. For more information, please see the Your California Privacy Rights section of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.axon.com/candidateprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.axon.com/candidateprivacypolicy&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Axon’s mission is to Protect Life and is committed to the well-being and safety of its employees as well as Axon’s impact on the environment. All Axon employees must be aware of and committed to the appropriate environmental, health, and safety regulations, policies, and procedures. Axon employees are empowered to report safety concerns as they arise and activities potentially impacting the environment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer that promotes justice, advances equity, values diversity and fosters inclusion. We’re committed to hiring the best talent — regardless of race, creed, color, ancestry, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship status, marital status, disability, gender identity, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable laws, regulations and ordinances — and empowering all of our employees so they can do their best work. If you have a disability or special need that requires assistance or accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a ---------- &lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;Please note that this email address is for accommodation purposes only. Axon will not respond to inquiries for other purposes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Phishing alert:&amp;nbsp; Axon will never ask you to pay for any part of the hiring process, including training, equipment, or background checks. We do not make job offers via text message, WhatsApp, or instant messaging platforms without a formal interview process.&amp;nbsp; All legitimate job openings are listed on our official careers page at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.axon.com/careers&quot;&gt;https://www.axon.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;If you receive a suspicious offer or outreach from an email address that is not ----- or if you are asked for sensitive personal information (bank details, Social Security Number) prematurely, please ignore the message and report it to &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As a member of the&amp;nbsp;ShipBob&amp;nbsp;Team, you will...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Grow with an Ownership Mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;:&amp;nbsp;We champion continuous learning and innovation.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;take on real problems,&amp;nbsp;create tangible&amp;nbsp;solutions, and&amp;nbsp;drive results that move the needle&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;ShipBob,&amp;nbsp;our merchants, and for your own professional growth.&amp;nbsp;If&amp;nbsp;you&#39;re&amp;nbsp;ready to do the most meaningful work of your career, this is the place.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Peers and Leaders Alike:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At&amp;nbsp;ShipBob,&amp;nbsp;leaders are&amp;nbsp;accessible;&amp;nbsp;feedback flows in both directions, and&amp;nbsp;everyone, regardless of their seniority or role, steps up to help when needed.&amp;nbsp;We hold each other to&amp;nbsp;high standards&amp;nbsp;because we trust each other to meet them. That combination of transparency and mutual respect is what makes the work here feel worth doing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience a High-Performance Culture and Clear Purpose:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We are results-driven and&amp;nbsp;clear about what that means: our&amp;nbsp;goals are specific, accountability is shared, and every team member can see how their work connects to&amp;nbsp;our mission. When we hit milestones, we celebrate them together. When we fall short, we learn and move forward.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-ccp-border-bottom=&quot;0px none #000000&quot; data-ccp-padding-bottom=&quot;0px&quot; data-ccp-border-between=&quot;0px none #000000&quot; data-ccp-padding-between=&quot;0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW238963427 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238963427 BCX8&quot;&gt;Hiring timeline: We are actively accepting applications and conducting interviews for this position. The anticipated start date for the selected candidate is February 2027.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
