&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;We’re committed to creating an inclusive environment that accommodates diverse needs while maintaining our collaborative culture. Join us in shaping the future of work!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Note: While we offer flexibility, commitment to our hybrid schedule is an important aspect of our team culture and performance expectations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-redactor-tag=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Inclusion Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are always looking for talented individuals to join ClearScore. We are an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for our people. Please see our People Policy Notice at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.clearscore.com/people-notice&quot;&gt;https://www.clearscore.com/people-notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Bluestaq Limited&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Bluestaq starts with our people. We are looking for teammates who THINK strategically, SERVE the mission and LEAD from wherever they stand. If you bring curiosity, ownership and a thirst for delivery, we would like to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every society runs on invisible systems; Bluestaq is that, for data. Bluestaq Ltd is the UK sovereign subsidiary of Bluestaq LLC (Colorado Springs, USA), and we build the secure data infrastructure that allied operations depend on: mission-critical solutions, flowing through thousands of global users, from ingest to publication in milliseconds, for customers spanning the NATO, Five Eyes and wider allied partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are in our formative years in the UK, building on proven foundations in the USA and Australia. That means real opportunity, early: decisions at your level, and colleagues who know their craft and trust you to know yours.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:220,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:90}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You will own specific Linux systems supporting our NATO delivery on AWS, from configuration and monitoring to upgrades and incident response. You will be the specialist the team escalates to when a fault defeats first-line troubleshooting, and you will improve reliability as well as restore it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You will mentor Systems Administrators in troubleshooting and operational hygiene. This is an individual contributor role with no direct reports, reporting to the Systems Administration Manager, with a clear technical path to Lead Systems Administrator.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:220,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:90}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Own one or more systems or environments, covering configuration, monitoring and alerting, upgrades and incident response.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Debug difficult faults, including performance problems, resource exhaustion and integration failures, and take each incident from first symptom to a root cause and a remediation plan that holds.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Configure and tune services with secure, hardened defaults, and turn scan output and logs into lasting remediation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Plan and execute upgrades and changes under change control, with realistic risk assessment and a tested rollback.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Act as the escalation point for Systems Administrator colleagues, mentor them, and document patterns others can reuse in runbooks and standard operating procedures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Work across engineering, cyber and data teams on cross-functional problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Take part in UK operational coverage, including on-call rotation and structured handovers with the US team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;What You Bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:220,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:90}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Strong hands-on Linux systems administration in complex, secure production environments, with depth in service behaviour, performance tuning and hardened configuration. Experience on Microsoft Azure, VMware vSphere or similar platforms is transferable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Sound networking fundamentals, including DNS, DHCP, VLANs, firewalls and routing, and hands-on identity and access management across directory services and cloud platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Working experience with automation and infrastructure-as-code tooling such as Ansible, Terraform, Kubernetes, Docker or Packer, and with patching discipline and configuration compliance in an accredited environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Curiosity and incident discipline: you diagnose faults under pressure, find the root cause, and record what you found as well as what you fixed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience owning systems, escalating only genuinely novel problems, and mentoring less experienced colleagues deliberately.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Clear written and verbal communication, including when the news is bad, and confident use of ITSM workflows and platforms such as Confluence and Jira.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Judgement with AI tools: applying them where they help, reviewing what they produce and handling sensitive data responsibly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Essential Conditions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:220,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:90}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Right to work in the UK.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Ability to meet the security requirements above.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Willingness to work 10-hour shifts on a four-on, four-off rota, including weekends and bank holidays. Night shifts may follow as further systems come online and the service moves to 24/7.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Willingness and eligibility to travel to Bluestaq headquarters in the United States for onboarding, and occasionally to sites across the UK and Europe thereafter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:220,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:90}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Familiarity with NATO structures, the NATO Communications and Information Agency (NCIA), the MOD or other allied defence programmes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Linux certification such as RHCSA, RHCE or LPIC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;CISSP, CompTIA Security+ or an equivalent security certification.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience with CI/CD pipelines, DevSecOps or Secure by Design delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience with database administration or data-platform operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;A background in cloud, cyber security or C4ISR environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:220,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:90}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Workplace pension through salary exchange.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Group income protection and group life assurance from day one.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;33 days’ annual leave including bank holidays, applied to your shift pattern.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Private medical cover and 24/7 remote GP access for you and your family.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Professional subscription support and ongoing development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:70,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Bluestaq Ltd is an Armed Forces Covenant signatory. Service leavers and reservists who know watch-keeping, escalation and operating under pressure will recognise this work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Apply&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:220,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:90}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;If you meet most of the criteria, apply through this listing with your CV.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the Mission&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Protect data that matters. Build capability the United Kingdom depends on. Launch into operations, not pitch decks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Bluestaq Ltd is committed to an inclusive workplace. We welcome applications from all backgrounds, including career returners, service leavers, reservists and people underrepresented in defence technology. We recruit on capability and potential in line with the Equality Act 2010. If you need reasonable adjustments at any stage, tell us when you apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16314602,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276,&amp;quot;335572071&amp;quot;:8,&amp;quot;335572072&amp;quot;:8,&amp;quot;335572073&amp;quot;:12874308,&amp;quot;335572075&amp;quot;:8,&amp;quot;335572076&amp;quot;:8,&amp;quot;335572077&amp;quot;:12874308,&amp;quot;335572079&amp;quot;:8,&amp;quot;335572080&amp;quot;:8,&amp;quot;335572081&amp;quot;:12874308,&amp;quot;335572083&amp;quot;:8,&amp;quot;335572084&amp;quot;:8,&amp;quot;335572085&amp;quot;:12874308,&amp;quot;469789798&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;single&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469789802&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;single&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469789806&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;single&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469789810&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;single&amp;quot;}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are proud to support the Armed Forces Covenant. Service leavers and reservists who know watch-keeping, escalation and operating under pressure will find this role speaks their language.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;When you apply to a job on this site, the personal data contained in your application will be collected by&amp;nbsp;Bluestaq LLC (&quot;Controller&quot;), located at 2 S. Cascade Ave., Ste 200, Colorado Springs, CO 80903, contactable at ----- Controller’s data protection officer is Ashley Higgins, who can be contacted at -----
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your personal data will be processed for the purposes of managing Controller&#39;s recruitment activities, including setting up and conducting interviews and assessments, evaluating results, and other steps in the recruitment and hiring process. This processing is lawful under Article 6(1)(f) of the UK GDPR as necessary for Controller&#39;s legitimate interests in soliciting, evaluating, and selecting applicants for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your personal data will be shared with Greenhouse Software, Inc., a cloud services provider based in the United States engaged by Controller to help manage recruitment on its behalf. Your data will accordingly be transferred to the United States once submitted. Greenhouse is certified under the UK Extension to the EU-U.S. Data Privacy Framework, which the UK government has confirmed provides an adequate level of protection for personal data transferred from the UK.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your personal data will be retained for&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;180 days from the date of your application, reflecting the time limit (including possible extensions) for bringing recruitment-related legal claims in the UK, after which it will be deleted or anonymised. If you are hired, your application data will become part of your employee record, retained in accordance with our employee privacy notice.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Under the UK GDPR, you have the right to request access to, rectification of, or erasure of your personal data, and to request that processing be restricted. You also have the right to object to processing carried out on the basis of legitimate interests, and the right to data portability. You may lodge a complaint with the UK Information Commissioner&#39;s Office (ICO) at ico.org.uk or 0303 123 1113.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our everyday digital experiences are in the middle of a realtime revolution: chatting alongside a livestream, getting realtime financial updates, or working with colleagues in a shared online space. Consumers now expect realtime as standard, and Ably powers a large part of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We put developers first. Our products help teams build, extend, and deliver realtime digital experiences, delivering over 700 billion messages to more than 2 billion devices every month. Teams at HubSpot, Fin, Dialpad, NASCAR, Sportsbet, and General Motors all build on Ably.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Ably means helping build the infrastructure that will shape the next generation of the internet. More of what people do online is becoming live, shared and interactive, which only makes what we build more relevant and more necessary. AI is the latest place that shows up. There&#39;s still so much to build, and we&#39;d like your help with it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Staff Tech Lead for the Developer Experience team at Ably, you’ll report directly to our CTO and co-own the DevEx vision and strategy. You’ll lead the engineering team that owns our customer-facing web platform - our dashboard, documentation platform, and control plane - transforming it into a world-class experience for our users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a senior, hands-on engineer who’s passionate about building for developers like yourself; someone who’ll obsess over the developer journey and elevate the user experience of the Ably platform. You’ll blend deep full-stack expertise with a strong product mindset, and lead a team of engineers working on initiatives where the feedback loop is immediate, because you and your team are the target users of the very ecosystem you are building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ably is an AI-forward organisation and this is a leadership role for an AI-first engineer. You must have confident, hands-on experience of AI-assisted development and be able to define how a team actually works with these tools day to day, and tell the difference between genuine leverage and noise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day to day you will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Obsess over developer experience. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll have broad responsibility for elevating how developers interact with Ably’s platform and services, partnering with the DevEx PM as a unified leadership team to deliver a developer experience that becomes a reference point for the industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and lead on AI-first working practices.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll be the catalyst and standard-setter for AI-enabled development across the team. You’ll leverage LLMs and AI tools to accelerate velocity, design workflows, set the guardrails and coach engineers to use them well - without compromising on engineering integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead technical execution and vision.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll lead a team of five engineers building customer-facing web applications and own the technical architecture and design decisions for our dashboard, docs platform, marketing website, and billing UI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive a product-first engineering culture.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll foster an environment where engineers are themselves principal stakeholders of product features, and obsess over customer outcomes. You’ll challenge the &quot;feature factory&quot; mentality and build a team that takes true ownership of the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thrive in a rapid iteration environment.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll operate in a high-velocity workspace where PMs, customers, and engineers co-create features. You’ll lead the team in working full-stack to iterate, improve, and ship improvements quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guide engineering outcomes and quality.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll set and enforce high standards for code review, testing, and production readiness. You will participate in incident response and coordinate with the Infrastructure team on platform dependencies and deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor and grow the team.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll manage performance, career development, and hiring. You will hold the team accountable for delivery commitments while providing the mentorship needed to turn engineers into product-minded leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to talk if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real, demonstrable experience leading AI-first engineering. You champion the use of AI as a productivity multiplier for the team, and have led a team that ships with LLMs and AI tooling embedded in its daily workflow. You see AI as an enabler for higher velocity and output, not a replacement for engineering judgment, and hold strong, evidence-based views on what works and what doesn’t.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience leading technical teams in technical B2B SaaS or API-first products, with a track record of product-minded engineering teams that take initiative and ownership of product outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong software engineering background with genuine full-stack fluency. You must have enough depth across the web stack to credibly lead and challenge senior web engineers. Hands-on experience with React and TypeScript is valuable, but sound engineering judgement and technical gravitas matter more than specific frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a natural empathy and strong instincts for what developer customers want because you are the target user. You are genuinely excited about building developer tools and can tap into immediate feedback loops. You understand API design, documentation, and the nuances that differentiate a great developer journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at a startup or growth-stage company or adaptability to thrive in a fast-paced, agile environment with a focus on rapid iteration. To be effective in this role you’ll need excellent communication and cross-functional collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep production experience building and shipping customer-facing web applications at scale with React and TypeScript.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering solutions used by software developers (developer tooling or APIs) or similar technical personas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of pub/sub and familiarity with distributed systems and event based architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s it like to work at Ably?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join a team of around 60 people, working directly alongside senior engineering and leadership. No layers, no bureaucracy, and real ownership from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Remote-first&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hire the best people wherever they are across the UK and Europe, trust them to own their work, and share decisions and feedback openly. Twice a year, in February and August, we all meet in person, and we expect everyone to be there.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Remote-first comes with trade-offs. On one side: flexibility, no commute, long stretches of focus time, and a wider pool of people to hire from. On the other: it can feel isolating, relationships take effort to build, and you miss the chance conversations an office creates. As our only recruiter, you&#39;ll need to manage your own time and stay close to the hiring managers and candidates you work with.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you do your best work with trust and autonomy, this will suit you. If you&#39;d rather have an office around you every day, it probably isn&#39;t the right fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our six values shape how we work day to day:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open for all.&lt;/strong&gt; We default to sharing openly: source, decisions, and feedback, with open minds to match.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech needs humanity.&lt;/strong&gt; We build with empathy, for colleagues and developers alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Even the best do better.&lt;/strong&gt; We keep raising our own bar, driven by curiosity, not complacency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bias for action.&lt;/strong&gt; Once we know enough to act, we act, rather than waiting for certainty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dependable by default.&lt;/strong&gt; We take real ownership of what we ship and what we promise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bold creativity wins.&lt;/strong&gt; We treat big constraints as a reason to think differently, not less.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can read more about how we defined these values on &lt;a href=&quot;ably.com/blog/ably-values&quot;&gt;our blog&lt;/a&gt;, and see the team behind them on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;ably.com/careers&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Diversity, inclusion, and belonging at Ably&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe our differences as individuals are what make us great. Our people are at the heart of what we do, and we encourage everyone to be their most authentic self at Ably: we see inclusivity and openness as fundamental to our long-term success. We encourage applications from all backgrounds regardless of age, disability, gender, sexual orientation, parental status, race, religion, educational background, or neurodiversity. Ably has an amazing opportunity ahead of us, and we want anyone to be able to contribute to it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you enjoy working as part of a technology company, value open source, and love solving hard problems, we&#39;d love to hear from you, regardless of whether you fit the job description exactly or not. If in doubt, drop us an&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;a ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;email&lt;/a&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;; we&#39;re happy to give you advice on your application.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll get&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A remote-first and flexible work environment. Our London office (next to Old Street) is there whenever you want it. Aside from our company get-togethers, you&#39;re welcome to work wherever suits you best.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity. We&#39;re a growing start-up, and we want everyone to share in the company&#39;s success through our EMI share options programme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced holiday allowance: 28 days of paid annual leave (27 regular days, plus a day off to enjoy your birthday).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced parental leave, so you can spend time with your new family member: up to 16 weeks fully paid for primary caregivers and 4 weeks for secondary, depending on length of service.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home workstation budget of £500 on joining (and £150 per year after that), so your home office serves you well.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal learning and development budget of £1000 a year, plus 5% L&amp;amp;D time during working hours to build your skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private healthcare with BUPA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A medical cash plan covering a range of medical and dental costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental wellbeing coaching and counselling from Self Space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A monthly wellbeing budget via Juno.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance and income protection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Tech and Cycle to Work schemes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A weekly snack allowance for our end-of-week &quot;Need to Know&quot; meeting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fully-paid one-month sabbatical after five years with Ably.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our everyday digital experiences are in the middle of a realtime revolution: chatting alongside a livestream, getting realtime financial updates, or working with colleagues in a shared online space. Consumers now expect realtime as standard, and Ably powers a large part of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We put developers first. Our products help teams build, extend, and deliver realtime digital experiences, delivering over 700 billion messages to more than 2 billion devices every month. Teams at HubSpot, Fin, Dialpad, NASCAR, Sportsbet, and General Motors all build on Ably.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Ably means helping build the infrastructure that will shape the next generation of the internet. More of what people do online is becoming live, shared and interactive, which only makes what we build more relevant and more necessary. AI is the latest place that shows up. There&#39;s still so much to build, and we&#39;d like your help with it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Pub/Sub team owns the core backend that underpins Ably&#39;s entire edge messaging platform. This is a rare opportunity to work on genuinely hard distributed systems problems at planet scale; designing and improving the infrastructure that developers and their users depend on in production every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be hands-on, driving the development of new functionality and initiatives to scale and improve Ably&#39;s core Pub/Sub platform. We work in an AI-first engineering culture: AI tools are part of how we plan, prototype, and iterate - but engineers own every technical decision, and human judgment is the quality bar that everything is measured against.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can read more about the core concepts of working on a truly distributed system in our blog post&lt;a href=&quot;https://ably.com/blog/what-is-a-distributed-systems-engineer&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day to day you will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver key platform functionality.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; You&#39;ll work across Ably&#39;s realtime products including our low-level Pub/Sub APIs, our LiveObjects state synchronisation layer, and AI Transport, the messaging backbone purpose-built for AI agent communication, focussing on shipping new features, performance improvements, bug fixes and maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work fluently with AI tooling.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll use AI tools for planning, spike work, code generation, and documentation, while taking full ownership of correctness, architectural quality, and what actually ships. Fast iteration is expected; shortcuts in quality are not.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve hard distributed systems problems&lt;/strong&gt;. You&#39;ll collaborate with a talented engineering team to work through genuinely interesting and challenging technical problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay driven by &#39;Developer First&#39; principles&lt;/strong&gt;. You&#39;ll work closely with other engineers to identify and address the most important problems developers face when building on Ably.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Push to see your work in customers&#39; hands&lt;/strong&gt;. You&#39;ll move with urgency to ship, because you care about the impact your work has on the developers and companies building on our platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to talk if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong interest in, or direct experience with, distributed systems and large-scale infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with or building messaging queues, pub/sub systems, or streaming systems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience with a high-level server-side language (Node.js or Go preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to self-start, work through ambiguity, and make good decisions without a lot of hand-holding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical relationship with AI tooling. You use it to go faster and think more clearly, and you know where to apply rigour that AI alone can&#39;t provide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A transparent, collaborative &#39;build in the open&#39; mindset. You&#39;re comfortable sharing your work publicly, whether that&#39;s writing about what you&#39;re building, talking about technical decisions, or contributing to the broader developer conversation around the problems Ably solves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in dynamic, early-stage environments where adaptability and resourcefulness are core skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building developer-first products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with products brought to market through a product-led growth approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s it like to work at Ably?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join a team of around 60 people, working directly alongside senior engineering and leadership. No layers, no bureaucracy, and real ownership from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Remote-first&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hire the best people wherever they are across the UK and Europe, trust them to own their work, and share decisions and feedback openly. Twice a year, in February and August, we all meet in person, and we expect everyone to be there.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Remote-first comes with trade-offs. On one side: flexibility, no commute, long stretches of focus time, and a wider pool of people to hire from. On the other: it can feel isolating, relationships take effort to build, and you miss the chance conversations an office creates. As our only recruiter, you&#39;ll need to manage your own time and stay close to the hiring managers and candidates you work with.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you do your best work with trust and autonomy, this will suit you. If you&#39;d rather have an office around you every day, it probably isn&#39;t the right fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our six values shape how we work day to day:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open for all.&lt;/strong&gt; We default to sharing openly: source, decisions, and feedback, with open minds to match.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech needs humanity.&lt;/strong&gt; We build with empathy, for colleagues and developers alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Even the best do better.&lt;/strong&gt; We keep raising our own bar, driven by curiosity, not complacency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bias for action.&lt;/strong&gt; Once we know enough to act, we act, rather than waiting for certainty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dependable by default.&lt;/strong&gt; We take real ownership of what we ship and what we promise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bold creativity wins.&lt;/strong&gt; We treat big constraints as a reason to think differently, not less.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can read more about how we defined these values on &lt;a href=&quot;ably.com/blog/ably-values&quot;&gt;our blog&lt;/a&gt;, and see the team behind them on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;ably.com/careers&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Diversity, inclusion, and belonging at Ably&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe our differences as individuals are what make us great. Our people are at the heart of what we do, and we encourage everyone to be their most authentic self at Ably: we see inclusivity and openness as fundamental to our long-term success. We encourage applications from all backgrounds regardless of age, disability, gender, sexual orientation, parental status, race, religion, educational background, or neurodiversity. Ably has an amazing opportunity ahead of us, and we want anyone to be able to contribute to it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you enjoy working as part of a technology company, value open source, and love solving hard problems, we&#39;d love to hear from you, regardless of whether you fit the job description exactly or not. If in doubt, drop us an&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;a ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;email&lt;/a&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;; we&#39;re happy to give you advice on your application.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll get&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A remote-first and flexible work environment. Our London office (next to Old Street) is there whenever you want it. Aside from our company get-togethers, you&#39;re welcome to work wherever suits you best.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity. We&#39;re a growing start-up, and we want everyone to share in the company&#39;s success through our EMI share options programme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced holiday allowance: 28 days of paid annual leave (27 regular days, plus a day off to enjoy your birthday).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced parental leave, so you can spend time with your new family member: up to 16 weeks fully paid for primary caregivers and 4 weeks for secondary, depending on length of service.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home workstation budget of £500 on joining (and £150 per year after that), so your home office serves you well.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal learning and development budget of £1000 a year, plus 5% L&amp;amp;D time during working hours to build your skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private healthcare with BUPA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A medical cash plan covering a range of medical and dental costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental wellbeing coaching and counselling from Self Space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A monthly wellbeing budget via Juno.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance and income protection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Tech and Cycle to Work schemes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A weekly snack allowance for our end-of-week &quot;Need to Know&quot; meeting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fully-paid one-month sabbatical after five years with Ably.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our everyday digital experiences are in the middle of a realtime revolution: chatting alongside a livestream, getting realtime financial updates, or working with colleagues in a shared online space. Consumers now expect realtime as standard, and Ably powers a large part of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We put developers first. Our products help teams build, extend, and deliver realtime digital experiences, delivering over 700 billion messages to more than 2 billion devices every month. Teams at HubSpot, Fin, Dialpad, NASCAR, Sportsbet, and General Motors all build on Ably.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Ably means helping build the infrastructure that will shape the next generation of the internet. More of what people do online is becoming live, shared and interactive, which only makes what we build more relevant and more necessary. AI is the latest place that shows up. There&#39;s still so much to build, and we&#39;d like your help with it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Senior Talent Partner at Ably, you&#39;ll be our sole in-house recruiter, reporting to our VP of People and owning hiring end-to-end, from calibrating the brief with the hiring manager through to signed offer. You’ll be responsible for everything that makes hiring work: how we interview, the tools we use, how we source, and how candidates experience Ably. There’s a good foundation in place, and you’ll decide what to sharpen first and have the autonomy and backing to do it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In a 60-person company, every hire changes the team, so this role exists to raise the bar: looking wider than the first good candidate, pushing back when a brief is off, making the case for waiting when the evidence isn&#39;t there, and judging your success by who is still thriving a year in, not how fast we filled the seat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ably is an infrastructure company, and a large share of our team are deeply technical engineers. You&#39;ll run full-cycle recruiting across the company, but engineering is where the depth matters most. You&#39;ll understand what we build well enough to hold a credible conversation with distributed systems engineers, tell depth from polish, and explain why our problems are worth their time. You&#39;ll work closely with hiring managers, right up to our CTO.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day to day, you will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Calibrate hiring briefs before we go to market. &lt;/strong&gt;Work with each hiring manager to turn complex technical requirements into a clear picture of who we need, and give honest feedback when the brief needs to change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find and close great people.&lt;/strong&gt; Run outbound sourcing, screens and interviews, and close offers for engineering, GTM and other roles, supporting offers and compensation conversations alongside our People team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make our interviews better.&lt;/strong&gt; Build on our structured interviews and scorecards so every process is fair, consistent and good at telling depth from polish.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get more out of our tools, with AI at the centre.&lt;/strong&gt; Make the most of Greenhouse and our hiring reporting, and put AI to work across sourcing, outreach, screening and admin so more of your time goes to the conversations that need a person. Use it as much as you can and show us what works.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage and negotiate our agency relationships. &lt;/strong&gt;Decide where agencies add the most value, set the terms, and hold them to account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Ably’s voice with candidates and the technical community. &lt;/strong&gt;Shape our employer brand and candidate experience, and make sure new hires land well before they start.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of finding and closing high-calibre engineers, ideally in infrastructure or distributed systems, and the technical grounding to earn engineers&#39; respect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgement when partnering with hiring managers: calibrating a brief, giving honest feedback, and running a structured, fair interview process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven full-cycle recruiting experience, ideally as the sole or lead recruiter in a start-up or scale-up, hiring across the UK and Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on outbound sourcing and market mapping, with the numbers to show what works, and a habit of using AI in how you work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing recruitment agencies, including negotiating terms and holding them to account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience hiring for developer tools, AI, or open source companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in agency recruiting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Greenhouse ATS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An active presence in tech or recruiting communities, online or in person, and comfort being a public face for Ably.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s it like to work at Ably?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join a team of around 60 people, working directly alongside senior engineering and leadership. No layers, no bureaucracy, and real ownership from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Remote-first&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hire the best people wherever they are across the UK and Europe, trust them to own their work, and share decisions and feedback openly. Twice a year, in February and August, we all meet in person, and we expect everyone to be there.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Remote-first comes with trade-offs. On one side: flexibility, no commute, long stretches of focus time, and a wider pool of people to hire from. On the other: it can feel isolating, relationships take effort to build, and you miss the chance conversations an office creates. As our only recruiter, you&#39;ll need to manage your own time and stay close to the hiring managers and candidates you work with.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you do your best work with trust and autonomy, this will suit you. If you&#39;d rather have an office around you every day, it probably isn&#39;t the right fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our six values shape how we work day to day:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open for all.&lt;/strong&gt; We default to sharing openly: source, decisions, and feedback, with open minds to match.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech needs humanity.&lt;/strong&gt; We build with empathy, for colleagues and developers alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Even the best do better.&lt;/strong&gt; We keep raising our own bar, driven by curiosity, not complacency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bias for action.&lt;/strong&gt; Once we know enough to act, we act, rather than waiting for certainty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dependable by default.&lt;/strong&gt; We take real ownership of what we ship and what we promise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bold creativity wins.&lt;/strong&gt; We treat big constraints as a reason to think differently, not less.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can read more about how we defined these values on &lt;a href=&quot;ably.com/blog/ably-values&quot;&gt;our blog&lt;/a&gt;, and see the team behind them on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;ably.com/careers&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Diversity, inclusion, and belonging at Ably&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe our differences as individuals are what make us great. Our people are at the heart of what we do, and we encourage everyone to be their most authentic self at Ably: we see inclusivity and openness as fundamental to our long-term success. We encourage applications from all backgrounds regardless of age, disability, gender, sexual orientation, parental status, race, religion, educational background, or neurodiversity. Ably has an amazing opportunity ahead of us, and we want anyone to be able to contribute to it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you enjoy working as part of a technology company, value open source, and love solving hard problems, we&#39;d love to hear from you, regardless of whether you fit the job description exactly or not. If in doubt, drop us an&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;a ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;email&lt;/a&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;; we&#39;re happy to give you advice on your application.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll get&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A remote-first and flexible work environment. Our London office (next to Old Street) is there whenever you want it. Aside from our company get-togethers, you&#39;re welcome to work wherever suits you best.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity. We&#39;re a growing start-up, and we want everyone to share in the company&#39;s success through our EMI share options programme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced holiday allowance: 28 days of paid annual leave (27 regular days, plus a day off to enjoy your birthday).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced parental leave, so you can spend time with your new family member: up to 16 weeks fully paid for primary caregivers and 4 weeks for secondary, depending on length of service.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home workstation budget of £500 on joining (and £150 per year after that), so your home office serves you well.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal learning and development budget of £1000 a year, plus 5% L&amp;amp;D time during working hours to build your skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private healthcare with BUPA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A medical cash plan covering a range of medical and dental costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental wellbeing coaching and counselling from Self Space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A monthly wellbeing budget via Juno.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance and income protection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Tech and Cycle to Work schemes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A weekly snack allowance for our end-of-week &quot;Need to Know&quot; meeting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fully-paid one-month sabbatical after five years with Ably.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our everyday digital experiences are in the middle of a realtime revolution: chatting alongside a livestream, getting realtime financial updates, or working with colleagues in a shared online space. Consumers now expect realtime as standard, and Ably powers a large part of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We put developers first. Our products help teams build, extend, and deliver realtime digital experiences, delivering over 700 billion messages to more than 2 billion devices every month. Teams at HubSpot, Fin, Dialpad, NASCAR, Sportsbet, and General Motors all build on Ably.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Ably means helping build the infrastructure that will shape the next generation of the internet. More of what people do online is becoming live, shared and interactive, which only makes what we build more relevant and more necessary. AI is the latest place that shows up. There&#39;s still so much to build, and we&#39;d like your help with it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ably&#39;s back office platform is where every customer account is managed. It holds the packages, entitlements and limits that determine what each of our customers can do, and it runs the tooling our Finance, Customer Success and Support teams rely on every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to take ownership of a platform the whole business depends on, with the scope to decide how it should work rather than maintain someone else&#39;s decisions. You&#39;ll be hands-on across entitlements, administration tooling and billing, working closely with our Head of Infrastructure and our Developer Experience team, and directly with the teams who use what you build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work in an AI-first engineering culture: AI tools are part of how we plan, prototype, and iterate, though engineers own every technical decision, and human judgment is the quality bar that everything is measured against.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day to day you will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run the back office platform.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll look after the systems holding every customer&#39;s packages, entitlements, limits and billing, along with the tooling Finance, Customer Success and Support use daily.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve problems, not tickets.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll be handed a problem, usually described by the people living with it rather than specified in advance, and you&#39;ll own the design as well as the delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make admin work for the people who use it.&lt;/strong&gt; Staff should be able to see what a customer has bought, how they&#39;re billed and what limits they have, make a change, and trust the result, without needing to understand our internal models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner across the company.&lt;/strong&gt; Finance, Customer Success, Support and Engineering are all your users. You&#39;ll learn their processes well enough to question a requirement rather than just build it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion AI-assisted development.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll use LLMs and AI tools for planning, spikes, code and docs to accelerate velocity, while owning correctness and architectural quality yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make the systems explain themselves.&lt;/strong&gt; Why a customer has the limits they have, and what produced an invoice, should be answerable without an engineer digging through code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the testing bar.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll decide what good looks like where mistakes cost money, build the harness to match, and hold the line on production readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to talk if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in large, established codebases, and the judgement to tell when a system should be extended, reworked, or replaced outright, including the confidence to say so unprompted. Ruby on Rails will help you get to grips with what we have today, though we care more about your range than any one language, and what you build here may well not be Rails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of shaping architecture inside a system you inherited, including the data ownership decisions that come with drawing a boundary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to self-start, work through ambiguity, and make good decisions without a lot of hand-holding. We&#39;ll bring you problems, not designs, and we&#39;d expect you to push back when the answer is to change a process rather than write code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An AI-first mindset. You see LLMs and AI tools as productivity multipliers and know where to apply the rigour they can&#39;t provide themselves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience making systems observable and testable. You instrument what you own, use it to answer questions you never designed for, and have set a test strategy for a system with patchy coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of usage-based billing systems, whether built in-house or on a platform such as Orb, Metronome, or Chargebee.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in platform or internal tooling teams rather than product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience being the engineer accountable for a system rather than one contributor among many, particularly one subject to financial or compliance audit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s it like to work at Ably?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join a team of around 60 people, working directly alongside senior engineering and leadership. No layers, no bureaucracy, and real ownership from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Remote-first&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hire the best people wherever they are across the UK and Europe, trust them to own their work, and share decisions and feedback openly. Twice a year, in February and August, we all meet in person, and we expect everyone to be there.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Remote-first comes with trade-offs. On one side: flexibility, no commute, long stretches of focus time, and a wider pool of people to hire from. On the other: it can feel isolating, relationships take effort to build, and you miss the chance conversations an office creates. As our only recruiter, you&#39;ll need to manage your own time and stay close to the hiring managers and candidates you work with.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you do your best work with trust and autonomy, this will suit you. If you&#39;d rather have an office around you every day, it probably isn&#39;t the right fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our six values shape how we work day to day:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open for all.&lt;/strong&gt; We default to sharing openly: source, decisions, and feedback, with open minds to match.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech needs humanity.&lt;/strong&gt; We build with empathy, for colleagues and developers alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Even the best do better.&lt;/strong&gt; We keep raising our own bar, driven by curiosity, not complacency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bias for action.&lt;/strong&gt; Once we know enough to act, we act, rather than waiting for certainty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dependable by default.&lt;/strong&gt; We take real ownership of what we ship and what we promise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bold creativity wins.&lt;/strong&gt; We treat big constraints as a reason to think differently, not less.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can read more about how we defined these values on &lt;a href=&quot;ably.com/blog/ably-values&quot;&gt;our blog&lt;/a&gt;, and see the team behind them on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;ably.com/careers&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Diversity, inclusion, and belonging at Ably&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe our differences as individuals are what make us great. Our people are at the heart of what we do, and we encourage everyone to be their most authentic self at Ably: we see inclusivity and openness as fundamental to our long-term success. We encourage applications from all backgrounds regardless of age, disability, gender, sexual orientation, parental status, race, religion, educational background, or neurodiversity. Ably has an amazing opportunity ahead of us, and we want anyone to be able to contribute to it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you enjoy working as part of a technology company, value open source, and love solving hard problems, we&#39;d love to hear from you, regardless of whether you fit the job description exactly or not. If in doubt, drop us an&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;a ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;email&lt;/a&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;; we&#39;re happy to give you advice on your application.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll get&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A remote-first and flexible work environment. Our London office (next to Old Street) is there whenever you want it. Aside from our company get-togethers, you&#39;re welcome to work wherever suits you best.&lt;/li&gt;
