&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our everyday digital experiences are in the middle of a realtime revolution: chatting alongside a livestream, getting realtime financial updates, or working with colleagues in a shared online space. Consumers now expect realtime as standard, and Ably powers a large part of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We put developers first. Our products help teams build, extend, and deliver realtime digital experiences, delivering over 700 billion messages to more than 2 billion devices every month. Teams at HubSpot, Fin, Dialpad, NASCAR, Sportsbet, and General Motors all build on Ably.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Ably means helping build the infrastructure that will shape the next generation of the internet. More of what people do online is becoming live, shared and interactive, which only makes what we build more relevant and more necessary. AI is the latest place that shows up. There&#39;s still so much to build, and we&#39;d like your help with it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thousands of developers around the world use Ably&#39;s SDKs and APIs to power realtime features in their applications. The Developer Experience team is responsible for ensuring that Ably is a platform that exemplifies great developer experience, and is a reference point that other companies aspire to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our Senior Developer Experience Writer, you’ll be contributing directly to this goal; helping developers to quickly understand Ably, build confidently and ultimately succeed with the platform. At its core, this is an AI-focussed role; you’ll be in charge of &amp;nbsp;setting up the foundations that empower engineers to produce first-class developer documentation with AI at scale. You’ll use AI to automate checks, maintain quality, and allow for rapid iteration in the content itself, as well as in the documentation platform. You’ll still be setting the standards for technical content across the business, and using your expertise to shape the information architecture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a modern take on technical writing; you’ll be using AI to both increase your own output, whilst also increasing the velocity of other contributors. The same core values still apply though - ensuring that users can quickly understand and succeed with Ably.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day to day you will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use AI to produce quality content. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll write reusable prompts and skills that docs contributors can use to ensure their content meets Ably’s quality standards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and uphold content standards&lt;/strong&gt;. You&#39;ll help define what great looks like; from docs structure and style to making sure that PRs are always exceeding standards. You’ll leverage AI to check for technical accuracy, and make sure that content always assists developers in learning and succeeding with Ably in the fastest and easiest ways possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build engaging educational content templates.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll lead by example by producing reference content that others can use as a pattern to write similar content. This will be in the format of templates and skills that team members can leverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empower engineers to write great content&lt;/strong&gt;. You&#39;ll coach and support engineering contributors to ensure that they’re always producing accurate, well-structured, developer-friendly content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion effective AI use&lt;/strong&gt;. You&#39;ll promote the use of AI for efficiency, while maintaining a sharp eye for quality ensuring content meets editorial standards, is technically accurate, and is free from AI-generated patterns that undermine trust or clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain and elevate the docs platform&lt;/strong&gt;. You&#39;ll take responsibility for shaping the documentation platform&#39;s components, structure and tooling. This includes making sure content is logically structured, and easily navigable, and that it helps external developers understand Ably in new and exciting ways.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to talk if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success creating technical content for developers, such as documentation, API references and guides; with a portfolio that others have visibly learned from.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience reviewing and giving feedback on technical writing, with the ability to coach others to improve their craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and a desire to work in an AI-forward environment. Experience in automation, working with agents and producing quality content at scale is a bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of using AI tools as a core part of your workflow for writing, research and coding, as well as understanding their output and limitations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with APIs, SDKs, and modern web development tools, with the ability to read, write and reason about code examples in at least one programming language (ideally JavaScript).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong instincts for developer experience, particularly around onboarding, and a genuine desire to produce experiences that delight developers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, self-directed mindset with the ability to take ownership of projects end to end, from ideation through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at a startup or growth-stage company, or the adaptability to thrive in a fast-paced, agile environment with a focus on rapid iteration, with excellent communication and cross-functional collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in maintaining and shaping a documentation platform or developer portal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with information architecture principles and content strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with git-driven workflows for managing content changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some knowledge or understanding of event-driven architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s it like to work at Ably?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join a team of around 60 people, working directly alongside senior engineering and leadership. No layers, no bureaucracy, and real ownership from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Remote-first&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hire the best people wherever they are across the UK and Europe, trust them to own their work, and share decisions and feedback openly. Twice a year, in February and August, we all meet in person, and we expect everyone to be there.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Remote-first comes with trade-offs. On one side: flexibility, no commute, long stretches of focus time, and a wider pool of people to hire from. On the other: it can feel isolating, relationships take effort to build, and you miss the chance conversations an office creates. As our only recruiter, you&#39;ll need to manage your own time and stay close to the hiring managers and candidates you work with.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you do your best work with trust and autonomy, this will suit you. If you&#39;d rather have an office around you every day, it probably isn&#39;t the right fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our six values shape how we work day to day:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open for all.&lt;/strong&gt; We default to sharing openly: source, decisions, and feedback, with open minds to match.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech needs humanity.&lt;/strong&gt; We build with empathy, for colleagues and developers alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Even the best do better.&lt;/strong&gt; We keep raising our own bar, driven by curiosity, not complacency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bias for action.&lt;/strong&gt; Once we know enough to act, we act, rather than waiting for certainty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dependable by default.&lt;/strong&gt; We take real ownership of what we ship and what we promise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bold creativity wins.&lt;/strong&gt; We treat big constraints as a reason to think differently, not less.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can read more about how we defined these values on &lt;a href=&quot;ably.com/blog/ably-values&quot;&gt;our blog&lt;/a&gt;, and see the team behind them on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;ably.com/careers&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Diversity, inclusion, and belonging at Ably&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe our differences as individuals are what make us great. Our people are at the heart of what we do, and we encourage everyone to be their most authentic self at Ably: we see inclusivity and openness as fundamental to our long-term success. We encourage applications from all backgrounds regardless of age, disability, gender, sexual orientation, parental status, race, religion, educational background, or neurodiversity. Ably has an amazing opportunity ahead of us, and we want anyone to be able to contribute to it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you enjoy working as part of a technology company, value open source, and love solving hard problems, we&#39;d love to hear from you, regardless of whether you fit the job description exactly or not. If in doubt, drop us an&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;a ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;email&lt;/a&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;; we&#39;re happy to give you advice on your application.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll get&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A remote-first and flexible work environment. Our London office (next to Old Street) is there whenever you want it. Aside from our company get-togethers, you&#39;re welcome to work wherever suits you best.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity. We&#39;re a growing start-up, and we want everyone to share in the company&#39;s success through our EMI share options programme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced holiday allowance: 28 days of paid annual leave (27 regular days, plus a day off to enjoy your birthday).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced parental leave, so you can spend time with your new family member: up to 16 weeks fully paid for primary caregivers and 4 weeks for secondary, depending on length of service.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home workstation budget of £500 on joining (and £150 per year after that), so your home office serves you well.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal learning and development budget of £1000 a year, plus 5% L&amp;amp;D time during working hours to build your skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private healthcare with BUPA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A medical cash plan covering a range of medical and dental costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental wellbeing coaching and counselling from Self Space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A monthly wellbeing budget via Juno.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance and income protection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Tech and Cycle to Work schemes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A weekly snack allowance for our end-of-week &quot;Need to Know&quot; meeting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fully-paid one-month sabbatical after five years with Ably.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About CAIS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;CAIS is the pioneer in democratizing access to and education about alternative investments for independent financial advisors, empowering them to engage and transact with leading asset managers on a massive scale through a wide variety of alternative investment products and technology solutions. CAIS provides financial advisors with a broad selection of alternative investment strategies, including hedge funds, private equity, private credit, real estate, digital assets, and structured notes. CAIS also delivers industry-leading technology, operational efficiency, and world-class client service throughout the pre-trade, trade, and post-trade experience. CAIS serves over 2,500 wealth management firms that support more than 65,000 financial advisors who oversee approximately $8.5 trillion in end-client assets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Backend Product Engineer to join our Capital Markets technology team in London. This is a hybrid, hands-on role: you’ll design, build and run systems across Pre-Trade, Trade and Post-Trade, covering Structured Investments, Equity IPOs, Hedging &amp;amp; Monetization, ETFs, and more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We put a lot of emphasis on the “product” in product engineer. You’ll work alongside product managers and directly with the business to turn open-ended problems into working software, and the results show up in how a fast-growing company performs. AI is a big part of how we work: the team uses it throughout the development lifecycle and has already shipped several agentic features. You’ll help build the next ones.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;We work in small, autonomous teams using &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Kanban&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt; principles of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;optimi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;z&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;ing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt; flow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt; and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt; limiting WI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;P. The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt; team owns its work together, from shaping the problem through to running it in production&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;We collaborate closely with colleagues and stakeholders in New York. Engineers own their work from shaping the problem through to running it in production.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;While we have access to QA &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;expertise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;, we consider quality to be everyone’s responsibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;, so engineers own testing too. We care about strong engineering fundamentals, especially as AI changes how we build.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You’ll mostly write Kotlin, working with Spring, Postgres, Elasticsearch and Kafka, and deploying to Kubernetes on AWS through GitHub and ArgoCD.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why join us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Real ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: you’ll shape problems with the business, not just pick up tickets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Visible impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: your work shows up directly in how a fast-growing business performs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Interesting domain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: complex, real-world problems across the full trade lifecycle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Engineering quality:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; strong fundamentals and high standards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Modern codebase:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; we’ve moved off legacy, and our systems have been built in the last few years&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience working as a software developer with Java or Kotlin server-side applications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Track record of turning business problems into working software, with a clear, measurable impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience building and running mission-critical services in production, from CI/CD through to monitoring, alerting and incident response&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong testing habits across unit, integration and end-to-end tests, with good judgment about what to test at each level&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong experience with Spring (Boot, Data, Security), relational database design, REST API design, and Kafka or a similar event streaming platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience working AI-first: using AI agents to build software, with an understanding of how LLMs work and good judgement about when to trust their output&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Technical leadership within your team, including mentoring less experienced engineers and setting and sharing engineering standards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Clear communication, including explaining technical decisions to non-engineers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Nice to have&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Financial services experience, ideally capital markets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Elasticsearch, Kubernetes, Postgres, AWS, Terraform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;TypeScript and React, and/or motivation to try full stack development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience building AI or agentic applications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;This role is a hybrid role, with at least 2-3 days spent out of our Old Street office - N1 7LB.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;CAIS is consistently recognized as a Best Place to Work, and our culture is at the heart of our success. We are committed to fostering an inclusive environment where employees can be their most authentic self and feel inspired and supported to bring their voice forward to drive community, growth, and innovation. We are an equal opportunity employer, and do not discriminate on the basis of any protected attribute, including race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, marital or veteran status, pregnancy or disability, or any other basis protected under applicable law.&amp;nbsp; Learn more about our culture, benefits, and people at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.caisgroup.com/our-company/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;https://www.caisgroup.com/our-company/careers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;CAIS’ compensation package includes a market competitive salary, a performance bonus, and exceptional benefits. If you are located in London, England, the base salary range for this role is £95,000 - £125,000. Actual compensation is influenced by a wide array of factors including but not limited to skill set, level of experience, and specific office location. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We use technology, including AI tools, to support parts of our recruitment process such as application screening, interview scheduling, and candidate communications. These tools are used to improve efficiency and consistency, but they do not replace human judgement. All hiring decisions are made by people, and we are committed to fair and unbiased assessment of every candidate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nebius Managed Kubernetes (mk8s) mission is to grow the Nebius cloud platform by providing a Kubernetes-native way to run AI systems with high efficiency and low operational overhead.&amp;nbsp;With a single click, it provides a Kubernetes cluster on top of Nebius services for compute (VMs) and networking.&amp;nbsp;In 2026, the service is scaling 10× and is expected to manage customer workloads across tens of thousands of GPU servers in more than 10 data centers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead the mk8s Core team, one of three mk8s teams. The Core team owns the API, the core of the service control plane, cluster autoscaling, platform integrations, and running k8s add-ons.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Nebius, team leads are hands-on. We expect you to be a senior or staff engineer now (or earlier in your career). You will start as an individual contributor to gain context, then take on managerial responsibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you will be responsible to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead by example.&lt;/strong&gt; Set the quality bar by spending a significant portion of your time on IC work: writing and reviewing code, leading projects, and participating in on-call rotation, incident mitigation, and post-incident analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage 4–8 mid-to-senior engineers.&lt;/strong&gt; Provide context, coach, and give regular feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain the technical vision&lt;/strong&gt; for your area of responsibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with the Product Manager and Service Owner&lt;/strong&gt; to shape product vision and plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Examples of outcomes you could drive as a Team Lead&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize the service control plane to create and manage 20K GPU nodes in a single Kubernetes cluster, enabling a major contract for the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate cluster autoscaling approaches (e.g., Karpenter) to improve resource utilization and support seamless auto-upgrades.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide a Kubernetes-native way to use local disks to reduce disk I/O bottlenecks for AI training and inference, improving efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver managed Layer 7 load balancers to reduce operational overhead for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will bring to the table:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional software engineering or management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of Golang, or you are ready to quickly switch to this programming language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise with&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-month technical projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech leading engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning multi-month technical projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It would be an added bonus if you had:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Team management, Kubernetes administration, Developing Kubernetes controller.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;#LI-ET3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
