&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Anaplan, we are a team of innovators focused on optimizing business decision-making through our leading AI-infused scenario planning and analysis platform so our customers can outpace their competition and the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What unites Anaplanners across teams and geographies is our collective commitment to our customers’ success and to our Winning Culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;Our customers rank among the who’s who in the Fortune 50. Coca-Cola, LinkedIn, Adobe, LVMH and Bayer are just a few of the 2,400+ global companies who rely on our best-in-class platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;Our Winning Culture is the engine that drives our teams of innovators. We champion diversity of thought and ideas, we behave like leaders regardless of title, we are committed to achieving ambitious goals, and we love celebrating&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;our wins – big and small.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supported by operating principles of being strategy-led, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anaplan.com/careers/&quot;&gt;values&lt;/a&gt;-based and disciplined in execution, you’ll be inspired, connected, developed and rewarded here. Everything that makes you unique is welcome; join us and let’s build what’s next - together!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anaplan is seeking an &lt;strong&gt;ENTERPRISE ACCOUNT EXECUTIVE &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;focused on Financial Services&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, to drive its growth and expand its presence in the London area.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will take your proven track record of selling sophisticated technology solutions and account management to sell an incredibly versatile platform to the most strategic Banks and Insurance companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our sales team is helping industry leaders understand the impact of Anaplan products and how our connected planning solution is ending siloed decision-making. You will help our customers achieve their immediate business goals while setting their business up for the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting directly to the RVP of Sales, this type of territory requires someone to further build our footprint by hunting and locking in new strategic logos as well as rapidly growing opportunities within the current customer base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engaging with targeted prospects to identify broken business processes and position Anaplan’s unique ability to solve the problem,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Anaplan’s business value throughout the selling engagement. Navigating sophisticated prospect environments to align the prospect around the Anaplan solution,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct highly effective presentations from Director through SVP and key C-suite level decision makers including CFOs, CROs, and senior leaders in supply chain, workforce, and other business functions,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop customers and own opportunity management start-to-finish across multiple customer targets and functions,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply Anaplan’s value-based selling methodology and tools to run sales processes and accurately forecast business,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employ outstanding account leadership skills to identify account expansion opportunities by cross-selling and up-selling opportunities within targeted accounts,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform strategic sales planning, leading to accurate forecasting of the business,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with cross-functional members of Sales Development Reps, Marketing, Solution Consultants, and the Customer Success teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience and network in Financial services: Banks, Insurance companies, Investment funds, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in consultative sales to Fortune 2000 companies, ideally in SaaS solutions (but not required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&#39;Hunter&#39; with a strong growth mindset, motivated by developing new business essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shown success selling into Vice President / Senior Vice President buyers,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of overachieving sales quota &amp;amp; targets, including demonstrated history of multiple high six-figure annual contract value (ACV) deals (services and/or software),&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated network in your industry territory, with a mix of some customers and implementation partners,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience with sophisticated partner &amp;amp; internal team organizations,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain understanding (Supply Chain, FP&amp;amp;A, Workforce Planning &amp;amp; Sales) and knowledge of how these functions plan, process work and make decisions,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong, demonstrated opportunity management practices (e.g. sales process, qualification, executive presentation skills, quote presentation and negotiation), and ability to balance multiple (3-5) opportunities at once,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business, Finance, Economics, related BS/BA degree or relevant years of experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Outreach, SFDC, LinkedIn Sales Navigator a plus,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Account Planning experience Altify, MEDDPICC, Miller Heiman.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity, Equity, Inclusion and Belonging (DEIB) &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe attracting and retaining the best talent and fostering an inclusive culture strengthens our business. DEIB improves our workforce, enhances trust with our partners and customers, and drives business success. Build your career in a place where diversity, equity, inclusion and belonging aren’t just words on paper – this is what drives our innovation, it’s how we connect, and it contributes to what makes us a market leader. We believe in a hiring and working environment where all people are respected and valued, regardless of gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, ethnicity, age, neurodiversity, disability status, citizenship, or any other aspect which makes people unique. We hire you for who you are, and we want you to bring your authentic self to work every day! &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will ensure that individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to participate in the job application or interview process, perform essential job functions, and receive equitable benefits and all privileges of employment. Please contact us to request accommodation. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud Recruitment Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It has come to our attention that fraudulent and fictitious job opportunities are being circulated on the Internet. Prospective candidates are being contacted by certain individuals, mainly through telephone calls, emails and correspondence, claiming they are representatives of Anaplan. The main purpose of these correspondences and announcements is to obtain privileged information from individuals.  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anaplan does not: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend offers to candidates without an extensive interview process with a member of our recruitment team and a hiring manager via video or in person.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Send job offers via email. All offers are first extended verbally by a member of our internal recruitment team whenever possible and then followed up via written communication. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All emails from Anaplan would come from an ----- email address. Should you have any doubts about the authenticity of an email, letter or telephone communication purportedly from, for, or on behalf of Anaplan, please send an email to ----- before taking any further action in relation to the correspondence.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW36347262 BCX0&quot;&gt;Privacy &amp;amp; AI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW36347262 BCX0&quot;&gt; Notice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt;andidate data processed during our recruitment activities is handled &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt;in accordance with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt; our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anaplan.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This may include the use of artificial intelligence or automated tools to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt;assist&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt; our team in evaluating qualifications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Strategy &amp;amp; Operations Associate/ Senior Associate to join our New Country Launches team. This is a hands-on, high-impact role: you&#39;ll be on the ground (sometimes literally) building the operational backbone of new markets we&#39;re launching - and then helping those teams scale fast, without ever losing sight of the patient at the other end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone with 2-5 years of experience in high-growth start-ups, consulting, or operations, who&#39;s eager to take on cross-functional challenges and thrives on the ambiguity of &quot;there&#39;s no playbook yet - let&#39;s build one.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work closely with customer care, medical teams, commercial, product, and operational leadership to support design of new operational teams from the ground up, get them running smoothly, and scale them rapidly across new countries - all while ensuring exceptional care for our patients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the end-to-end setup of new operational teams in newly launched countries - from designing workflows and org structure to getting teams live and running.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with customer care, medical, commercial, and product teams to make sure every new market launches with the right processes, tools, and people in place from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data to spot bottlenecks, trends, and opportunities across new and scaling markets, and turn those insights into clear, actionable recommendations for leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement operational processes that let new country teams scale quickly without sacrificing quality or patient care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own KPI tracking and performance reporting for newly launched markets, giving leadership real-time visibility into how each launch is progressing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build repeatable playbooks and frameworks from each launch so every subsequent country launch is faster and smoother than the last.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel occasionally to support teams in-market during critical launch phases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Who you are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-5 years of experience in consulting, start-up operations, generalist operations, or a similarly analytical and fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional analytical and problem-solving skills; you&#39;re comfortable working with data and using it to inform decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with an ability to work across different teams and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter mentality with a bias to action—you’re proactive, resourceful, and don’t wait to be told what to do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in ambiguity and are excited to work in a rapidly evolving, mission-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with occasional travel to support new country launches in-market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Looker, SQL or other data visualisation and analysis tools are a bonus but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous stock option plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid role based in London Bridge 3 days a week with lunch once a week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness and gym benefit with WellHub&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holidays, plus bank holidays, and generous parental leave &amp;amp; flexible working policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work and Electric Car salary sacrifice schemes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About ROLLER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ROLLER is not your average software-as-a-service company. With a global presence in over 30 countries, we&#39;re here to bring some excitement to the leisure and attractions industry and make a difference! Our mission is to help businesses operate smoothly and create fun and memorable guest experiences by providing seamless ticketing, point-of-sale, self-serve kiosks, memberships and digital waiver processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But here&#39;s the best part: our team. We&#39;re a group of 300+ highly passionate, enthusiastic, and down-to-earth professionals located all around the world who are all working together to build something truly remarkable. We&#39;re aiming high and believe that the possibilities are endless. As we continue to grow globally, we&#39;re excited to write our success story and have fun along the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We genuinely love what we do, and we&#39;re looking for like-minded people to join us on this amazing journey. If you&#39;re ready to be part of a dynamic team and make a real impact, come aboard, and let&#39;s create some unforgettable experiences together at ROLLER!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Solution Engineer owns the end-to-end pre-sales process at ROLLER, commercial and technical. You partner with Account Executives to qualify, progress, and earn new business, while simultaneously running the technical validation that gives prospects the confidence to buy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What sets a ROLLER SE apart is the combination. You carry the commercial rigour of a quota-carrying rep; MEDDICC discipline, value-based discovery, and business case ownership alongside the technical credibility to design and deliver compelling solutions. On the most complex deals, you&#39;ll have access to a Solution Architect as a force multiplier, which frees you to stay focused on the commercial motion where you create the most value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role you will support ROLLER&#39;s growth across the French market, engaging prospects and customers in French while collaborating with our wider EMEA and global teams in English.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion MEDDICC qualification across your pipeline: identifying Economic Buyers, mapping Decision Criteria and Process, surfacing Implicated Pain, and maintaining a clear, honest view of deal health at all times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical &amp;amp; value based discovery with prospects, diagnosing operational and revenue pain points and connecting them explicitly to the value ROLLER delivers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical pre-sales process: running tailored product demonstrations, managing technical validation, and handling integration and configuration questions across the standard deal motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In support with the AE, and our Business Value Consultant, present ROI-led business cases framed in the language of the Economic Buyer; revenue growth, cost reduction, and operational efficiency, not feature lists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own competitive positioning in live deals, handling objections and neutralising competitor narratives with confidence and evidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Account Executives on deal strategy, account planning, and executive engagement — presenting alongside them to C-suite stakeholders when the deal calls for it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage Solution Architects on your most complex, high-value opportunities. You&#39;ll brief them in, stay close to the commercial thread, and ensure technical depth doesn&#39;t slow the deal down&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to RFPs and RFIs, owning the commercial and functional positioning while leveraging SA support on technically deep sections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Customer Success on expansion and upsell motions with existing customers, applying the same qualification and value-selling approach to growth as to new logo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clean pipeline and activity data in Salesforce, contributing to forecast accuracy and deal visibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed commercial insights; win patterns, loss reasons, and competitive intelligence back to Sales leadership to sharpen the overall motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must be a C1 fluent French speaker.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent in English (written and verbal), with the ability to communicate confidently with internal teams and stakeholders across EMEA and globally.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel may be required up to 30%.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in a Solution Engineer, Sales Engineer, or commercial pre-sales role within a SaaS company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, practised familiarity with MEDDICC or an equivalent qualification methodology. You use it as a daily operating lens, not an occasional reference&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine commercial instinct: you think in business outcomes and ROI, and you can articulate ROLLER&#39;s value in terms that resonate with a CFO or Head of Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical confidence to run demos, handle product and integration questions, and manage a standard technical evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build and present business cases to economic buyers, including at the executive level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong discovery skills. You ask the questions that open up a deal, surface real pain, and expose the risks that could kill it later&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive and driven. You want to win, and you know how to build a case that does&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence and communication: credible in a boardroom, compelling on a screen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce as your CRM of record&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with value or solution selling frameworks (Command of the Message, Challenger, SCIPAB) is a strong advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in leisure, attractions, hospitality, or entertainment is a plus, but commercial instinct and methodology matter most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with API concepts and standard integration patterns, enough to have an informed conversation without an SA in the room&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to ROLLER&#39;s product categories: ticketing, POS, memberships, waivers, self-serve kiosks, payments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with API integrations and API development tools such as Postman and Swagger&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in pre-sale (Solution Architecture, Solution Engineering, Sales) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the leisure and attractions industry is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re tech-savvy and quick to learn new systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your time and resource management skills, combined with a sharp attention to detail, set you up for success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re genuine, grounded, and value authentic interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re self-motivated and thrive in an autonomous work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know how to take ownership, manage multiple projects simultaneously, and effectively prioritize day-to-day tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable in fast-paced, evolving environments and adapt quickly to change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring a process-driven mindset with a focus on efficiency, scalability, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You get to work on a category-leading product that customers love in a fun, high-growth industry- check our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.capterra.com/p/164715/ROLLER/reviews/&quot;&gt;Capterra&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.g2.com/products/roller-software/reviews#reviews&quot;&gt;G2&lt;/a&gt; reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team member Assistance Program to proactively support our team&#39;s health and wellbeing - access to coaching, education modules, weekly webinars, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly flexible work environment with an All Access pass to WeWork depending on your location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a driven, fun, and switched-on team that likes to raise the bar in all we do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Successful applicants will be required to complete a background check (including criminal history) prior to commencement of employment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-hybrid&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About ROLLER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ROLLER isn’t your average SaaS company. We operate globally across 30+ countries, powering millions of real-world experiences in the leisure and attractions industry. What we build doesn’t just live on a screen. It shows up in busy venues, peak weekends, and unforgettable moments for guests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is simple but ambitious: help operators run better businesses while creating great guest experiences. That means solving complex, real-world problems across ticketing, point of sale, self-service, memberships, kiosks, and digital waivers, all at meaningful scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Just as importantly, it’s the people. We’re a team of 300+ smart, grounded, and genuinely passionate humans working across the globe. We care about quality, ownership, and doing work we’re proud of, without taking ourselves too seriously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re growing fast, aiming high, and building something that matters. If you want to work on real problems, with real customers, alongside people who care deeply about their craft and impact, ROLLER is a great place to do it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Enjoy This Role!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Work that keeps venues trading -&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll own fiscal and regulatory compliance across Europe. If it’s wrong, a venue can’t legally trade, so getting it right matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤝&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Your squad owns it -&lt;/strong&gt; Squads are self-managing. The London squad owns localisation and compliance for Europe end to end, and you’ll work with your PM to decide what gets built, how it’s built and when it ships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Real scale, real consequences -&lt;/strong&gt; Thousands of requests per second across hundreds of containers, powering over 100 million guest experiences in 2025 alone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✨&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Help shape a growing team -&lt;/strong&gt; Be one of the first engineers in London, set how the squad works, and help new engineers get up to speed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ROLLER is growing fast across Europe, and every new market brings its own rules on tax, invoicing, receipts and language. Our London squad makes sure venues in those markets can trade legally and run in their own language. Recent work includes fiscal compliance for markets like France, Germany and Austria, and AI-assisted translations across the platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a small London squad reporting to a London based Tech Lead. Our HQ is in Australia, so most of your work with the wider team is async, with live time together every week or two. You’ll be comfortable owning your work, unblocking yourself and finding your own ways to stay connected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our backend runs on C#, .NET, T-SQL and AWS services including Lambda, API Gateway, DynamoDB, S3, SES and SQS. On the front end, we use Angular alongside our own design system and component library.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build and ship changes across backend services, APIs and the Angular interfaces venues use every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build patterns for regional rules and compliance that we can extend to new markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own integrations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead integration-heavy work with third-party providers, like fiscal and certification partners: define the contract, handle the edge cases and plan for failure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with those providers when something needs chasing or clarifying&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own production&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the SRE team to monitor system performance and proactively identify potential issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triage compliance alerts and fix the root cause&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the bar&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share what you know through code reviews, pairing and honest feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with your PM to break vague regulatory requirements into small, shippable pieces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a high appetite for Technology and AI and a natural curiosity for how it can transform your work. You’re comfortable using AI tools to automate repetitive &#39;busy work,&#39; freeing you up to focus on high-impact work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid mid-level or senior experience building and shipping full-stack software in a SaaS product company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep backend experience in C# and .NET, and enough Angular or TypeScript to work across the stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of cloud patterns, application and database performance, with experience applying them to varying workflows and workloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve built integrations with third-party systems where the details matter: payments, tax, invoicing, compliance or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can take a vague requirement, like a new country’s tax rules, and turn it into something shipped&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You do your best work async: you write things down clearly, unblock yourself and don’t need constant check-ins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bonus points for experience with European fiscal rules, or for speaking French or German. You don’t need to match every point.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe AI is a career-defining inflection point. ROLLER is a fast adopter of new technology like AI, and every team member is empowered to own their learning and use the latest tools to supercharge their impact. We’re looking for candidates with the proficiency and curiosity to embrace AI and technology, not just as a technical skill, but as a core competency to help us achieve big goals. Our engineers use Claude and other AI coding tools day to day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;You get to work on a category-leading product that customers love in a fun, high-growth industry - check our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.capterra.com/p/164715/ROLLER/reviews/&quot;&gt;Capterra&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.g2.com/products/roller-software/reviews#reviews&quot;&gt;G2&lt;/a&gt; reviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏥&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Private medical insurance through Vitality, plus dental cover.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💷&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Company pension.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🛡️&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Life insurance at 4x your base salary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💙&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Team member Assistance Program to proactively support our team’s health and wellbeing - access to coaching, education modules, weekly webinars, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍼&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;16 weeks paid Parental Leave for primary carers and 4 weeks paid Parental Leave for secondary carers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎉&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Engage in our ‘Vibe Tribe’ - led by our team members; you can contribute to company-wide initiatives directly. Regular events and social activities, fundraising &amp;amp; cause-related campaigns... you name it. We’re willing to make it happen!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💡&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Work with a driven, fun, and switched-on team that likes to raise the bar in all we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Go on, hit apply. Let’s build great tech together. If you’ve got questions, don’t be afraid to reach out to Reuben at -----
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:280}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;is a global product design and technology company, with a diversified portfolio of 5-star rated lifestyle solutions that positively&amp;nbsp;impact&amp;nbsp;people’s lives in homes around the world. &lt;strong&gt;Powered by two trusted, global brands, Shark and Ninja&lt;/strong&gt;, the company has a proven&amp;nbsp;track record&amp;nbsp;of bringing disruptive innovation to market and developing one consumer product after another has allowed&amp;nbsp;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;to enter multiple product categories, driving significant growth and market share gains. Headquartered in Needham, Massachusetts with more than&amp;nbsp;4,100&amp;nbsp;associates, the company’s products are sold at key retailers, online and offline, and through distributors around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI at SharkNinja &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SharkNinja, we’re building an AI-native culture. We’re not waiting for the future; we’re creating it. Our people are expected to experiment boldly, adopt new tools, and continuously raise what’s possible to create meaningful impact for our consumers. If you believe the best way to do your job hasn’t been invented yet, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Based remotely and reporting to the Sr. Vice President, Global Logistics, the Senior Manager, Continuous Improvement will play a critical leadership role in driving cost savings, service improvement, and operational excellence across SharkNinja&#39;s Operations organization. This individual will own the visibility, governance, and execution of initiatives that reduce cost, improve service, and unlock scalable efficiency across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This role partners cross-functionally with Operations, Supply Chain, Logistics, Finance, Sales, Planning, and other key stakeholders to identify, prioritize, and deliver high-impact opportunities across the Operations expense base. The Senior Manager will own the Operations Efficiency project portfolio, ensuring initiatives are clearly defined, delivered on time, financially validated, and incorporated into forecast updates in partnership with Finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This is a highly visible, hands-on role for a strategic operator who can move seamlessly from executive-level portfolio management to deep analytical problem solving and cross-functional execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Travel required (domestic &amp;amp; international) – up to 20%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Flexible work schedule to accommodate virtual meetings with other regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Operations Efficiency Agenda&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead the Operations Efficiency program across SharkNinja, serving as the central owner for cost savings, service improvement, and continuous improvement initiatives across the Operations expense base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Develop and manage the Operations Efficiency project portfolio, including opportunity identification, business case development, initiative prioritization, execution tracking, risk management, and benefits realization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Establish clear governance, routines, and reporting mechanisms to ensure initiatives remain on track, roadblocks are escalated quickly, and leaders have visibility to progress, savings, and risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Act as a thought partner to Operations leadership by identifying where cost, service, process, or organizational improvements can unlock meaningful business value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Cost Savings and Service Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Identify opportunities to reduce Operations Expense while maintaining or improving service levels, customer experience, and operational reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Partner with Global Logistics to deeply understand distribution, transportation, delivery, warehousing, carrier, and network cost drivers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead cross-functional workstreams focused on improving cost-to-serve, delivery efficiency, network utilization, freight optimization, accessorial management, productivity, and service performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Translate data and operational insights into actionable recommendations, business cases, and execution plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Challenge existing ways of working and bring a continuous improvement mindset to how SharkNinja scales operations with speed, agility, and discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Cross-Functionally to Deliver Results&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with Operations, Supply Chain, Finance, Sales, Planning, Consumer Experience, and other business partners to identify and execute opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build strong working relationships with Finance to ensure savings methodologies are aligned, benefits are validated, and impacts are reflected in forecast updates, budgets, and financial reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Create transparency across initiative owners, milestones, financial impacts, dependencies, and risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Influence without authority across a fast-moving, matrixed organization, ensuring teams are aligned around common goals and accountable for delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Bring structured problem-solving, Lean, Six Sigma, or similar continuous improvement methods to complex operational challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Identify root causes of cost increases, service misses, process inefficiencies, and operational friction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Develop scalable processes, playbooks, and tools that improve how SharkNinja identifies, manages, and delivers efficiency opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Create a culture of ownership, accountability, and speed in delivering operational improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate is a high-energy, analytical, commercially minded operator who thrives in a fast-paced environment — equally comfortable building an executive-ready savings roadmap, digging into logistics cost drivers, challenging assumptions, aligning Finance on benefit validation, and pushing cross-functional teams to deliver. This person brings a &quot;CEO mindset&quot; to Operations Expense: seeing the full picture, owning outcomes, making tradeoffs, driving accountability, and relentlessly pursuing better ways to deliver cost, service, and operational performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;7+ years of experience in Operations, Supply Chain, Logistics, Continuous Improvement, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience in consumer products, retail, eCommerce, durable goods, or high-growth global operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience leading cost reduction, operational efficiency, productivity, or transformation initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of logistics, distribution, transportation, warehousing, delivery operations, and cost-to-serve drivers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience managing a portfolio of cross-functional initiatives with multiple owners, timelines, dependencies, and financial impacts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proven ability to partner with Finance on savings validation, forecasting, budgeting, or financial performance tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to turn complex data into clear insights, recommendations, and action plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience influencing cross-functional stakeholders and senior leaders in a fast-paced, matrixed environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Background in Lean, Six Sigma, Kaizen, process improvement, or operational excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proficient in Microsoft Project, Excel, PowerPoint, and Visio; experience with ERP/WMS/eCommerce platforms (e.g., SAP, Oracle, Shopify, Salesforce Commerce Cloud) a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; An undergraduate degree from a respected college/university, ideally in a discipline relevant to supply chain (e.g., Supply Chain Management or Engineering). A Master&#39;s degree in Business Administration or a technical discipline is not required but will further differentiate the ideal candidate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Culture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At SharkNinja, we don’t just raise the bar—we push past it every single day. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Outrageously Extraordinary mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; drives us to tackle the impossible, push boundaries, and deliver results that others only dream of. If you thrive on breaking out of your swim lane, you’ll be right at home.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We offer competitive health insurance, retirement plans, paid time off, employee stock purchase options, wellness programs, SharkNinja product discounts, and more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We empower your personal and professional growth &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;with high impact Learning Programs featuring bold voices redefining what’s possible. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When you join, you’re not just part of a company—you’re part of an outrageously extraordinary community. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;gether, we won’t just launch products—&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;we’ll disrupt entire markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At SharkNinja, Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion are vital to our global success. Valuing each unique voice and blending all of our diverse skills strengthens SharkNinja’s innovation every day. We support ALL associates in bringing their authentic selves to work, making an impact, and having the opportunity for career acceleration. With help from our leadership, associates, and our community, we aim to have equity be a key component of the SharkNinja DNA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Learn more about us:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sharkninja.com/dei&quot;&gt; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/sharkninja/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Life At SharkNinja&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLmRfBxyGu_mKl9SF12lM1NAIx-z07uLNQ&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Outrageously Extraordinary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:336}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
